INSERT INTO `address_feedback` VALUES (1,'Ivan Ivanov','test@test.com','+1 (999) 999-9999','Major Alteration/Addition','bcxg bgfd hgrfdh dfgh rgyhtgfu h\n \nhgfd\n hfg\nh \nfdg\nh',1,'2021-10-18 20:08:50','2021-10-18 20:40:45',NULL),(2,'Test Test','test2@test.com','+1 (888) 888-8888','New Construction','hbgfdb fdghb fdg fd',1,'2021-10-18 20:49:12','2021-11-02 21:11:04',NULL),(3,'Michael Patrick','michael@esthubinc.com','+1 (281) 509-9327','General Contractor','Hi, \n\nI hope you are doing the perfect thing.\n\nOur construction estimator experts give specialized guidance for general contractors, subcontractors, architects and owners in order to help you win further bids. It is critical that your cost estimate is right in order to retain your customer.\n\nWe have more than just price consulting for our customers. We are here to help you with design forecasts and quantity takeoffs, no matter what step of a project you are in.\n\nWe have fine-tuned our methods to provide cost estimates for construction for the following:\n\n· Concrete takeoff services\n\n· Masonry takeoff services\n\n· Drywall takeoff services\n\n· Insulation takeoff services\n\n· Roofing takeoff services\n\n· Doors & windows takeoff services\n\n· Flooring takeoff services\n\n· Painting takeoff services\n\n· Electric fixtures services\n\n· Plumbing fixtures service\n\n· Much more services\n\nIf you have any project to estimate and state the scope of the work, please provide us with the drawings (PDF format/ or any link to the drawin',1,'2021-10-21 16:44:46','2021-11-02 21:10:57',NULL),(4,'Unessa Navia','hello@5cvirtualsolution.com','+1 (904) 685-6366','Other','Hi there,\n\nI hope you are well! My name is Unessa and I own a Virtual Assistant Agency. We have been helping several businesses including construction and home remodeling companies, architects and interior designers by providing a virtual assistant who can attend to their needs. \n\nPlease know that we can help you not only with social media management to increase your presence online, we can also help you with administrative tasks, accounting and with call answering service. \n\nDelegate tasks that gets a chunk of your time so you can attend to far more important things. We are here to help. For only $7/hr, get a virtual assistant today.\n\nYou may visit our website to learn more about us at www.5cvas.com\n\nBest Regards,\nUnessa Navia',1,'2021-10-22 12:45:59','2021-11-02 21:11:10',NULL),(5,'Tim Miller','miller.ustopestimators@gmail.com','+1 (347) 331-0929','Other','Hello, \n\nWe have very professional practice for preparing takeoffs and estimates. First of all we produced the quantities takeoffs with the certified software against each trade and division. After that we\'ll incorporate the standard pricing for Labor & Material exactly according to the location and the region. Our charges are 25% less as compared to others. We\'ll also provide you with the color coded drawings/PDF (software backup file) and you can double verify the produced takeoffs at your end. Please provide us with the drawings and specifications. We\'ll write you with the quote and turnaround in at our earliest convenience.',1,'2021-10-22 17:53:27','2021-11-02 21:11:14',NULL),(6,'David O’Brien','david@nycivilestimatinginc.com','+1 (977) 733-389','Other','We provide Estimating services for construction jobs and we can help by taking care of your take-offs and estimates for all construction divisions - so you can focus on execution.\n\nWhat We Propose:\n\nAccurate BOQ’s and precise figures.\nCompetitive service charges.\nFast turnaround time will assure that you’re ready for bid day.\nReliable Customer Support\n\nJust send us the construction plans along with the scope of work and we will get back to you with our service proposal which will contain our service charges and turnaround time.\n\nOnce you approve that then we will schedule the project and our experienced estimators will prepare a detailed bill of materials for your project.\n\nPlease contact us if you have any questions.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you soon.',1,'2021-10-22 18:58:27','2021-11-02 21:11:17',NULL),(7,'Steven Baglio','Groganlg@gmail.com','+1 (908) 601-8084','Interior Remodeling','Good Evening,\nWe are interested in having you come and give us a quote.\nWe want to do many projects to modernize our house. \n-master bath\n-living room ceiling snd fire place\n-open up family room/ living room\n-guest bathroom \n-house  lighting \n-closet doors\nEtc. \nthank you,\nLindsey',1,'2021-10-25 02:31:14','2021-11-03 20:41:35',NULL),(8,'Steven Baglio','Groganlg@gmail.com','+1 (909) 801-8084','Interior Remodeling','Good Evening,\nWe are interested in having you come and give us a quote.\nWe want to do many projects to modernize our house. \n-master bath\n-living room ceiling snd fire place\n-open up family room/ living room\n-guest bathroom \n-house  lighting \n-closet doors\nEtc. \nthank you,\nLindsey',1,'2021-10-25 02:32:36','2021-11-03 20:19:30',NULL),(9,'Pamela Coupey','tarjacoupey@yahoo.com.br',NULL,'Other','Hi there! I\'m Pamela, architect from Brazil, and I\'m looking for job opportunities in the US as I intend to work abroad and have an international experience. Besides, my boyfriend is American and I want to marry him. :)\nPlease tell me if you are interested in working with a Brazilian good spirits hard working architect and the documents you need. Just for your information, I have an English proficiency proof if you need it.\n\nWish you all the best and all the deals.\n\nkind regards,\nPamela',1,'2021-11-02 16:25:56','2021-11-03 20:19:16',NULL),(10,'Chris Paul','chris.usatopestimator@gmail.com','+1 (347) 331-0929','New Construction','Hi,\n\nWe are an estimation services providing company. We do estimation for both residential and commercial projects and cover every trade you wish to bid. We are giving a 25% discount on the first estimate with a money back guarantee. Let me know if you need estimation for your upcoming projects. May you ask for our samples, charges, turnaround time or more information about our company? Or please send us the plans or link to any FTP site. Thanks',1,'2021-11-02 22:34:05','2021-11-03 20:19:17',NULL),(11,'John Romney','info@thefranchisecreatornetwork.com','+1 (305) 222-2201','Interior Design','Hi, I’ve been trying to get in touch with you via store but it’s been difficult to get in touch with ownership. My name is John Romney, VP of Development with Franchise Creator. I’m reaching out to you because I came across your business online and I absolutely love the branded concept for franchising. In the last ten years Franchise Creator has helped over 500 brands go to market and grow through franchising and I believe your business has tremendous potential for nationwide expansion through franchising. Whenever your time permits, I would love to connect with you on a 15-min introductory call to introduce you to our program which can not only help you turn the business into a franchise but more importantly, go-to-market and help you sell franchises.\nFor your convenience, please feel free to email me directly or to easily book the best date and time for the proposed call click on the following live calendar link: https://calendly.com/johnromney/fc-development-cf-intro-call\nI look forward to connecting with you.\nBest,\nJohn Romney | Franchise Creator\nVP of Development\n1-305-222-2201\njohn@franchisecreator.com',1,'2021-11-04 09:55:36','2021-11-12 03:21:10',NULL),(12,'Wilder Orinda','allproestimation12@gmail.com','+1 (356) 364-446','Other','Hi,\n\nWe provide estimation services at very competitive prices in the industry.\n\nWe are the best in the market with rates starting from $200 only.\n\nOur qualified and professional estimators can accurately detail the \n\nmaterial takeoffs and cost estimates for your upcoming building projects.\n\n\n•             Division 01 — General Requirement\n•             Division 02 — Site Construction\n•             Division 03 — Concrete\n•             Division 04 — Masonry\n•             Division 05 — Electrical\n•             Division 06 — Special Construction and much more.\n\n\nSend us your project drawings through emails and we will get back to you in 24 hours with a proposal.\n\nKind Regards,\n\nWilder Orinda\nProject Estimator\nAll Pro Estimation LLC. 	 \nServing in all States of America, Canada, the UK, New Zealand, and Australia.',0,'2021-11-12 15:36:36','2021-11-12 15:36:36',NULL),(13,'Zain ul haq','dreamdesigner909@gmail.com',NULL,'Other','Hi,\n i\'m a Architectural 3D visual artist. having 5 to 6 year of experience in this field. i want to work with you if you are willing. if you want to seen my portfolio then contact me through Email.\n\nthanks regards.',0,'2021-11-14 13:41:13','2021-11-14 13:41:13',NULL),(14,'Reuben Alfred','reuben.mozwebmedia@gmail.com','+1 (773) 453-2244','Other','Hello,\nI found your details on Google and I have looked at your website and realized your website is in a great design but your website ranking is not good for all search engines Google, Yahoo, and Bing.\nWe can place your website on Google\'s 1st page. Yahoo, Bing, and all search engines.\nMay I send you a SEO Packages and price list? If interested.\nThanks & regards,\nReuben Alfred',0,'2021-11-16 17:12:59','2021-11-16 17:12:59',NULL),(15,'Lisa R','info@marketingguruco.com','+1 (888) 710-4932','Other','We are an LA based white label agency for a few larger SEO companies and I wanted to extend this resource to you. Our marketing program is affordable at $199-499/mo and on a month to month retainer. Here is a link to review our packages http://marketingguruco.com/page/marketing-strategy. Please email me back if you are interested in having us offer this service to you or your clients.',0,'2021-11-21 01:17:46','2021-11-21 01:17:46',NULL),(16,'Lisa R','info@marketingguruco.com','+1 (888) 710-4932','Other','We are an LA based white label agency for a few larger SEO companies and I wanted to extend this resource to you. Our marketing program is affordable at $199-499/mo and on a month to month retainer. Here is a link to review our packages http://marketingguruco.com/page/marketing-strategy. Please email me back if you are interested in having us offer this service to you or your clients.',0,'2021-11-21 01:19:54','2021-11-21 01:19:54',NULL),(17,'Wilder Orinda','allproestimation12@gmail.com','+1 (356) 364-446','New Construction','Dear Clients,\n\nAre you concerned about the high cost of getting accurate estimates? So don\'t panic We are professional quantity surveyors with extensive experience in the field of construction estimation. With ample experience, We can help you out with any kind of Residential, Commercial, or Auditorium Building Material Takeoff & Construction Cost Estimation. We have done 5000+ projects & We can assure you, you are just one click away from winning your bid.\n\nWe can provide cost estimation for all trades as per CSI Codes with 99% accuracy in a very short turnaround. \n\n01. General Contractor\n02. Commercial\n03. Residential\n04. Architect\n05. Home Builder\n06. Plumbing\n07. Electrical\n08. Concrete\n09. Drywall\n10. Kitchen\n11. Landscape\n12. Painting\n13. Masonry\n14. Remodeling\n15. Demolition and Whatever you like\n\nWe function on both kinds of projects (English and French).\n\nPlease forward us the design and We would be very glad to provide you with the proposal for fee and turnaround. (PROPOSAL IS FREE)\n\nGratitude You,\n\nWilder Orinda\nProject Estimator\nAll-Pro Estimation LLC.\nServing in All States of UK, USA, Canada, New Zealand, and Australia.',0,'2021-11-22 14:36:35','2021-11-22 14:36:35',NULL),(18,'Kylene Austin','kylene.austin@gmail.com','+1 (914) 417-5994','Architectural Permits and Violations','Hi - I am planning an update of my kitchen.  The footprint will not change.  However, I would like to add some additional electrical outlets and to add a dishwasher.  The kitchen already includes a combo washer/dryer.',0,'2021-11-23 20:11:24','2021-11-23 20:11:24',NULL),(19,'Test','test@test.com','+1 (999) 999-9999','Architectural Permits and Violations','Test',0,'2021-11-25 19:22:38','2021-11-25 19:22:38',NULL),(20,'Test','test@test.com','+1 (999) 999-9999','Architectural Permits and Violations','Test',0,'2021-11-25 19:24:09','2021-11-25 19:24:09',NULL),(21,'Test','test@test.com','+1 (999) 999-9999','Architectural Permits and Violations','Test',0,'2021-11-25 19:25:23','2021-11-25 19:25:23',NULL),(22,'Test','test@test.com','+1 (999) 999-9999','Architectural Permits and Violations','Testfbvfd\nvfd\ngv\nfdgv\nfd\n\n\nvsfzdvf\ndbv\nfdb\nf\ndvb',0,'2021-11-25 19:26:25','2021-11-25 19:26:25',NULL),(23,'Kelly Andrews','kellyandrewsmkt@gmail.com','+1 (201) 201-2012','General Contractor','Hi\nYour website\'s design is absolutely brilliant. The visuals really enhance your message and the content compels action. I have forwarded it to a few of my contacts who I think could benefit from your services.\n\nWhen I was looking at your website, though, I noticed a slight issue re: your SEO that I thought you might not be aware of. It is a relatively simple fix. Would you like me to write it up so that you can share it with your web team? If this is a priority, I can also get on a call.\n\nRegards,\nKelly Andrews',0,'2021-11-29 06:41:16','2021-11-29 06:41:16',NULL),(24,'Kelly Andrews','kellyandrewsmkt@gmail.com','+1 (201) 201-2012','General Contractor','Hi\nYour website\'s design is absolutely brilliant. The visuals really enhance your message and the content compels action. I have forwarded it to a few of my contacts who I think could benefit from your services.\n\nWhen I was looking at your website, though, I noticed a slight issue re: your SEO that I thought you might not be aware of. It is a relatively simple fix. Would you like me to write it up so that you can share it with your web team? If this is a priority, I can also get on a call.\n\nRegards,\nKelly Andrews',0,'2021-11-29 06:56:38','2021-11-29 06:56:38',NULL),(25,'Michael Bradley','mb.topestimatorsinc@gmail.com','+1 (347) 331-0929','Other','Hello,\n \nDo you have any project for Estimation/Take-offs? We will provide you On-time delivery, affordable rates, and quality are the prime attributes of our services. We do Estimation for both commercial and residential projects for the last 16 years. We\'ll also provide you with the color coded drawings/PDF and you can double verify the produced takeoffs at your end. Ask for Samples Or Please send us the plans or link to get an economical quote.',0,'2021-12-03 10:16:47','2021-12-03 10:16:47',NULL),(26,'Michael Bradley','mb.topestimatorsinc@gmail.com','+1 (347) 331-0929','Other','Hi,\n \nWe are an estimation services providing company. We provide Cost Estimation & Quantities Take-Off services for General As well as for Sub-contractors (Painting, Electrical, Roofing, HVAC and Framing etc.) We do both residential and commercial projects. We have more than 16 years of experience in Estimating services. We are giving almost 25% Discount on the first estimate. Please send us the plans or link to any FTP site so that we can review the plans and submit you a very economical quote. In order to get a better idea of our work, ask for sample estimates and take-offs.',0,'2021-12-03 14:36:58','2021-12-03 14:36:58',NULL),(27,'Sara Parveen','spdg@protonmail.com','+1 (805) 407-8464','Interior Remodeling','Hello,\n\nWe have a rowhouse in Ridgewood, Queens 11385, which we would like to make changes to. This is currently a 3-level, legal 2-unit residence. \n\nHowever, the basement was converted into a 3rd unit, but the proper paper work was never filed and there are open permits with the city. The basement work included turning the garage into a living space, building an extension into the backyard, and adding a bathroom in the basement.\n\nWe would like to resolve these violations, and turn this into a single family residence. This includes adding stairs between the basement and main floor. Our total budget is $130,000 - $180,000. We\'d like to start on this project ASAP.\n\n17-48 Troutman St\nRidgewood, Queens 11385\n\nThank you!\nSara Parveen\n805-407-8464',0,'2021-12-03 17:57:47','2021-12-03 17:57:47',NULL),(28,'Jack Patrick','jack@theintlestimating.com','+1 (332) 249-0423','New Construction','We are estimating Company provides Materials Take-off’s & Estimating services to General and Sub-Contractors, Architects, Home Builders for their residential and commercial projects.\n\nTake off / Estimation Service List\nSite Work Takeoffs\nRoofing takeoff\nFlooring Estimates\nElectrical Estimates\nMechanical Takeoff\nHVAC Takeoff\nPlumbing Takeoff\nConcrete Takeoff\nMasonry Takeoff\nPrecast Takeoff\nReinforcing Steel Takeoff\nLumber Takeoff\nPainting Takeoff\nDrywall Takeoffs\nInsulation Takeoff\nMill-work Takeoff\nDoors and Window Takeoff\nCabinet Takeoff\nFlooring Takeoff\nStucco Takeoff\nMetal Framing Takeoff\nWall Covering Takeoff, and much more.\n\nWe provide you with a list of all the material components needed to conclude the development of your construction project.\n\nWe will provide you a complete breakdown of materials and labor in a separate column.\n\nWe will also provide the average standard prices for each material based on the zip code\n\nKindly let us know if you have any project this time then send us your construction plans (Structural/architectural drawings,) or your project link and get a quick proposal for our services including our fee and timeline.',0,'2021-12-07 09:23:21','2021-12-07 09:23:21',NULL),(29,'Vladislav Evdokimov','vladislav@moderncitigroup.com','+1 (895) 231-6931','Major Alteration/Addition','Test',0,'2021-12-07 14:55:10','2021-12-07 14:55:10',NULL),(30,'Nguyen Ngoc Lieu','sales2.quartzfab@nhathuygroup.com.vn','+1 (904) 614-2250','Interior Remodeling','Dear Sir/ Madam,\n\nHow are you doing? \n\nThis is Nguyen Ngoc Lieu (Mr.) from Nhat Huy Group – one of the biggest manufacturers of Quartz Slabs and fabri