 project plans/drawings with us to receive our fees and turnaround time.\n\nWe are committed to cost-effective results for all our clients, our company provides fast and experienced solutions.\n\nIf I’ve reached you in error, please forward this on to others within your organization who may have opportunities.\n\nVictor Martin\nBDM at Estimation Hub INC\nE: victor@estimationhubinc.com\nP: (281) 509-9327\nA: 207 Greenway Plaza, Houston TX.',0,'2022-08-05 15:21:00','2022-08-05 15:21:00',NULL),(139,'Victor Martin','victor@estimationhubinc.com','+1 (281) 509-9327','Interior Remodeling','Hi,\n\nI hope all is well with you, Just came across your Info and wanted to see if you need any help with Takeoffs.\n\nOur estimating team has multiple years of experience with reading design drawings and using technology to provide well-executed takeoffs. We can efficiently tabulate and deliver takeoffs on time.\n\nE-Hub Inc provides accurate Takeoffs and Cost Estimates for all types of Projects & Bids of New Construction, Remodel, or Renovation. Trade/Div. Estimates for GC’s, Subs, Home Builders, and construction companies.\n\nPlease share your project plans/drawings with us to receive our fees and turnaround time.\n\nWe are committed to cost-effective results for all our clients, our company provides fast and experienced solutions.\n\nIf I’ve reached you in error, please forward this on to others within your organization who may have opportunities.\n\nVictor Martin\nBDM at Estimation Hub INC\nE: victor@estimationhubinc.com\nP: (281) 509-9327\nA: 207 Greenway Plaza, Houston TX.',0,'2022-08-05 15:24:08','2022-08-05 15:24:08',NULL),(140,'Alex Hales','ahales.allproestimating@gmail.com','+1 (356) 364-446','Interior Remodeling','Hi,\n\nAre You Looking for Materials Take-off, Quantity Surveying or Cost Estimation for Residential, Commercial or Industrial Buildings of Any Size?\n\nWe\'re Specialized in Quantity Surveying, Actively Working for USA, Australia, Canada and UK Based Firms to Facilitate With Our Highly Accurate Take-Offs and \n\nEstimation Skills, Using Plan-Swift 10, Blue-beam 6 and MS Excel.\n\nWHY US?\n\nClient Satisfaction \nCost Effective and Economical\nBetter Communication & Coordination\nHigh-Quality Estimation With a Meticulous Approach\nHuge Team in Estimation Department\n\nwill provide following Services:\n\nDemolition\nSite Construction \nConcrete \nMasonry \nFinishes\nSpecialties\nEquipment\nFurnishings\nFire Suppression\nPlumbing\nMetals \nWood and Plastics \nThermal and Moisture Protection \nOpenings\nHVAC\nElectrical \nEarthwork\n& others\n\nOUTPUT:\n\nPlan-Swift Source File\nExcel Spreadsheet\nMarkup Plans\n\nRegards,\nAlex Hales/ Marketing Manager\nWe do Work in both states of USA & Canada.',0,'2022-08-05 22:56:00','2022-08-05 22:56:00',NULL),(141,'Brittany Ross','brittanyrossconsultant@gmail.com','+1 (409) 238-1615','Other','I provide Contractor Leads, please call me if you are interested (409) 238-1615 or email brittanyrossconsultant@gmail.com',0,'2022-08-06 08:08:36','2022-08-06 08:08:36',NULL),(142,'Brittany Ross','brittanyrossconsultant@gmail.com','+1 (409) 238-1615','Other','I provide Contractor Leads, please call me if you are interested (409) 238-1615 or email brittanyrossconsultant@gmail.com',0,'2022-08-06 10:22:22','2022-08-06 10:22:22',NULL),(143,'Jonathan Graham','jagrhm@hotmail.com','+1 (673) 883-771','General Contractor','We have design plans and materials selected to renovate our primary bath and laundry room in NYC. Please let us know if you would be available this fall to build.',0,'2022-08-12 20:02:01','2022-08-12 20:02:01',NULL),(144,'Jack Davidson','jack.profineestimation1@gmail.com','+1 (302) 319-9439','New Construction','Hi,\n\nAny project for Estimation? We can help you with all your Estimating work. We do estimation for both residential and commercial projects and cover every trade you wish to bid. Currently, we are giving a 30% discount with a money-back guarantee. You may ask for our recent work samples, charges, turnaround time, or more information about our company? Or please send us the plans or link to any FTP site. Thanks.',0,'2022-08-12 20:16:56','2022-08-12 20:16:56',NULL),(145,'Jessica Robert','jessicarobertjss@gmail.com','+1 (201) 201-2012','Interior Remodeling','Hi,\nI just visited your website and I was wondering if you would like to see my vision of what I would suggest for your website. I would love the opportunity to show you our work. No commitment for future work, fine print or hidden anything- just an opportunity for you to see what some of our sites look like.\n\nI\'ll be happy to show you some of our work in your industry to give you some ideas. You\'ll then get to see one way in which your site might be redesigned to cater to the customers of today. That\'s it! Would that be ok to send? Thanks in advance!\n\nWarm Regards,\nJessica Robert',0,'2022-08-13 11:11:47','2022-08-13 11:11:47',NULL),(146,'Test','test@test.com',NULL,'main_questions','Test',0,'2023-08-17 06:09:31','2023-08-17 06:09:31',NULL),(147,'daniil','d.buriev@moderncitigroup.com',NULL,'main_questions','question',0,'2023-09-11 19:00:07','2023-09-11 19:00:07',NULL),(148,'The','d.buriev@moderncitigroup.com',NULL,'main_questions','The',0,'2023-09-20 03:50:55','2023-09-20 03:50:55',NULL),(149,'Test','test34@test.com',NULL,'main_questions','Test',0,'2023-09-20 08:29:11','2023-09-20 08:29:11',NULL),(150,'John','Johnproctor11@hotmail.com',NULL,'main_questions','I’m trying to gather info on the impact that COVID and subsequent inflation have had on constiction and related professional services.  Without trying to be overly specific, how much higher are your Architectural and Design Rates today vs 5 years ago?',0,'2023-10-31 17:04:35','2023-10-31 17:04:35',NULL),(151,'Daniel','email@gmail.com',NULL,'main_questions','Question',0,'2023-12-02 01:43:30','2023-12-02 01:43:30',NULL),(152,'Влад','startthehistory101@gmail.com',NULL,'main_questions','Тест от Влада',0,'2023-12-02 12:57:23','2023-12