moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1624697569.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'A home, whether it is an apartment or a house, needs to be perfect for those who live in it. Unless the décor and layout feel right, there remains something missing from the domestic setting.',NULL,'2021-06-26 08:52:50','2021-06-26 08:52:50',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(359,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1624697577.webp','//srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1624697577.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'For any type of commercial property, whether it’s a bar, restaurant or office space, making sure that the interiors as well as exteriors are in tune with the brand image is of utmost importance to the success of the business. How your business looks determines how your business works in the eyes of those who perceive it. Further, a well designed commercial space makes immediate impressions on the minds of customers, and also puts the employees in better work conditions.',NULL,'2021-06-26 08:52:59','2021-06-26 08:52:59',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(360,1,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1624697634.webp','//srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1624697634.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-06-26 08:53:56','2021-06-26 08:53:56',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(361,1,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1624697643.webp','//srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1624697643.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-06-26 08:54:05','2021-06-26 08:54:05',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(362,NULL,6,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1624697687.webp','//srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1624697687.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-06-26 08:54:48','2021-06-26 08:54:48',NULL,''