s/attachments/1631998694.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 01:25:45','2021-10-14 01:25:45',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2047,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631997646.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 01:34:50','2021-10-14 01:34:50',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2048,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631997646.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 02:01:35','2021-10-14 02:01:35',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2049,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631997743.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 02:04:00','2021-10-14 02:04:00',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2050,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631997646.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 02:06:12','2021-10-14 02:06:12',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2051,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631997743.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 02:17:27','2021-10-14 02:17:27',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2052,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631997646.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 02:23:12','2021-10-14 02:23:12',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2053,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631998694.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 20:05:00','2021-10-14 20:05:00',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2054,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631997317.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 20:05:23','2021-10-14 20:05:23',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2055,121,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634245275.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634245275.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1634245346901,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"WhgBixkjbh\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I found Modern Citi Group through Yelp as a licensed general contractor in my local area with a good reputation based on their reviews. So, it seems fair to add another 5 star review for them - they deserve it. After double checking on google and Houzz, I noticed that Modern Citi Group is the type of construction company I would like to work with to renovate my bathroom in the really old building from the 70\'s in Queens. On my first call we schedule a walk-through meeting with a project manager Matvei. He organized all my wants based on the budget we agreed and presented to me in a very detailed estimate right on the next day. We continued to communicate and discuss the final changes for a few more days and I ended up signing a contract with home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group for a full bathroom remodel. I especially liked the communication with Matvei, as he always was quick to respond throughout the project. He and his designers team also helped with material selection and explained the process thoroughly throughout the entire time. Moreover, what I like best is that project manager Matvei really keeps me informed as the job progresses and is really hands on with the entire process. From start to finish these guys from bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group were professional, courteous and knowledgeable. I am more than pleased with the outcome and anyone looking to remodel their bathroom the right way should give this renovation contractor company a call. Well deserved 5 star review from a very picky and satisfied customer!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}',NULL,'2021-10-14 21:02:29','2021-10-14 21:02:29',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2056,121,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634245392.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634245392.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/png',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 21:03:19','2021-10-14 21:03:19',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2057,121,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634245544.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634245544.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/png',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-14 21:06:05','2021-10-14 21:06:05',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2058,121,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634245860.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634245860.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1634245971833,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"vwB6DhP_Ol\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I found Modern Citi Group through Yelp as a licensed general contractor in my local area with a good reputation based on their reviews. So, it seems fair to add another 5 star review for them - they deserve it. After double checking on google and Houzz, I noticed that Modern Citi Group is the type of construction company I would like to work with to renovate my bathroom in the really old building from the 70\'s in Queens. On my first call we schedule a walk-through meeting with a project manager Matvei. He organized all my wants based on the budget we agreed and presented to me in a very detailed estimate right on the next day. We continued to communicate and discuss the final changes for a few more days and I ended up signing a contract with home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group for a full bathroom remodel. I especially liked the communication with Matvei, as he always was quick to respond throughout the project. He and his designers team also helped with material selection and explained the process thoroughly throughout the entire time. Moreover, what I like best is that project manager Matvei really keeps me informed as the job progresses and is really hands on with the entire process. From start to finish these guys from bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group were professional, courteous and knowledgeable. I am more than pleased with the outcome and anyone looking to remodel their bathroom the right way should give this renovation contractor company a call. Well deserved 5 star review from a very picky and satisfied customer!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}',NULL,'2021-10-14 21:12:54','2021-10-14 21:12:54',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2059,121,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634310843.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634310843.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1634310845123,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"LlgNkQoF1E\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We finished remodeling our Restaurant in the Bronx this summer and we used Modern Citi after hearing a lot about them from a few friends of mine. It has always been hard for us to find a solid Remodeling Contractor in the Bronx. This was a big Renovation so I wanted the personal referral from someone I trust. They ended up being a great fit with us. I know a renovation is always stressful and this one was stressful in particular because of COVID and specific deadlines that we had in place. Their team was very good at navigating every obstacle that came up and they kept a clear head which is not something I can say for myself. You could tell that they have done a lot of jobs like this because they were there every day putting in the hard work and they were not rattled by any of the adversity or deadlines. They helped me to not pull my hair out and their ability to renovate this place so nicely and completely change the look and feel of it under those tight deadlines was very impressive to me. If we continue to expand, this will be the subcontractor that I use.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}',NULL,'2021-10-15 15:14:05','2021-10-15 15:14:05',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2060,121,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634311056.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634311056.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1634311059425,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"wFD_9T98w7\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I did a decent amount of research before deciding on a Remodeling Contractor for our 5000 square foot office building in Williamsburg. After reading reviews, speaking with some of my contractor friends and vetting a few companies over the phone, I ended up going with Modern Citi Group. They made me more comfortable after speaking to a few of their different team members and actually going into their office to meet a few of the architects\' face to face.&nbsp;To jump ahead now that the job has been completed, we are extremely satisfied with the results. Artem was the project manager and he was amazing to work with. His attention to detail and veteran experience kept me calm. The process was a big learning experience for me and our in-house staff really enjoyed the whole journey. They taught us a lot about design and guided us on a lot of the big stylistic decisions. It was a very in depth job and a few areas that really impressed me were the conference room construction and the office furniture fabrication.&nbsp;We are thrilled with how our office looks now and we feel like it will help us to hire more employees and grow our business. Happy to find a local, Brooklyn General Contractor with this much experience and expertise.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}',NULL,'2021-10-15 15:17:39','2021-10-15 15:17:39',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2061,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634246597.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634246597.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-10-15 15:31:56','2021-10-15 15:31:56',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2062,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634310856.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634310856.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-10-15 15:31:56','2021-10-15 15:31:56',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2063,121,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634312162.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634312162.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1634312187911,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"k_lydyX1uf\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We were fortunate to find General Contractor Daniil and his guys from Modern Citi Group for our home remodeling in Staten Island. Daniil was always on site supervising (unlike other general contractors we worked with previous) and would always be available to answer any questions or discuss any ongoing concerns with the construction.Daniil is a wonderful person to work with. He is thoughtful, efficient and organized, but also honest, trust-worthy and committed to quality. Throughout the project Daniil and his crew added small details and finishes that were out of the scope of the project but dramatically improved the final product. He also created a wonderful interior design for us which we extremely love. Moreover, Daniil helped to find and order all new furniture for living and dining room and new cabinets for our kitchen.&nbsp;Our remodel consisted of kitchen remodeling, dinning room and living room complete renovations. In addition to the extension we updated electrical, plumbing to remodeled and created the newly designed interior layout to finish demolition part and paint. Modern Citi Group team finished demolition process very quickly and installed new flooring. They also change countertop to granite and install new sink, faucet and range hood. After all, project turned to assembly furniture and installed all appliances.What was most impressive of how he and his group sucessfully troubleshooted through what proved to be an extremely complex job. They were about to cut time without sacrificing the quality.We are absolutely satisfied with the service and results! Thank YOU Daniil and Modern Citi Group for all your assistance and hardwork!&nbsp;Highly recommended this residential contractor in NYC!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}',NULL,'2021-10-15 15:36:28','2021-10-15 15:36:28',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2064,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634336166.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634336166.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-10-15 22:19:49','2021-10-15 22:19:49',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2065,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634336346.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634336346.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I wanna be happy',NULL,'2021-10-15 22:19:49','2021-10-15 22:19:49',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2066,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634336166.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634336166.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-10-15 22:19:50','2021-10-15 22:19:50',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2067,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634336346.webp','/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1634336346.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I wanna be happy',NULL,'2021-10-15 22:19:50','2021-10-15 22:19:50',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2068,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631997646.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-15 22:35:45','2021-10-15 22:35:45',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2069,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631128143.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-10-15 22:37:10','2021-10-15 22:37:10',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2070,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631998119.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2021-10-15 22:46:10','2021-10-15 22:46:10',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2071,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1631998643.webp',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL