tone Quartz (5112 Aterra Blanca).\n2. Please install backsplash also with same Caesarstone Quartz.\n3. Please replace ledge on kitchen window with same Caesarstone Quartz.\n4. Install water filter under sink.',NULL,'2021-11-18 00:57:27','2021-11-18 00:57:27',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2136,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1637195849.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1637195849.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1. Please replace the countertops with Caesarstone Quartz (5112 Aterra Blanca).\n2. Please install backsplash also with same Caesarstone Quartz.\n3. Please replace ledge on kitchen window with same Caesarstone Quartz.\n4. Install water filter under sink.',NULL,'2021-11-18 00:57:27','2021-11-18 00:57:27',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2137,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1637196506.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1637196506.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Install washer/dryer into bedroom closet (waste pipe in bathroom).\nCircuit box might need to be enlarged.\nCloset depth is 22\"  up to saddle on floor; 23.5\" including saddle.\nCurrent closet doors should be replaced with sliding bypass doors.',NULL,'2021-11-18 00:57:27','2021-11-18 00:57:27',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2138,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1637196720.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1637196720.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Skim popcorn ceilings (remove popcorn only if necessary to assure smooth ceiling).\nPaint entire apartment',NULL,'2021-11-18 00:57:27','2021-11-18 00:57:27',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL),(2139,NULL,NULL,'/home/site/list/ModernCitiGroup/api.modernciti.group/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1637196725.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/