-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652030680.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652030680.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-05-08 17:27:08','2022-05-08 17:27:08',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(4310,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652030798.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652030798.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-05-08 17:27:08','2022-05-08 17:27:08',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(4311,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/files/attachments/','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/files/attachments/1652034914.pdf',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-05-08 18:38:01','2022-05-08 18:38:01',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(4312,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652234477.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652234477.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-05-11 02:10:58','2022-05-11 02:10:58',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(4313,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652234702.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652234702.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Replace sink,  appliances, stove, the fridge\ninstall a dishwasher and microwave (no current ones),\n\nReplace both wall and base cabinets \n\nNew counter top\n\nNew backsplash \n\nReplace outlets and light switches \n\nReplace floor with tiles (laminate now)\n\nKitchen repaint walls and ceiling \n\nCeiling fixture do not touch \n\ndo not install  garbage disposal \n\nRemove small cabinet by the window and by the kitchen entrance to create more storage space \n\nClean and modern, not glossy. White or something dark green with gold hardware',NULL,'2022-05-11 02:10:58','2022-05-11 02:10:58',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4314,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652234877.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652234877.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Full Reno\n\nReplace the sink, bathtub,  shower head\nInstall new Glass door \n\nReplace Floor tile \n\nTiles in the wet area only. Painting the rest of the walls\n\nToilet and vanity don’t have preference (do base)\n\nMedicine/mirror stays current - do nothing \n\nCeiling fixture keep on, no wall lights - do nothing\n\nReplace light switches and outlets \n\nNo window in the bathroom\n\nDoor no work (replace door handle) \n\nRepaint the ceilings and walls',NULL,'2022-05-11 02:10:58','2022-05-11 02:10:58',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4315,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652628028.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652628028.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-05-15 15:21:52','2022-05-15 15:21:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(4316,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652713546.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1652713546.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-05-16 15:07:36','2022-05-16 15:07:36',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(4317,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/34221da9-3f48-4eac-b74c-543643ba0086.jpg','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/34221da9-3f48-4eac-b74c-543643ba0086.jpg',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2022-05-23 14:49:07','2022-05-23 14:49:07','34221da9-3f48-4eac-b74c-543643ba0086','demo4.jpg','jpg',370079,NULL),(4318,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/81cf4257-e262-438a-b890-1d02ef3a85f8.jpg','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/81cf4257-e262-438a-b890-1d02ef3a85f8.jpg',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2022-05-23 14:49:49','2022-05-23 14:49:49','81cf4257-e262-438a-b890-1d02ef3a85f8','demo4.jpg','jpg',370079,NULL),(4319,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1641242525.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1641263206480,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ty0JTJPs39\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group completes a transformation of two separate commercial office spaces in New York, converting them into one spacious double floor office, featuring the modern, elegant, energized look &amp; feel. The office renovation included bathroom remodeling, removal of old metal cabins, building new full privacy bathroom cabin partitions with wall tile and doors installation as well as painting. Soundproofing, conference rooms construction, commercial office glass wall partition installation, glass doors and double metal commercial doors installation, waterproofing, sealing, skim coat, drywall repair, framing, wallpaper installation, wall painting and ceiling painting, high quality \\\"hardwood feel\\\" laminate flooring and carpet tile installation, soundproofed private phone booths construction, seating space, wall mounted desks. and much more.\"}},{\"id\":\"lqgX2xGHKT\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Our goal for every commercial construction project, besides following the timeline, respecting our client\'s ideas &amp; needs, controlling, managing &amp; providing high quality service - is to also make sure we deliver solutions that improve efficiency and simplify workflow. \"}},{\"id\":\"hqkQFHAzvx\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every business whether it’s a bar, restaurant, corporate office or retail store  - is the unique brand that brings certain emotion to people, we are\"}},{\"id\":\"3mYDyzHLaW\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"here to help our clients with the development &amp; management of the proper delivery, from concept to completion... making sure the interiors as well as exteriors of commercial and/or residential property are in tune with 