rv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/b1546596-8e70-46c2-acc5-a526cd1ade50.jpg',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2022-06-07 07:33:55','2022-06-07 07:33:55','b1546596-8e70-46c2-acc5-a526cd1ade50','demo4.jpg','jpg',370079,NULL),(4493,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1641242525.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1641263206480,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ty0JTJPs39\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group completes a transformation of two separate commercial office spaces in New York, converting them into one spacious double floor office, featuring the modern, elegant, energized look &amp; feel. The office renovation included bathroom remodeling, removal of old metal cabins, building new full privacy bathroom cabin partitions with wall tile and doors installation as well as painting. Soundproofing, conference rooms construction, commercial office glass wall partition installation, glass doors and double metal commercial doors installation, waterproofing, sealing, skim coat, drywall repair, framing, wallpaper installation, wall painting and ceiling painting, high quality \\\"hardwood feel\\\" laminate flooring and carpet tile installation, soundproofed private phone booths construction, seating space, wall mounted desks. and much more.\"}},{\"id\":\"lqgX2xGHKT\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Our goal for every commercial construction project, besides following the timeline, respecting our client\'s ideas &amp; needs, controlling, managing &amp; providing high quality service - is to also make sure we deliver solutions that improve efficiency and simplify workflow. \"}},{\"id\":\"hqkQFHAzvx\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every business whether it’s a bar, restaurant, corporate office or retail store  - is the unique brand that brings certain emotion to people, we are\"}},{\"id\":\"3mYDyzHLaW\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"here to help our client