5938866.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1655938866.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'would like to see if we can expand the counter space and rearrange kitchen layout to a smarter fit. if possible, would also like to remove non-working fireplace (pending feasibility and board approval).',NULL,'2022-06-22 23:25:49','2022-06-22 23:25:49',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4713,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1655939285.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1655939285.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'refresh of cosmetics. there is also a closet that i would like to reimagine into a partial glass partition/built in seat',NULL,'2022-06-22 23:25:49','2022-06-22 23:25:49',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4714,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1655939745.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1655939745.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'refresh of cosmetics. there is also a closet that i would like to reimagine into a partial glass partition/built in seat',NULL,'2022-06-22 23:25:49','2022-06-22 23:25:49',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4715,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1655939682.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1655939682.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I\'d like to build a small coat closet where the current owner has a hutch, as well as additional cosmetic updates',NULL,'2022-06-22 23:25:49','2022-06-22 23:25:49',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4716,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1655939691.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1655939691.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I\'d like to build a small coat closet where the current owner has a hutch, as well as additional cosmetic updates',NULL,'2022-06-22 23:25:49','2022-06-22 23:25:49',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,