would like to gut renovate the bathroom.\nConvert bathtub to walk in shower, install new large tile on walls',NULL,'2022-07-19 21:04:02','2022-07-19 21:04:02',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4938,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658264310.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658264310.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We would like to fully renovate the kitchen and open it up towards the living room.\nThere is currently a closet space between kitchen and living room -  we would like to remove it, and extend the kitchen cabinets all the way.\nAdd a kitchen island island with a cooktop and exhaust hood on top at the end (where closet currently ends).',NULL,'2022-07-19 21:04:02','2022-07-19 21:04:02',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4939,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658264478.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658264478.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Refinish hardwood floors, replace baseboards, install crown moldings, paint walls and ceilings. Replace ceiling light fixture with a chandelier. Add 2 wall lights',NULL,'2022-07-19 21:04:02','2022-07-19 21:04:02',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4940,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658337444.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658337444.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-07-20 17:31:56','2022-07-20 17:31:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(4941,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658338191.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658338191.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Full renovation of the Master bath \n\nCurrently have: \nFree standing shower,  separate bathtub, single vanity and toilet\n\nWant to have in the new one:\nRemove the current bathtub \nMove the toilet to the  place of the tub\nInstall larger dual vanity\nInstall new storage cabinet if space permits \nRefinish the ceiling \nReplace the floor tiles \nReplace the wall tiles. Half walls now for tiles. Open to tiling all around based on the design\nReplace the toilet , new vanity - not sure if base or wall mounted, open to suggestion\nShower area now have Half wall and half glass door - May knock down the wall and change the door to have full glass door\nLarger medicine cabinet three doors now, want to replace with similar large medicine cabinet \nReplace the bathroom door - make it a sliding door, replace door trim \n\nLight colors, completely open to design suggestions \n\nTwo recessed ceiling lights now, wall fixture above the mirror. Replace all light fixtures \n\nNo window \n\nHeated floors is a possibility \n\nBudget not at the moment - just started their research',NULL,'2022-07-20 17:31:56','2022-07-20 17:31:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4942,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/9bd9fe66-768e-4f9c-a475-8800bee66d5f.jpg','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/9bd9fe66-768e-4f9c-a475-8800bee66d5f.jpg',NULL,NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2022-07-21 01:06:56','2022-07-21 01:06:56','9bd9fe66-768e-4f9c-a475-8800bee66d5f','3 (2).jpg','jpg',488274,NULL),(4943,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658366468.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658366468.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'It’s all about first impressions in the business world. Our designers and architects will work with you to bring your brand to life. We will help you become memorable in the eyes of your clients and employees',NULL,'2022-07-21 01:22:02','2022-07-21 01:22:02',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(4944,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658445683.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1658445683.webp',NULL,NU