nstall shower handle set\n3. remove the cement around the fire sprinkler\n4. add gravel to the ground tile',NULL,'2022-09-09 20:29:48','2022-09-09 20:29:48',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(5382,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663085130.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663085130.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Take out old cabinets and countertops and put in new ones. Install dishwasher and put in new stove and refrigerator.  Maybe refinish walls, maybe put in an exhaust hood.',NULL,'2022-09-13 16:08:10','2022-09-13 16:08:10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(5383,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/f9b4c716-b1ca-4da4-bf4c-cddfa1993259.jpg','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/f9b4c716-b1ca-4da4-bf4c-cddfa1993259.jpg','v1667411903/vbtg7atflhhbza6aqjvj.jpg',NULL,'image/jpeg',NULL,NULL,'2022-09-14 19:58:18','2022-11-02 17:58:23','f9b4c716-b1ca-4da4-bf4c-cddfa1993259','7.jpg','jpg',198476,NULL),(5384,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628329.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628329.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-09-19 23:14:19','2022-09-19 23:14:19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5385,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628807.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628807.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Replace all  cabinets \n\nReplace Countertop, backsplash \n\nInstall New Range. Reuse all other appliances, wall mounted microwave, hood as well \n\nReplace the floors, remove for layers of old floors, refinish the hardwood underneath (if not then install new tiles) \n\nNo work on the ceiling Recessed lights \nPaint walls and ceiling \n\nSplit system ac right now, wire taped along the wall, need to be integrated in the wall \n\nNo window \nNo door \n\nInstall additional set of light switches in the kitchen by the living room \n\nConvert the cabinets on the side of the kitchen into a closet \n\nReplace radiator cover 12 ft long narrow one \n\nFor the kitchen I was considering blue lacquer cabinets, a stainless steel (or maybe copper?) backsplash. If the original hardwood floor is going to be usable if like to go with that. Otherwise I’d be open to suggestions for the kind of flooring used based on the rest of the design. For the wall mounted counter with the sink I was thinking wood/butcher block counter, and for the island I love attached a picture for inspiration',NULL,'2022-09-19 23:14:19','2022-09-19 23:14:19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(5386,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628820.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628820.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Replace all  cabinets \n\nReplace Countertop, backsplash \n\nInstall New Range. Reuse all other appliances, wall mounted microwave, hood as well \n\nReplace the floors, remove for layers of old floors, refinish the hardwood underneath (if not then install new tiles) \n\nNo work on the ceiling Recessed lights \nPaint walls and ceiling \n\nSplit system ac right now, wire taped along the wall, need to be integrated in the wall \n\nNo window \nNo door \n\nInstall additional set of light switches in the kitchen by the living room \n\nConvert the cabinets on the side of the kitchen into a closet \n\nReplace radiator cover 12 ft long narrow one \n\nFor the kitchen I was considering blue lacquer cabinets, a stainless steel (or maybe copper?) backsplash. If the original hardwood floor is going to be usable if like to go with that. Otherwise I’d be open to suggestions for the kind of flooring used based on the rest of the design. For the wall mounted counter with the sink I was thinking wood/butcher block counter, and for the island I love attached a picture for inspiration',NULL,'2022-09-19 23:14:19','2022-09-19 23:14:19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(5387,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628839.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628839.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Replace all  cabinets \n\nReplace Countertop, backsplash \n\nInstall New Range. Reuse all other appliances, wall mounted microwave, hood as well \n\nReplace the floors, remove for layers of old floors, refinish the hardwood underneath (if not then install new tiles) \n\nNo work on the ceiling Recessed lights \nPaint walls and ceiling \n\nSplit system ac right now, wire taped along the wall, need to be integrated in the wall \n\nNo window \nNo door \n\nInstall additional set of light switches in the kitchen by the living room \n\nConvert the cabinets on the side of the kitchen into a closet \n\nReplace radiator cover 12 ft long narrow one \n\nFor the kitchen I was considering blue lacquer cabinets, a stainless steel (or maybe copper?) backsplash. If the original hardwood floor is going to be usable if like to go with that. Otherwise I’d be open to suggestions for the kind of flooring used based on the rest of the design. For the wall mounted counter with the sink I was thinking wood/butcher block counter, and for the island I love attached a picture for inspiration',NULL,'2022-09-19 23:14:19','2022-09-19 23:14:19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(5388,NULL,NULL,'/var/www/Modern-Citi-Group-API/src/public/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628746.webp','https://srv.moderncitigroup.com/storage/uploads/images/attachments/1663628746.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'New floor \n\nNew wall tiles - floor to ceiling \n\nInstall Steam shower, bench, rainfall shower head\n\nReplace Vanity, toilet - base \n\nReplace medicine cabinet \n\nRemove the bathtub, convert to a walk in shower \n\nA large window on the tub - keep balcony style window, close off the other large window \n\nDoor - no work \nReplace wall