NULL,NULL,NULL,'Full bathroom remodel, replace all fixtures. Standard  size 35-40 sq ft.\n \nReplace tub with a walk in shower \n\nInstall sliding glass door \n\nInstall shower niche - full wall length \n\nadd handheld shower \n\nreplace Wall tile with full walls floor to ceiling\n\nReplace floor tile \n\nReplace toilet with a toilet standing\n\nreplace vanity with a wall mounted single vanity \n\nno window \n\nreplace vent  \n\nReplace the wall light, no ceiling lights \n\nreplace medicine cabinet with an LED medicine cabinet \n\nreplace door and trim \n\nwants a specific tile - will advise during the walkthrough \nfixtures matte black',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-15 16:21:09','2023-06-15 16:21:09'),(617,666,666,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'17542652769',NULL,NULL,NULL,'New plumbing (1/2 bath) - fresh & sewage\nNew electrical - lighting & outlets\nNew hvac (2) \nNew industrial size lift - min 1000 lbs.\nNew (2) 12’ & 14’ garage doors with extra security\nNew (2) cb walls w/weatherproof & finish stucco\nAll finished & painted drywall\nClosed cell Spray foam insulation\n4 new exterior metal doors w/extra security so as not to be stolen plus lintels & framing\nGarage ventilation system as per fire code\nTook workbench w/tool storage\nInstall laundry - wash/dry & util sink\nGarage storage type cabinet wall system\nSecurity system\nAll new roof on sheds to the south',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-15 17:33:35','2023-06-15 17:33:35'),(618,667,667,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'13473457299',NULL,NULL,NULL,'test',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-15 19:13:26','2023-06-15 19:13:26'),(619,668,668,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'13042839384',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-15 20:52:39','2023-06-15 20:52:39'),(620,669,669,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'17026095614',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-19 11:49:56','2023-06-19 11:49:56'),(621,670,670,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'18173047631',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Convert 1 bedroom to JR 4, add wall, close door frame, move light switch, add outlet, refinish 8x10 hardwood floor. We\'re looking for a full service quote to provide the architectural plans, submission to DOB, permitting and inspections and general contracting and build out. We have already submitted our alteration agreement to our board and received approval.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-19 15:19:40','2023-06-19 15:19:40'),(622,671,671,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'11111111111',NULL,NULL,NULL,'See attached',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-19 20:43:08','2023-06-19 20:43:08'),(623,672,672,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'15082923213',NULL,NULL,NULL,'DEMO / CARPENTRY:\nProtect entire apt. with ram board \nRemove approx. 7\' of wall to open kitchen up.\nRemove kitchen cabinets and all appliances except D.W.\nRemove Foyer closet wall (currently 3/4\" plywood) and bi-fold doors.\nBuild 2 x 4 wall for new Foyer closet / hang new 2/6 x 8/0 Brosco doors.\nRemove baseboard throughout apartment \nRemove kitchen floor tile and approx. 15\" x 36\" of the foyer bamboo flooring to new kitchen floor tile can extend out to align with new cabinets.\nPour self-leveling concrete in kitchen area / seal with Laticrete Hydroban\nPLUMBING:\nDirect replacement of kitchen sink and gas range (Permit required)\nReplace apartment water shut-off valves (the current valves leak slightly)\nInstall 1/4\" ice maker line \nELECTRIC:\nRun new circuits to bring kitchen up to code.\nRough in for under cabinet strip lighting.\nMove light switch / install GFCI outlets and microwave outlet.\nPAINTING:\nPatch and paint then entire apartment\nOWNER IS A CABINETMAKER AND (AFTER THE COMPLETION OF YOUR WORK) WILL INSTALL:\nKitchen cabinets, base board molding, foyer door casing, kitchen floor tile, backsplash tile, HVAC cover/cabinet',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-20 18:27:47','2023-06-20 18:27:47'),(624,673,673,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'14759889099',NULL,NULL,NULL,'No',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-20 22:06:31','2023-06-20 22:06:31'),(625,674,674,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'19178566291',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Redo cabinets and tile floor in 10x6’ bathroom and 11x10’ kitchen',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-21 02:42:29','2023-06-21 02:42:29'),(626,675,675,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'17813956293',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dhs',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-21 04:14:28','2023-06-21 04:14:28'),(627,676,676,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'19184409080',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Rooftoping',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-21 16:26:01','2023-06-21 16:26:01'),(628,677,677,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'13184893104',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Roofing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-21 16:43:15','2023-06-21 16:43:15'),(629,678,678,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'15073178271',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-21 19:12:44','2023-06-21 19:12:44'),(630,679,679,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'19293319510',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Turn powder room and adjacent closet into a full bathroom, ADA accessible. \n\nInstall walk in shower and shower handle \n\nInstall a ramp and deck for the back yard to make ADA accessible',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-21 21:28:54','2023-06-21 21:28:54'),(631,680,680,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'15129951288',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Roofing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-22 06:51:19','2023-06-22 06:51:19'),(632,681,681,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'17577375111',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-22 20:27:44','2023-06-22 20:27:44'),(633,682,682,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'16062607679',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-23 19:40:33','2023-06-23 19:40:33'),(634,683,683,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'16096181769',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-23 21:19:01','2023-06-23 21:19:01'),(635,684,684,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'16465225567',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2 floors 1400 sq including basement \n\nFloors in the house redo (hardwood now) - replace with luxury vinyl, open to other scratch and water resistant \n\nBasement lay new floors, not finished now \n\nUpstairs bathroom full renovation \nTub convert to shower \nReplace vanity, toilet, all fixtures \nIndifferent to tiles on the walls \nWindow, refinish \nRadiator - remove\nInstall towel heater instead \nToto wall mounted toilet \nSliding door \nLight colors, classic and modern styles like, but not white, Wood fixtures\n\n\nRedo the kitchen - second priority \nKitchen has vinyl floors, replace with vinyl, same throughout the house \nNew cabinets \nReplace appliances (will purchase themselves) \ninstall new Hood to vent outside \nWhite or light color cabinets, two-color kitchen \n\nHallway upstairs siding - indentation in the floor. May need to replace the subfloor',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-23 22:24:21','2023-06-23 22:24:21'),(636,685,685,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'17035545576',NULL,NULL,NULL,'full bathroom remodel \n\nreplace tub with a new one \ncurtain rod \nWall tile wet area only \ntoilet floor mounted \nsingle vanity on the floor (double French door with 3 shelves)\nremove the recessed medicine cabinet \nreplace one wall fixture \nno window \npaint walls and ceiling \nno door work \nInstall new threshold (carpet outside of the bathroom)\n\nHas all decor materials selected, see here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1fi3wjLBszD6WRnB8cfQ3O2X9DkI2ebe9dEfJWr845_k/edit',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-23 22:29:01','2023-06-23 22:29:01'),(637,686,686,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'18086792161',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Turn the garage into an entertainment area. No legal conversion is needed, would like to just finish it. \n\nInstall floor tile \nPaint walls and ceiling\nInstall new ceiling lights \n\nLeave the garage door',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-23 22:33:23','2023-06-23 22:33:23'),(638,687,687,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'19295515074',NULL,NULL,NULL,'living room and first floor area \n\nreplace tile for hardwood do floor heating instead of the baseboard \n\npaint walls and ceiling \n\nWindow remove and replace with a door\n\nbuild a deck \n\nwall AC - wants to install mini split Ac\n\nceiling lights install -recessed lights \n\nkitchen \nSewage line in the wall, but would like to remove the wall and leave the column \n\nbacksplash replace \n\n\nfirst floor closet - turn into a powder room \n\nstairs - carpet now, remove and install a more modern staircase \n\nReplace floors on the second floor with engineered wood \n\n bathroom - full remodel \n\ncloset space - change roof access to the middle and open the closet in between two rooms \n\n\nbasement - dig down to add another 1-2 ft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-23 22:39:04','2023-06-23 22:39:04'),(639,688,688,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'17175331894',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sghd',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 08:05:08','2023-06-24 08:05:08'),(640,689,689,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'13017875069',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We had water damage in December 2022 on our 2-bedroom condo. \n\nWe need the following work completed:\n- Full Sheetrock and drywall for 1 bathroom\n-Partial sheetrock for another bathroom\n- Drywall for foyer (walls and ceilings)\n-Rebuilding of master bedroom closer (sheetrock, drywall, and building of shelves)\n-Full painting of entire apartment (we like the original colors, so you would need to match and find the same paint). We also want moldings, trim, detailing, etc. completed\n-Installation of a lighting fixture in dining room\n\nSee listing of condo for pictures: https://streeteasy.com/building/303-e-77th-st-nyc/5a',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-25 13:31:10','2023-06-25 13:31:10'),(641,690,690,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'16315232513',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Simple bathroom remodel of the hallway bathroom\n\nhere is the 3D walk through of the apartment\nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=WFQX5uicEqj&play=1\n\nReplace tiling on the wall with new tiling (halfway up on wall, full height in shower tub)\nReplace floor tiling\nReplace vanity and tub',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 03:39:35','2023-06-26 03:39:35'),(642,691,691,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'12152063090',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Roofing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 05:36:15','2023-06-26 05:36:15'),(643,692,692,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'11303241863',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We want to build out an office nook in a bedroom. The ask is simple which is contruct two perpendicular interior non load bearing walls and a door/doorframe.  Please refer to the attachment and see blue lines for locations and lenghts of wall to be added.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 15:52:45','2023-06-27 15:52:45'),(644,693,693,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'19292130061',NULL,NULL,NULL,'596 sq ft total studio/jr 1bed\n\nEntire apartment: \nreplace the floor (parquet now) with vinyl floors\n\nrefinish walls and ceilings \n\nrefinish the doors \n\nReplace all light fixtures in the unit (track lights in the hallway, wall light in the bath, kitchen ceiling light). add recessed lights in the living room \n\nreplace outlet covers \n\nBathroom: \n\nreplace the tiles - wet area only, and floor tile \n\nPaint walls and ceiling (remove wallpaper)\n\nreplace vanity, replace the toilet,\n\nmirror now, replace with medicine cabinet \n\nreglaze the tub \n\nReplace wall fixture  \n\nKitchen:\n\nremove floor tile and replace with vinyl floor \n\nRemove the base cabinets and storage. Replace with a countertop only which will serve as a dining table.\nReplace the base cabinets (or reuse) on the wall with the dw if needed when replacing the floors. \n\nreplace and relocate the kitchen light - move the lights above the countertop \n\nreplace outlets \n\nBedroom: \n\nadd a divider btw the living and bedroom - build wall partition, she will install the glass doors. TBD on the style and if there will be one or two doors \n\nDo not include the price for any decor materials, she will purchase everything on her own',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 17:51:25','2023-06-27 17:51:25'),(645,694,694,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'19175939317',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://streeteasy.com/building/160-wadsworth-avenue-new_york/303\n\n- Full gut of the bathroom walls & ceiling to bare studs and replace the floor \n- Convert bathtub to shower \n- Replace ceiling light fixture \n- Replace vanity light fixture \n- Install floor tiles for the bathroom floor and a new saddle at the bathroom entrance \n- Install tiles throughout bathroom walls halfway up the wall \n- Install floor tiles and wall tiles up to the ceiling in the standing shower - Install shower body finishes and shower glass door \n- Install vanity, faucet, and toilet - both wall mounted \n- Install medicine cabinet - LED \n- Install bathroom accessories\n- Replace wall light fixture, reuse ceiling light fixture \n- Refinish window sill and trim, fresh coat of paint \n- Refinish door and trim, fresh coat of paint',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 20:03:30','2023-06-27 20:03:30'),(646,695,695,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'16462349416',NULL,NULL,NULL,'co-op classic 7, remodel of the 3.5 bathrooms and a kitchen. Went in contract on Monday, closing September 1 \n\nhttps://streeteasy.com/property/1090576-450-west-end-avenue-10a\n\nkitchen \nOption 1:\nrepaint, replace backsplash, countertop, and repaint the cabinets. \nOption 2:\nRemove piece of the wall to make an open kitchen (suspects riser by the sink and may need to have a column or partial wall left). Waterfall countertop \nReplace all cabinets, floors, countertop, backsplash, farm sink, reuse appliances. - full renovation\n\n\nBathroom 1 (left bathroom in the hallway)\nreplace the tub - new tub \nhalf walls and wet area \nnew floor tile \nnew fixtures \nreplace wall light \nReplace with floating vanity and toilet \nadd glass shower door \nremove radiator and do a heated floor \n\nMiddle bathroom with a shower: \nclose ff the middle bathroom wall from the master bedroom side (so only one door left\nradiators remove and possibly do the heaterd floors \nFull remodel \nWall tile half walls \n\nRight bathroom (master)\nFull remodel, same as others \n\nhalf bath in the laundry room\nremove the wallpaper \nReplace toilet and sink\nfull remodel \n\n\nliving room  \nadd ceiling fixture or recessed lights based on the price \nwire for TV above the fireplace \n\nLaundry room \nredo the floors, remove the cabinets \nAdd same cabinets as kitchen \n\nSee design inspiration in the client card',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 15:29:14','2023-06-29 15:29:14'),(6