mage, wants to know the cost of removing the veranda, and extending the house from there. \n\n5236 Lake Blvd, Delray Beach, 33484',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 16:16:53','2023-07-03 16:16:53'),(665,714,714,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'19172804569',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Here is the loft extension spec:\n- I need to add a kids bedroom over the 14’8” full height master bathroom\n- The added sq feet will be something like 95sq ft once done\n- This is a wood and brick/steel condo built 20 years ago\n- Other units have done extensions like this one photo attached (you see their ceiling is covered with a new kids playroom)\n- My bathroom ceiling photo is attached (see all that dead space up there)\n \nSome people said:\n- You need a support down the middle of bathroom\n- You need to move the sprinklers\n- You don’t need a structural engineer\n\nHere is the dropbox link with the JPG, it’s way too large to send over email…\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/b124ulcqk1yhc94/beverly%20kim%20reno.jpg?dl=0',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:34:57','2023-07-03 17:34:57'),(666,715,715,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'12406519216',NULL,NULL,NULL,'yes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 11:20:34','2023-07-04 11:20:34'),(667,716,716,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'19739724212',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 13:44:44','2023-07-04 13:44:44'),(668,717,717,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'15707281989',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Roof replacement',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 14:20:47','2023-07-04 14:20:47'),(669,718,718,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'13183447994',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 17:00:37','2023-07-04 17:00:37'),(670,719,719,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'13478817538',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Hello! We live in the co-op building in the Bronx. We need to renovate our 34 sq.ft and 29 sq.ft bathrooms. What is the estimate quote for each bathroom?\nThank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 17:41:49','2023-07-04 17:41:49'),(671,720,720,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'17169981861',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 17:44:4