repaint all walls, buff floor\n\nOther: maybe expand a couple of closet doors',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-12-23 16:55:56','2023-12-23 16:55:56'),(892,942,942,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'18185687514',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Kitchen \n- Full renovation. Reuse appliances. Replace tile. Keep the same layout.\n\nBathroom \n- Full renovation, convert bathtub to shower. Remove separation wall between vanity and bathtub. \n\nEntire apartment \n- Replace current vinyl flooring with new laminate, and replace baseboards.\n- Remove popcorn ceiling.\n- Closet work (see video)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-12-27 21:27:12','2023-12-27 21:27:12'),(893,943,943,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'17185511948',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I need to replace the floors in my basement with engineered wood, replace the doors, and baseboards, and repaint',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-12-28 16:27:01','2023-12-28 16:27:01'),(894,944,944,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'16462601450',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Total gut rehab of a 53 Sq. Ft. bathroom in a one-bedroom co-op apartment in Kew Gardens Queens (Hampton Court).\nNew floor tiles, wall tiles, tub, sink, vanity, and toilet.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-12-28 18:53:20','2023-12-28 18:53:20'),(895,945,945,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'18454068752',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Small bathroom renovation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-02 20:48:37','2024-01-02 20:48:37'),(896,946,946,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'14086569254',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Looking to do either a gut renovation or a near gut renovation on the co-op apartment I just purchased. \n\nAt minimum (if not a gut renovation), this should include new floors throughout, a fully reddone kitchen (including tearing down the wall between the kitchen and the living room), and a fully redone bathroom.\n\nHere is a link to the street easy listing of the unit which includes photos of the space: https://streeteasy.com/building/345-west-55-street-new_york/4f',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-03 17:00:18','2024-01-03 17:00:18'),(897,947,947,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'19176239012',NULL,NULL,NULL,'3 bed condo, 19