aper and much easier to maintain) would be fine. For cabinets, I’m open to suggestions. Anything clean and easy to maintain. \nii.	Install a microwave\ng.	General\ni.	Remove some old wiring, shelves, electrical sockets that have been painted over, etc. \nii.	Install some GFCI outlets\niii.	Install a reverse-osmosis water filter under the sink\n\nWe are price-sensitive. I’m not looking for a complete luxury renovation. Just something reasonably decent. \n\nWould one of your team members be able to come over here some time this week to look at the unit?',2,NULL,'2024-01-09 23:58:30','2024-01-09 23:58:30',NULL,13),(1001,962,962,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Hi,\n\nLet us be your estimation partner. We provide estimation takeoff services. Do you have any projects for which you need estimation services or any questions regarding our services? Please feel free to reach out to us.\n\nIf you would like to review our past work, simply respond with \'Sample.\'\n\nLooking forward to working with you. Thanks!\n\nBest Regards,\n\nJos Buttler\nAll Star Estimation LLC\nEstimation and Takeoff Services',5,NULL,'2024-01-10 12:31:29','2024-01-10 12:31:29',NULL,13),(1002,963,963,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'We would like to convert a detached garage in our backyard into an ADU.',3,NULL,'2024-01-10 19:39:46','2024-01-10 19:39:46',NULL,13),(1003,964,964,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Renovate my coop',5,NULL,'2024-01-10 22:33:44','2024-01-10 22:33:44',NULL,13),(1004,965,965,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Full kitchen remodel \nreplace cabinets, appliances \nremove walls to make an open concept \nFloor tile replace, unsure with what yet \nReplace ceiling fixtures - not sure with what \n\nLiving room:\nremove the wall separating the living room from the den \nreplace the floors \npaint wall and ceiling',5,NULL,'2024-01-12 00:15:38','2024-01-12 00:15:38',NULL,13),(1005,966,966,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Redo Kitchen.  Minor update to bathroom (light