INSERT INTO `reviews` VALUES (1,1,3,5.00,1,'New York, NY','Betty C.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=UUSp_FY8c7qPAcqbZBqyug&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=rAY_roEyzoqLdd6wSASthA',NULL,'{\"time\":1656628881405,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"YuHLmRTepk\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I found Modern Citi Group through Yelp as a licensed general contractor in my local area with a good reputation based on their reviews. So, it seems fair to add another 5 star review for them - they deserve it.<br><br>After double checking on google and Houzz, I noticed that Modern Citi Group is the type of construction company I would like to work with to renovate my bathroom in the really old building from the 70\'s in Queens. On my first call we schedule a walk-through meeting with a project estimator Matvei. He organized all my wants based on the budget we agreed and presented to me in a very detailed estimate the same week. We continued to communicate and discuss the final changes for a few more days and I ended up signing a home improvement contract with the home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group for a full bathroom remodel. I especially liked the communication with Matvei, as he always was quick to respond throughout the project. He and MCG design team also helped with material selection and explained the process thoroughly throughout the entire time. Moreover, what I like best is that project manager Artem really keeps me informed as the job progresses and is really hands on with the entire process. From start to finish these guys from bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group were professional, courteous and knowledgeable.<br><br>I am more than pleased with the outcome and anyone looking to remodel their bathroom the right way should give this renovation contractor company a call. Well deserved.&nbsp;&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2021-06-01 12:21:06','2022-08-28 00:21:05','2022-08-28 00:21:05',NULL),(2,1,NULL,5.00,1,'New York, NY','Betty C.',NULL,NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=rAY_roEyzoqLdd6wSASthA',NULL,'{\"time\":1622550139533,\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I found Modern Citi Group through Yelp as a licensed general contractor in my local area with a good reputation based on their reviews. So, it seems fair to add another 5 star review for them - they deserve it.<br><br>After double checking on google and Houzz, I noticed that Modern Citi Group is the type of construction company I would like to work with to renovate my bathroom in the really old building from the 70\'s in Queens. On my first call we schedule a walk-through meeting with a project estimator Matvei. He organized all my wants based on the budget we agreed and presented to me in a very detailed estimate the same week. We continued to communicate and discuss the final changes for a few more days and I ended up signing a home improvement contract with the home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group for a full bathroom remodel. I especially liked the communication with Matvei, as he always was quick to respond throughout the project. He and MCG design team also helped with material selection and explained the process thoroughly throughout the entire time. Moreover, what I like best is that project manager Artem really keeps me informed as the job progresses and is really hands on with the entire process. From start to finish these guys from bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group were professional, courteous and knowledgeable.<br><br>I am more than pleased with the outcome and anyone looking to remodel their bathroom the right way should give this renovation contractor company a call. Well deserved.&nbsp;&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.20.0\"}','2021-06-01 12:22:16','2021-06-01 12:23:18','2021-06-01 12:23:18',NULL),(3,1,3,5.00,2,'New York, NY','Al P.',NULL,NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=owwTu0q1lnVNKw7UsXtjHA',NULL,'{\"time\":1656366315986,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"gTM7OwAdDx\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Our restaurant was long needed to repair toilets for customers. We are located in Midtown East, so we met with multiple &nbsp;independent contractors last month who work in the area, but Daniil seemed like the perfect person to work with. After first meeting with him we chose Modern Citi Group for our renovation project.<br><br>Daniil spent a lot of time with us to understand our remodeling needs and prepare us well for the days ahead. He provided excellent design suggestions to reorganized our toilet stall to private restroom\'s partitions. He also was picking out all the finished material for us. The best and most important part of this project was that one restroom was always active so our costumers could use it during the renovation. Modern Citi Group crew worked nightly and always cleaned up before the restaurant opened. Daniil and his team\'s communication was super prompt and effective.<br><br>Modern Citi Group performed a huge and outstanding job within one calendar week. They completely demolished old restroom partitions and fixtures, built new privacy cabins, installed modern doors, new porcelain tile on walls and floors, replaced toilets, wall mounted sinks, mirrors, lights, installed new doors, painted walls, ceilings. All the electrical and plumbing work was handled by Modern Citi Group. &nbsp;There was no surprises or hidden charges. Now, the work is all done. The finishing is incredible perfect!<br><br>We would certainly recommend Modern Citi Group, specially Daniil!&nbsp;&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2021-06-01 12:30:31','2022-08-16 19:08:02',NULL,NULL),(4,1,4,5.00,3,'New York, NY','Maureen Gray',NULL,'https://goo.gl/maps/2d3iyH1HmBxf1ots9','https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116347057140790542587/reviews?hl=ru-RU',NULL,'{\"time\":1622551312414,\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We have been working with Modern Citi for four years now on a few different projects in New York City. Their team is very bright and they make a great partner. Everyone is knowledgeable and has good ideas. They make you a part of the process and they have a great eye for design. The work they do is amazing. We remodeled our office with them and also did a total renovation of our restaurant in the West Village. As we continue to expand, they are the company we will keep working with.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.20.0\"}','2021-06-01 12:36:15','2021-11-08 20:49:19',NULL,NULL),(5,1,5,5.00,4,NULL,'Mykola Hleha',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/professionals/general-contractors/modern-citi-group-renovations-and-remodeling-pfvwus-pf~1639434407?','https://www.houzz.com/user/webuser-154414906',NULL,'{\"time\":1622551087233,\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Residential Contractor Modern Citi Group knows how to take care of all your needs! I found them through positive Yelp reviews as well as from a neighbor in Bronx referral who’d done the same.\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"It was a pleasure to work with these professionals. Our project manager Artem creative design ideas are outstanding and truly \\\"out of the box\\\". Besides, he picked and ordered all the material, even the kitchen appliances which are perfectly matched. When our kitchen remodeling project turned to demolition and painting, kitchen contractor MCG took care of covering all my furniture. Moreover, they did a great job installing new cabinets, the backsplash and countertops. Everything looks so good and brand new. I can\'t believe this is the same home! \"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"No less important thing during this difficult time, the company is following all precautions. All workers from licensed contractor Modern Citi Group followed the social distancing guidelines and they all wore masks at all times.\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group did an amazing job on the kitchen and I couldn\'t be happier with how it turned out. \"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Love the creativity of this company! Keep doing a great job!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.20.0\"}','2021-06-01 12:38:04','2021-11-03 21:08:22','2021-11-03 21:08:22',NULL),(6,1,3,1.00,50,'Perm','Vlad',NULL,'https://crm.modernciti.group/control/reviews','https://crm.modernciti.group/control/reviews',NULL,'{\"time\":1630566134219,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"q0-XZ64YhX\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"MSG !!!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.0\"}','2021-09-02 07:01:52','2021-09-02 07:02:23','2021-09-02 07:02:23',NULL),(7,121,4,5.00,5,'Google','Andrei Sula',NULL,'https://business.google.com/u/1/reviews/l/01294610768434564067','https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111073149640096497982/reviews?_ga=2.184087522.559851807.1634245030-547523664.1633970665',NULL,'{\"time\":1634245563202,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"WhgBixkjbh\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I found Modern Citi Group through Yelp as a licensed general contractor in my local area with a good reputation based on their reviews. So, it seems fair to add another 5 star review for them - they deserve it. After double checking on google and Houzz, I noticed that Modern Citi Group is the type of construction company I would like to work with to renovate my bathroom in the really old building from the 70\'s in Queens. On my first call we schedule a walk-through meeting with a project manager Matvei. He organized all my wants based on the budget we agreed and presented to me in a very detailed estimate right on the next day. We continued to communicate and discuss the final changes for a few more days and I ended up signing a contract with home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group for a full bathroom remodel. I especially liked the communication with Matvei, as he always was quick to respond throughout the project. He and his designers team also helped with material selection and explained the process thoroughly throughout the entire time. Moreover, what I like best is that project manager Matvei really keeps me informed as the job progresses and is really hands on with the entire process. From start to finish these guys from bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group were professional, courteous and knowledgeable. I am more than pleased with the outcome and anyone looking to remodel their bathroom the right way should give this renovation contractor company a call. Well deserved 5 star review from a very picky and satisfied customer!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-14 21:02:29','2021-10-14 21:07:48','2021-10-14 21:07:48',NULL),(8,121,4,5.00,5,'New York, NY','Andrei Sula',NULL,'https://www.google.com/search?client=safari&rls=en&q=modern+citi+group&ie=UTF-8&oe=UTF-8#','https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111073149640096497982/reviews?_ga=2.254726988.559851807.1634245030-547523664.1633970665',NULL,'{\"time\":1634246026016,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"vwB6DhP_Ol\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I found Modern Citi Group through Yelp as a licensed general contractor in my local area with a good reputation based on their reviews. So, it seems fair to add another 5 star review for them - they deserve it. After double checking on google and Houzz, I noticed that Modern Citi Group is the type of construction company I would like to work with to renovate my bathroom in the really old building from the 70\'s in Queens. On my first call we schedule a walk-through meeting with a project manager Matvei. He organized all my wants based on the budget we agreed and presented to me in a very detailed estimate right on the next day. We continued to communicate and discuss the final changes for a few more days and I ended up signing a contract with home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group for a full bathroom remodel. I especially liked the communication with Matvei, as he always was quick to respond throughout the project. He and his designers team also helped with material selection and explained the process thoroughly throughout the entire time. Moreover, what I like best is that project manager Matvei really keeps me informed as the job progresses and is really hands on with the entire process. From start to finish these guys from bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group were professional, courteous and knowledgeable. I am more than pleased with the outcome and anyone looking to remodel their bathroom the right way should give this renovation contractor company a call. Well deserved 5 star review from a very picky and satisfied customer!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-14 21:12:54','2021-10-14 21:14:50','2021-10-14 21:14:50',NULL),(9,121,4,5.00,5,'New York, NY','Sophia Miller',NULL,'https://www.google.com/search?client=safari&rls=en&q=modern+citi+group&ie=UTF-8&oe=UTF-8#','https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109058736223500004460/reviews?_ga=2.250675138.559851807.1634245030-547523664.1633970665',NULL,'{\"time\":1634246234005,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"dsxFIYBfZP\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We finally got the bathroom we were dreaming about! We had a major leak in our bathroom which caused a major demolition and we had to find licensed professionals to fix the damage. Since quarantine started, we had started looking at someone licensed and a professional bathroom remodel contractor in Staten Island and we found guys from Modern Citi Group. It took a long time until any construction work was resumed in New York but we got lucky and in the middle of July our project began, no matter what. Home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group and their project manager Matt came by taking exact measurements and going over details on what exactly we want done as part of our renovation. They were very professional from the start. They walked us through all the details of what would be involved in a full gut bathroom remodel and provided a detailed scope of work along with the estimate. They explained the breakdown of the costs and an estimate of how long the work would take and the associated permit and inspection work required. Modern Citi Group, the entire team was an absolute pleasure to work with from the very beginning - astonishingly responsive (we’d send an email, and they would reply to us always fast - evenings, weekends; it didn\'t matter). Matt, Daniil, took the time to answer my questions about the materials We were considering buying, going so far as to review links we sent that we didn\'t actually expect him to look at. We’ve seen a lot of jobs and not yet one so perfect like the work performed by renovation contractor Modern Citi Group. It did take a bit longer than expected but it got done properly. What made them really stand out from other residential general contractor companies was their patience, help and understanding throughout the early stage, the planning/budgeting one. Tiling is so important for bathroom renovation and these guys mastered it, their tiling team is something out of this planet . Pricing was also very fair for what we got done. We probably could\'ve paid slightly less for our home remodeling project, but we have no doubt that we would not have received the same quality of service from top to bottom, elsewhere.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-14 21:17:16','2021-11-03 21:08:16','2021-11-03 21:08:16',NULL),(10,121,3,5.00,6,'New York, NY','Boris P.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=93BqP4Qa_k-KzL4GWilQmA&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=r2qKQZfWSm8DyjVpE9JljA',NULL,'{\"time\":1635973596037,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"LlgNkQoF1E\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We finished remodeling our Restaurant in the Bronx this summer and we used Modern Citi after hearing a lot about them from a few friends of mine. It has always been hard for us to find a solid Remodeling Contractor in the Bronx. This was a big Renovation so I wanted the personal referral from someone I trust. They ended up being a great fit with us. I know a renovation is always stressful and this one was stressful in particular because of COVID and specific deadlines that we had in place. Their team was very good at navigating every obstacle that came up and they kept a clear head which is not something I can say for myself. You could tell that they have done a lot of jobs like this because they were there every day putting in the hard work and they were not rattled by any of the adversity or deadlines. They helped me to not pull my hair out and their ability to renovate this place so nicely and completely change the look and feel of it under those tight deadlines was very impressive to me. If we continue to expand, this will be the subcontractor that I use.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:14:05','2021-11-03 21:06:36',NULL,NULL),(11,121,3,5.00,7,'Brooklyn','Carissa B.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=qaD0tl8hiFMV_TfhxABbtw&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=j7XM80-7uHKUC5NA4LYEzg',NULL,'{\"time\":1635973378175,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"wFD_9T98w7\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I did a decent amount of research before deciding on a Remodeling Contractor for our 5000 square foot office building in Williamsburg. After reading reviews, speaking with some of my contractor friends and vetting a few companies over the phone, I ended up going with Modern Citi Group. They made me more comfortable after speaking to a few of their different team members and actually going into their office to meet a few of the architects\' face to face.&nbsp;To jump ahead now that the job has been completed, we are extremely satisfied with the results. Artem was the project manager and he was amazing to work with. His attention to detail and veteran experience kept me calm. The process was a big learning experience for me and our in-house staff really enjoyed the whole journey. They taught us a lot about design and guided us on a lot of the big stylistic decisions. It was a very in depth job and a few areas that really impressed me were the conference room construction and the office furniture fabrication.&nbsp;We are thrilled with how our office looks now and we feel like it will help us to hire more employees and grow our business. Happy to find a local, Brooklyn General Contractor with this much experience and expertise.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:17:39','2022-08-17 19:54:20',NULL,NULL),(12,121,3,5.00,8,'Brooklyn, NY','Glenn V.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=u4-DvDpakc5xKRUTyjrQRw&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=UIWmIvqxd1u0U-MYff4ktA',NULL,'{\"time\":1635973356498,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"sRkWfhc8Hj\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I have been longing for a contemporary kitchen, bathroom and flooring. So after getting quotes from various contractors, I decided to go with renovation contractor Modern Citi because they are a local (in Brooklyn like me) licensed contractor company and they offered me the best price (it doesn\'t mean the cheapest. This is my second renovation project and I know how things go when the project is started. You start seeing change orders, additions and extras - this is all because low end contractors don\'t provide itemized proposals or details from the beginning. So this was my biggest criteria, and while I was expecting maybe a 2-page proposal with details - I RECEIVED THE 23-PAGE BREAKDOWN without even mentioning this upfront. Later on when I told Daniil about this he said &nbsp;he\'s aware many homeowners are dealing with this issue. This is the type of transparency every business, especially a remodeling contractor should look for).&nbsp;After our first site meeting with project manager Matt and Daniil who joined over the video, they presented very creative &amp; modern ready-design solutions for my bathroom renovation and kitchen remodel. They offered a few different design options to choose from. I was pleasantly surprised at how fantastic this idea is. Their concept representation of ready remodel solution is the easiest way to make the entire process of home remodeling very enjoyable and absolutely stress-free. The design team from Modern Citi helped me a lot to save the time since I did not have to be selecting and ordering every item by myself, one by one. They provided a big list of different material options, with pictures and prices. &nbsp;Another thing I liked about working with contractor Modern Citi Group was that everything was in writing. There were no surprises and they did everything (even more) that was agreed upon. More importantly, every Friday I received completion reports with the description and pictures of what had been completed . Every step of the process was absolutely perfect.Completion date was not an issue either; all of the work was completed by the agreed upon timelines. Not only did they keep the timeline, but the completed work was beautiful! Residential general contractor Modern Citi Group will be the only one company I will go to for any future renovations.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:20:59','2021-11-03 21:02:36',NULL,NULL),(13,121,3,5.00,9,'Brooklyn, NY','Sergey L.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=mvhDyMW7iqQCBR4E4zKKRQ&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=WK0wcwjZEjGxgcW_M-FLNw',NULL,'{\"time\":1634311346118,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"S5Qi-BFUQ2\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"These guys are seriously the Mercedes Benz of Kitchens. If you\'re looking for kitchen remodeling contractor in Brooklyn to make the kitchen of your dreams pick up the phone and call Modern Citi Group.We had plans of remodeling our kitchen with new granite countertops and backsplash. So, we did some researching on companies in our local area that we would feel comfortable with. I\'m so glad to found residential general Contractor Daniil from Modern Citi Group for our kitchen remodel project. After meeting with the design team, they quickly turned our boring kitchen into the vision we had wanted for quite some time.We know from past experience that when it comes to construction or home remodeling it\'s best not to look for bargains. Too many things can go wrong when dealing with the wrong people. It can end up costing even more money to have it redone properly not to even mention all the aggravation.Daniil is the best licensed contractor we\'ve ever used. We couldn\'t be happier with the results and will definitely hire Daniil as a home remodeling contractor and Modern Citi Group team again for&nbsp;&nbsp;our renovation projects!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:22:26','2021-11-03 21:08:07','2021-11-03 21:08:07',NULL),(14,121,3,5.00,4,'Queens, NY','Valeriia V.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=mqiyYOjnd_nOnYB7t6X4oA&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=XnaamR7wyYiqGjGe2rmG4A',NULL,'{\"time\":1635973327554,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"4qbeOfnLoB\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Well I must say after 3 contractors we finally found a company that\'s honorable, reliable AND knows what they\'re doing!! Our nightmare started back in February when our dishwasher sprung a leak and ruined our laminate floors and decided to replace the floors with real wood and also remodel kitchen and lighting system. &nbsp;We live in a condo in Queens so there are rules and regulations to follow and that\'s excluding the city codes.&nbsp;Licensed contractor Daniil from Modern Citi Group in New York put me at ease and truly made the process as seamless as possible. From the inception - when I called there was someone on the line ready to take a call. &nbsp;On our first meeting Daniil gave me an estimate and suggested for us one of Modern Cit Group READY SOLUTION for our kitchen. The amazing part of it is you don\'t need to spend your time to searching for everything you need for you renovation. Everything is already collected and in perfect designed balance! Even lighting system which you also can choose from options they give to you! We had a wonderful experience working with Daniil from Modern Citi Group. When they were finished, we were ecstatic as we could not believe how nice the kitchen had turned out.&nbsp;When doing any residential or commercial remodeling/construction CHEAP IS DEAR! don\'t cut corners and look for short cuts! Go with someone who knows their business and theses guys absolutely know their business inside-out!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:24:18','2022-08-28 00:42:12',NULL,NULL),(15,121,3,5.00,2,'New York, NY','Taron A.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=MQ-iXxGF6vbsNv_NGyY5jA&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=APQocKKKPPhOiqjIod0Kzg',NULL,'{\"time\":1661646455466,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"kfowGmxPqI\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Quite sure I hired a magician in New York because these guys from Modern Citi Group and are 100% magic!&nbsp;My building in Queens was built in the 1990s and had a bathroom was never remodeled. I wanted it to be completely gutted and redone and I knew it would be a major undertaking. According to my plan I began to search for a right person to had a general contracting with.&nbsp;My close friend recommended to give a call to one of the local bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group. Next day I met with renovation contractor Daniil and he drew up preliminary plans for a brand new bathroom remodeling. I also understood that I would need a good designer to fulfill all my needs. After our first meeting, Daniil met me with his designer and project manager.&nbsp;The original design of the bathroom was kind of that pinky/beige marble that was really popular in the 90\'s and was kind of hip/classic at the time. I definitely prefer a bit more of a cleaner, white tile look, and decided at least make it look awesome! It\'s a tight space, and they made sure to help us utilize every inch.From demolition to completion Modern Citi Group team were patient, kind, dependable, and knowledgeable. What was the most important in their work, they always kept me informed as to what would be happening each day.&nbsp;Now we have a beautiful bathroom that I will enjoy for years to come! In just over a month, my old, rundown bathroom became a gorgeous new - classic with a glam twist - bathroom. We were right on time and on budget. I &nbsp;am so thrilled with the final product. Hands down, working with kitchen contractor Daniil and his Modern Citi Group team was a great decision.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:26:00','2024-01-10 23:09:15','2024-01-10 23:09:15',NULL),(16,121,5,5.00,12,'Brooklyn, NY','Catherine Sarkis',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/pro/moderncitigroup/modern-citi-group-renovations-and-remodeling#reviews','https://www.houzz.com/user/webuser-7021689',NULL,'{\"time\":1634312471469,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"tvR8YiIKyt\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I own a medical office in Brooklyn and we hired Modern Citi Group for a full office Remodel. Our office was very dated and we were in desperate need of renovation. We felt like updating the office would look better but also help office morale, inspire our team and cut down on turnover.The team at Modern Citi Group was very detail oriented and easy to work with. Everyone seemed really smart and on the ball. I felt like we were in good hands from the beginning. Having said that, we didn\'t know what the final product would look like until the end. They had to take it down to build it up but when the office was finished we were so happy! It actually looks amazing and I couldn\'t be happier with the contractors we hired or with our decision to do a full Office Remodel.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:28:19','2021-11-03 21:07:59','2021-11-03 21:07:59',NULL),(17,121,5,5.00,13,NULL,'Kevin Gselman',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/pro/moderncitigroup/modern-citi-group-renovations-and-remodeling#reviews','https://www.houzz.com/user/webuser-35566867',NULL,'{\"time\":1634312463141,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"LgaB0iVFGw\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We used Modern Citi Group for a brand new restaurant renovation after hearing about them through a referral. They ended up being the right fit for us. We had deadlines throughout the process and they were able to navigate every difficulty that naturally comes up when tearing down a restaurant and building it back up from scratch. The team is filled with talented people who stay calm in a crisis and complete projects on time. They are real professionals and as we expand into more of South Beach, they will be our contractors.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:30:29','2021-11-08 20:49:06','2021-11-08 20:49:06',NULL),(18,121,5,5.00,14,NULL,'Michelle Young',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/pro/moderncitigroup/modern-citi-group-renovations-and-remodeling#reviews','https://www.houzz.com/user/michelle-young51',NULL,'{\"time\":1634312455700,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"6Ts95_K-9w\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We hired them after searching Yelp for a general contractor for a few weeks. They had strong reviews and I got a really good vibe from the owner. It proved to be a good decision. The team did amazing work and finished everything on schedule. They were diligent with our time and deadlines. Very honest and professional, helped us save money in a few areas. Would definitely recommend.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:33:20','2021-11-03 21:07:55','2021-11-03 21:07:55',NULL),(19,121,5,5.00,15,'New York, NY','Laura Fescenko',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/pro/moderncitigroup/modern-citi-group-renovations-and-remodeling#reviews','https://www.houzz.com/user/webuser-149478266',NULL,'{\"time\":1635973142740,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"k_lydyX1uf\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We were fortunate to find General Contractor Daniil and his guys from Modern Citi Group for our home remodeling in Staten Island. Daniil was always on site supervising (unlike other general contractors we worked with previous) and would always be available to answer any questions or discuss any ongoing concerns with the construction.Daniil is a wonderful person to work with. He is thoughtful, efficient and organized, but also honest, trust-worthy and committed to quality. Throughout the project Daniil and his crew added small details and finishes that were out of the scope of the project but dramatically improved the final product. He also created a wonderful interior design for us which we extremely love. Moreover, Daniil helped to find and order all new furniture for living and dining room and new cabinets for our kitchen.&nbsp;Our remodel consisted of kitchen remodeling, dinning room and living room complete renovations. In addition to the extension we updated electrical, plumbing to remodeled and created the newly designed interior layout to finish demolition part and paint. Modern Citi Group team finished demolition process very quickly and installed new flooring. They also change countertop to granite and install new sink, faucet and range hood. After all, project turned to assembly furniture and installed all appliances.What was most impressive of how he and his group sucessfully troubleshooted through what proved to be an extremely complex job. They were about to cut time without sacrificing the quality.We are absolutely satisfied with the service and results! Thank YOU Daniil and Modern Citi Group for all your assistance and hardwork!&nbsp;Highly recommended this residential contractor in NYC!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:36:28','2022-08-16 19:39:26','2022-08-16 19:39:26',NULL),(20,121,5,5.00,16,NULL,'Bohdan Voloshchuk',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/pro/moderncitigroup/modern-citi-group-renovations-and-remodeling#reviews','https://www.houzz.com/user/bohdan-voloshchuk',NULL,'{\"time\":1634312436641,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"A1ocWzbwyB\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I remodeled my small kitchen (10x10) in mid-December and tore down the wall and opened it up into the dining room. Daniil was my main contact person. I could tell the passion of knowledge this young man has. My every question was answered with honesty. Modern Citi Group team set to work immediately after we organized the whole project with Daniil. They gutted the kitchen and installed new floor tile, backsplash, cabinets, new bar counter and recessed lighting. The transformation of my new kitchen was amazing! Modern Citi Group finished the kitchen remodel a week ahead of schedule.I highly recommend this company to everyone! They are very professional and experienced in their work.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:40:37','2021-11-08 20:48:59','2021-11-08 20:48:59',NULL),(21,121,5,5.00,17,NULL,'Ruslan Kovalchuk',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/pro/moderncitigroup/modern-citi-group-renovations-and-remodeling#reviews','https://www.houzz.com/user/webuser-313740731',NULL,'{\"time\":1634312583336,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Z9A90iYLid\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"If I could give Modern City Group 6 stars, I would. Daniel and his team assessed all of the needed repairs for my bathroom project and carried them accordingly. They work diligently and efficiently with the tile of care and courtesy that distinguishes true professionals. Daniel answered all of my questions along the way with expertise.&nbsp;Clearly this local business takes a great deal of pride their work. I am so glad I hired them to handle my project and would 100% recommend their services to family and friends!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:42:51','2021-11-03 21:07:46','2021-11-03 21:07:46',NULL),(22,121,3,5.00,18,'Brooklyn, NY','Darya D.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=ArQe1eRP2daAenYs-HINfA&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=HMlieZEAYX9x31dJAgJteA',NULL,'{\"time\":1635973011145,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"UfwpT6hXgi\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We spent a good amount of time searching for contractors-kitchen around Brooklyn for our kitchen remodeling. One year ago we used to hire Modern Citi Group to complete our bathroom remodel. So we decided to contact Modern Citi Group for general contracting again. Licensed contractor Daniil guided us through the process from beginning to end- Daniil was a total professional. &nbsp;He is patient, creative and so knowledgeable- and truly wants his client to be totally satisfied.I don\'t think anybody could ever say that planning a kitchen it\'s not stressful. However, I never got stressed with Modern Citi Group! We met a number of times, often tweaking and modifying the plan and design of our new kitchen until our project manager Matvei was confident we had everything we wanted. The entire process from start to finish was made to be as painless as possible. I am a bit over the top when it comes to details and Licensed Contractor Daniil and project manager Matvei were extremely detail oriented, so we were a \\\"good fit\\\".&nbsp;They remove all old cabinets from the kitchen and particularly finished all demolition works very quickly. So, I would like to say that Modern Citi Group team completed such a very professional job with flooring! Our new hard wood floor looks amazing! Also our project included installation of dishwasher. Since we never had it on our kitchen they connected the machine to the pipes of the main water supply system. This part is more exited for me and probably for every women in the topic of having dishwasher in the kitchen.&nbsp;Our project manager Matvei also suggested to us that we could installed LED lights to make our kitchen even more modern. However, from the beginning our kitchen remodel project took only 3,5 week to complete it all. Can\'t say enough about design! Modern Citi Group team didn\'t just do a great job making our kitchen look beautiful, they and especially residential contractor Daniil were very fair with their rates and completed the project on time (these are some of the pain points with other contractors I have worked with).If you are looking for any home improvement or home remodeling contractors in New York, look no further. Thank you Daniil! We will definitely be working together in future.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:45:16','2022-08-16 18:39:14','2022-08-16 18:39:14',NULL),(23,121,3,5.00,19,NULL,'Pavel M.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=Zdp63jjrpxC6GFHLMuNd4Q&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=-VpMcqDRxta6OqmQv_VEyQ',NULL,'{\"time\":1656398497765,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"s_XsFZfk7X\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We were looking for a company to renovate and remodel our office last month. Our day to day activities requires us to be constantly on the phone, so finishing renovation in a short period of time was critical, as we couldn\'t activate with if there is a lot of background noise. &nbsp;We had a general concept of what we wanted so we began speaking to several contractors. &nbsp;Immediately, from our first meeting, we knew Modern Citi Group was the design and renovation firm for us. Me and my partner &nbsp;had an incredibly positive experience to work with Daniil and Modern Citi Group team. They made sure to accommodate our needs. Daniel could not have been more helpful in discussing our vision with us and guiding us through the entire process from our first consultation to the end result. &nbsp;He also designed, created, and installed a custom office furniture based on our needs and fully automated lighting system for us. Everything was done perfectly and timely manner. We were so impressed with work they did.&nbsp;We want to say thank to general contractor Daniel and Modern Citi Group team! Would definitely recommend them!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:47:54','2022-08-28 00:13:51','2022-08-28 00:13:51',NULL),(24,121,3,5.00,20,'Manhattan, NY','Jimmy L.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=j40VfhfRsnSy6yXrDWWx5Q&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=xuUnEaKbnY1cJLE9PE95fA',NULL,'{\"time\":1634312991613,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"hjepBiTGRv\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We hired Modern Citi Group to do a gut renovation of our 3 bedroom prewar apartment in manhattan (full electrical rewiring, replacement of all plumbing, demolition of walls, re-plastering/painting all walls, refinishing hardwood floors, remodeled completely 2 bathrooms and kitchen, pocket door installation, closet install etc.).Quality of the work was great and were able to start the project a week after agreement which I was pleasantly surprised. All permits and paperworks were done a timely manner without any issues. The team helped along the way to make the project go smoothly with my building and managing office. A couple of issues came up along the way and the team was able to resolve all of them pretty fast.On the negative side, a few issues came up but can be easily resolved if you consider them for your project:-Timeline was not kept due in part of my building since they had mechanical issues with the elevators and extra work needed to be done to be compliant with the building requirements but towards the end of the project, the team was promising deadlines that they couldn\'t meet. The completion date kept being pushed back.-The worksite was dirty and finished work was unprotected (tiles/cabinets/appliances etc).&nbsp;I would highly recommend Modern Citi Group for any type of renovation (small or large) as they did a great job on our gut reno. Their team is well qualified in every field of renovation.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:49:52','2021-11-03 21:07:41','2021-11-03 21:07:41',NULL),(25,121,3,5.00,21,'New York','Steven P.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=SO_iWuxaY12g4hkPUBZ5MQ&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=cVxbhsyh7gKDdvhmtXttKw',NULL,'{\"time\":1660766089753,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"86JlMXuzGn\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Hired Modern Citi Group for my bathroom remodel. These guys were incredibly knowledgeable and creative when it came to the design. We picked the materials, colors and appliances so quickly, like they just sent it to me item by item and every thing was just exactly what I wanted. This gave me confidence that they actually listened to my idea and vision.T here was obviously some minor difficulties, but the project manager was always there to solve it before me even knowing or stressing. Thank you guys, great experience.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:51:52','2022-08-28 00:12:35','2022-08-28 00:12:35',NULL),(26,121,3,5.00,22,'New York','Jacquelyn P.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=N8b-4zBkE5RWmoPD6TCUAw&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=tVjM76oN8F4XN70ED1rjdw',NULL,'{\"time\":1635972616918,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"xpjYtt9W5Y\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I have to echo the sentiments of the other reviewers here.  Daniil and his team have been very attentive to our needs from Day1.  Daniil was available anytime we had a question or concern and worked with his team to remedy.  His customer service was impeccable and he even gave design suggestions and came up with creative solutions.  His team was respectful and attentive as well.  Tibor went above and beyond to make us happy and we are some picky folks!  In the end, we have a beautiful modern bathroom renovation that we are extremely happy with!  Would highly recommend them!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:53:09','2022-08-28 00:07:38','2022-08-28 00:07:38',NULL),(27,121,3,5.00,1,'New York','Sami A.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=fIcYz7vPOSZ0BTgbnieBgw&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=LeIjZEQYsyV2-lQYqRWbjw',NULL,'{\"time\":1656628923755,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"FykwRC4R-_\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I have been shopping around to renovate my bathroom for a while. I came across This company and Daniel was responsive from the first day. Three weeks later the bathroom was all done just like I imagined it and more. They are professional in their approach and like to give time and thought to everything they do.  They did an amazing job and would highly recommend them for any renovation project.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:55:14','2024-01-10 23:01:44',NULL,NULL),(28,121,3,5.00,24,'New York, NY','Justin S.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=AK3nmPNvKBvv5oJtmr6U0Q&utm_campaign=bizsite_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=fL0L9go_DoNeGjE0j4-Cng',NULL,'{\"time\":1634313451354,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"-6AiTD4bX1\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I hired this company to renovate a bathroom in my New York City apartment. This company did everything that they promised to do. They were professional , courteous and more importantly honest. I have dealt with many contractors, but Come N Done really exceeded my expectations. They were on the job site every day. Always punctual. And always maintained a very transparent and clear communication channel. There were never any surprises. It speaks a lot about them and their character. I would highly recommend using this company.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.22.2\"}','2021-10-15 15:57:31','2021-10-17 19:44:59','2021-10-17 19:44:59',NULL),(29,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Anhen A.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=zSlSvKWsaQ8G9StOEUEHAQ&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660419082254,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"3WyV8XQ1b1\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"So the funny thing about this review is that it took longer to write than it took contractor Modern Citi Group to bid and finish the job!Daniil and his team Modern Citi are AWESOME at their job and very adaptable when it comes to unexpectable curveballs!In a way, Daniil is that rare contractor who truly looks at the big picture of it all and cares about little detail along the way. Daniil and designer Viktoriya were extremely helpful making sure I got exactly what I wanted. So, there is no ambiguity when getting things done.In the middle of 2021, I had just purchased a new apartment in Midtown Manhattan that needed some renovations done. I initially contacted Modern Citi Group to remodel my guest bathroom and bathroom in the master bedroom. After I got remodeling visualization from their design team, I realized I wanted to keep my apartment in one fresh look.Then I started adding other projects, which included installing a new floor in the entire apartment, patching drywall (after I decided to soundproof walls over the apartment after we found out that they were practically paper thin), wall painting, and replacing the lighting fixtures in my master bedroom.Throughout the duration of construction and remodeling with Modern Citi Group 100% of work was well done. They made it feel like such an easy, breezy process and if you want to be safe, do it with Modern Citi Group and let Daniil and his crew handle it for you.I received timely updates on the schedule and payments. Everything was itemized and related to the initial estimates. They are honest and fully transparent, and will not let you down in this area if this is the route you\'d like to go.In short, I give Daniil and his team my highest commendation for how professional they are. Five starts! Ten out of ten!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-13 19:32:07','2022-12-21 00:40:56','2022-12-21 00:40:56',NULL),(30,94,3,4.00,NULL,'Brooklyn, NY','Cecilia C.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=vAg-jPqVpR4Wi3uu-KPn6Q&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660669240435,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"bPGQiEjzpu\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<span class=\\\" raw__09f24__T4Ezm\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\\\">We hired Daniel and his team to remodel our kitchen. If you could even call what we had a kitchen. He was willing to work with a limited budget which was nice. We did have to stay on top of the details but Daniel was a pleasure to work with and very responsive and made any changes we needed. We loved the finished project. We would have given him 5 stars if he only did the kitchen but we gave him 4 stars because we had him refinish our wood floors and the guys he contracted it out to did not do a good job. Daniel of course had a different guy come and fix the floors. He said he wasn\'t going to use those guys again. So all In all we were happy with the finished product. Tibor the one who worked on our unit most of the time was really good. He was neat/clean and pleasant to work with.</span>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-16 17:28:07','2022-08-27 19:48:05',NULL,NULL),(31,94,3,4.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Lesley K.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=_KOM0NdIlvJMWRZ0YJOWGA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660679091930,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"fmVjAgL3FJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Found this company thru Craigslist. Daniel got back to me really quickly and the next day he came to give me the estimate. I had a few contractors give me quotes and he worked with me to give me the best price for my kitchen renovation. He was professional and addressed any concerns I had throughout the project.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-16 17:37:41','2024-01-10 23:01:04','2024-01-10 23:01:04',NULL),(32,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Jimmy L.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=j40VfhfRsnSy6yXrDWWx5Q&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660672754327,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"X-cXAilQZ6\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We hired Modern Citi Group to do a gut renovation of our 3 bedroom prewar apartment in manhattan (full electrical rewiring, replacement of all plumbing, demolition of walls, re-plastering/painting all walls, refinishing hardwood floors, remodeled completely 2 bathrooms and kitchen, pocket door installation, closet install etc.). Quality of the work was great and were able to start the project a week after agreement which I was pleasantly surprised.&nbsp; All permits and paperworks were done a timely manner without any issues. The team helped along the way to make the project go smoothly with my building and managing office. A couple of issues came up along the way and the team was able to resolve all of them pretty fast. On the negative side, a few issues came up but can be easily resolved if you consider them for your project: \"}},{\"id\":\"S0Eg0TGH2e\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"-Timeline was not kept due in part of my building since they had mechanical issues with the elevators and extra work needed to be done to be compliant with the building requirements but towards the end of the project, the team was promising deadlines that they couldn\'t meet. The completion date kept being pushed back.\"}},{\"id\":\"wkzMX0ZAB9\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"-The worksite was dirty and finished work was unprotected (tiles/cabinets/appliances etc). I would highly recommend Modern Citi Group for any type of renovation (small or large) as they did a great job on our gut reno. Their team is well qualified in every field of renovation.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-16 18:21:19','2022-08-27 19:46:51',NULL,NULL),(33,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Midwood, NY','Bohdan V.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=MygaQDcmbhnmiP4H1s4PzA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660674766270,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Tue7cLno52\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I remodeled my small kitchen (10x10) in mid-December and tore down the wall and opened it up into the dining room. Daniil was my main contact person. I could tell the passion of knowledge this young man has. My every question was answered with honesty. Modern Citi Group team set to work immediately after we organized the whole project with Daniil. They gutted the kitchen and installed new floor tile, backsplash, cabinets, new bar counter and recessed lighting. The transformation of my new kitchen was amazing! Modern Citi Group finished the kitchen remodel a week ahead of schedule. I highly recommend this company to everyone! They are very professional and experienced in their work.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-16 18:38:55','2024-01-10 22:59:59','2024-01-10 22:59:59',NULL),(34,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Brooklyn, NY','Raman S.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=FdhE_SulBK0cQryY2pwGyw&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660679413611,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"-6m5JCeAF4\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I was purchasing my first apartment in Midtown East knowing that kitchen and bathroom will have to be remodeled. Daniil and his team at Modern Citi Group came highly recommended from my wife\'s brother and I can\'t say enough of how easy and professional the entire process was. My main concern that I told Daniil about from the beginning was not to go over the budget - and luckily I didn\'t, in fact, they provided different options that fit in my budget and explained all possible unforeseen surprises. Now, the kitchen looks amazing, we have brand new kitchen cabinets, new stainless steel appliances (range, hood, double sink, added a dishwasher), quartz countertop (was thinking about natural stone / marble first) with matching backsplash and they also picked and installed a very beautiful floor tile which Im in love with. I didn\'t like is the old radiator by the window, which my building didn\'t allow to replace, and they fabricated and installed a beautiful custom radiator cover. Bathroom used to have an old bathtub that I disliked. So we converted it into a walk in shower, with the bench and spacious shower niche. It was a gut renovation, so we obviously replaced water lines, shut off valves, toilet, vanity (wall mounted now), and everything else that the bathroom had. Everything is now completely new.I should\'ve posted this review earlier. I recommend Modern Citi Group to everyone looking for kitchen, bathroom remodel or any other interior renovation. Either you\'re looking on Yelp or elsewhere - this is a go to company.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-16 19:51:09','2022-08-22 14:53:34','2022-08-22 14:53:34',NULL),(35,94,3,4.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Steve',NULL,NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=5nFvjDvh1hwHRs1aqj6UpA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1660679595643,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"x8hCczmi8V\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel and his team were very professional and responded quickly to our needs when remodeling our bathroom. They worked us throughout the process and ran all decisions during work by us before moving forward. They were able to complete the job on time and with quality. We had a few follow-ups that needed attention, and they were able to come back the next day and fix. Would highly recommend if you are looking at doing a renovation.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-16 19:54:07','2022-08-28 00:12:47','2022-08-28 00:12:47',NULL),(36,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Oakdale, NY','Justin S.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=AK3nmPNvKBvv5oJtmr6U0Q&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660679773922,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"hAGyEYG2Ui\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<span class=\\\" raw__09f24__T4Ezm\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\\\">I hired this company to renovate a bathroom in my New York City apartment. This company did everything that they promised to do. They were professional , courteous and more importantly honest. I have dealt with many contractors, but Come N Done really exceeded my expectations. They were on the job site every day. Always punctual. And always maintained a very transparent and clear communication channel. There were never any surprises. It speaks a lot about them and their character. I would highly recommend using this company.</span>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-16 19:58:19','2022-08-16 19:58:19',NULL,NULL),(37,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Sergio L.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=mvhDyMW7iqQCBR4E4zKKRQ&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1724437391034,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"m9K1ppruxN\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"These guys are seriously the Mercedes Benz of Kitchens. If you\'re looking for kitchen remodeling contractor in New York to make the kitchen of your dreams pick up the phone and call Modern Citi Group. We had plans of remodeling our kitchen with new granite countertops and backsplash...\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1704928187150,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"PbI19EHEhz\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"These guys are seriously the Mercedes Benz of Kitchens. If you\'re looking for kitchen remodeling contractor in New York to make the kitchen of your dreams pick up the phone and call Modern Citi Group. We had plans of remodeling our kitchen with new granite countertops and backsplash.&nbsp; So, we did some researching on companies in our local area that we would feel comfortable with. I\'m so glad to found residential general Contractor Daniil from Modern Citi Group for our kitchen remodel project. After meeting with the design team, they quickly turned our boring kitchen into the vision we had wanted for quite some time. We know from past experience that when it comes to construction or home remodeling it\'s best not to look for bargains. Too many things can go wrong when dealing with the wrong people. It can end up costing even more money to have it redone properly not to even mention all the aggravation. Daniil is the best licensed contractor we\'ve ever used. We couldn\'t be happier with the results and will definitely hire Daniil as a home remodeling contractor and Modern Citi Group team again for&nbsp;&nbsp;our renovation projects!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-16 20:47:09','2024-08-23 18:37:02',NULL,NULL),(38,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Brooklyn, NY','Yura G.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=EfcCzvyaFSEQVG36Eg_NIA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660683286877,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"5nhZvh1C7d\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel and his team did an amazing job on our bathroom renovation. I really like the communication during renovation process, &nbsp;the team didn\'t miss any days, which is a rare. Highly recommend them to everyone.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-16 20:56:33','2022-08-28 00:21:15','2022-08-28 00:21:15',NULL),(39,94,5,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Andrew O',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1661646115101,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"K5KqsZRKET\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After long search I\'ve decided that Modern Citi Group is the type of construction company I will work with to renovate my bathroom in a really old building (from the 70\'s) in Queens. On my first call we schedule a walk-through meeting with a project manager Matvei. He organized all my wants based on the budget we agreed and presented to me in a very detailed estimate right on the next day. We continued to communicate and discuss the final changes for a few more days and I ended up signing a contract with home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group for a full bathroom remodel. I especially liked the communication with Matvei, as he always was quick to respond throughout the project. He and his designers team also helped with material selection and explained the process thoroughly throughout the entire time. Moreover, what I like best is that project manager Matvei really keeps me informed as the job progresses and is really hands on with the entire process. From start to finish these guys from bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group were professional, courteous and knowledgeable.\\n \\nI am more than pleased with the outcome and anyone looking to remodel their bathroom the right way should give this renovation contractor company a call. Well deserved 5 star review from a very picky and satisfied customer!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 14:13:07','2024-01-10 23:06:11','2024-01-10 23:06:11',NULL),(40,94,3,5.00,1,'New York, NY','Eddie C.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=rkA2nc1oUfkRPhCn2xkRFw&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1704928016418,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"5er8oJvG0o\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"MCG shows how a business should be run, they\'re very professional through the whole process from the beginning, responsive to our calls and emails and great quotation details by breaking down per items for things that we wanted to do for our project. Very polite and accommodating which is very different from other contractors that we\'ve found. I\'d definitely recommend Modern Citi Group to friends and family in the future!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 15:26:11','2024-01-10 23:08:23','2024-01-10 23:08:23',NULL),(41,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','John H.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=F-JdFaRrEk2-weSpZhLrEA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1661648448116,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"L6fO6tm7vB\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I have used modern citi for several projects in our commercial space. The team is responsive and does good work with fair prices. We will use them again for sure.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 15:30:08','2024-01-10 23:01:50','2024-01-10 23:01:50',NULL),(42,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Deanna C.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=F6dOjbmwmyacMOLCEaG0Mg&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660750386339,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"LiwKb4jxAF\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We recently rented out additional commercial space to host private parties and to extend the kitchen in our existing restaurant located in Greenwich Village. We were looking for a construction company that could connect this private room with a restaurant and kitchen in a short period of time. So that the staff could easily move around and serve our customers well. Besides, we needed to build an extra private restroom in this new room. Fortunately, Modern Citi Group became the company we were looking for.&nbsp; We contacted several general contractors, but Daniil from Modern Citi Group gave us his assessment and set an incredibly short frame. It was the best offer for us! A few days later, we finally approved the project with Daniil.&nbsp; After that, Modern Citi Group team began its work. Initially, it was an empty rectangular room.&nbsp; According to our commercial project, they built a soundproofing wall to separate the kitchen from the guest area.&nbsp; And also built two passages: the first one service to connect the new and old kitchens, another entrance is located between the kitchen and the new dining room space. It is intended directly for staff and taking food out to customers in the private room. In addition, a small private restroom was built for guests. When the demolition process have been done, Daniil and his team started to renovate the new kitchen and the new dining area. They made hardwood installation floors for the guest area in the kitchen. We chose decorative wallpaper for wall decoration and private room. We approved hanging rectangular decorative frame mirrors to complement the decor and increase visual space. We pursued the same goal in the restroom. They were mirrors installed on the entire wall. The floor and walls of the new restaurant were finished with the gray ceramic tiles. Furthermore, Modern Citi Group installed a new heating system, which was very important for us during this winter season. They fully equipped us with the regulated lighting system.&nbsp; After a month of renovation our new additional room for private parties begin to work. Modern Citi Group team was very professional and pleasant to work with. They have done a huge renovation/remodeling project within such a short timeline. I am proud to share a new dining room event with our customers. I would definitely recommend Modern Citi Group to anyone and everyone looking for a licensed general contractor that works in many commercial buildings in New York City.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 15:38:38','2024-01-10 22:51:53','2024-01-10 22:51:53',NULL),(43,94,3,5.00,10,'New York, NY','Alex M.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=gvHp7YvV-wAQkJ6qgZCrBA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660750823409,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"XK1c0jWJSa\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel and his team completed the job as I visioned. They were on time and very professional. Will definitely hire them in the future\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 15:42:01','2022-08-28 01:05:00','2022-08-28 01:05:00',NULL),(44,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Manhattan, New York, NY','Hui Z.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=m09awUQ5lNNmze7SHCJKtg&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660751139595,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"yiwsgPjYtH\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Great service with affordable price! They did really good job for my company property! We will continue to work together in the future!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 15:46:33','2022-08-28 00:06:37','2022-08-28 00:06:37',NULL),(45,94,5,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Kevin Glesman',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660745777184,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"_a8Wc1buHR\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We used Modern Citi Group for a brand new restaurant renovation after hearing about them through a referral. They ended up being the right fit for us. We had deadlines throughout the process and they were able to navigate every difficulty that naturally comes up when tearing down a restaurant and building it back up from scratch. The team is filled with talented people who stay calm in a crisis and complete projects on time. They are real professionals and as we expand into more of South Beach, they will be our contractors.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 18:31:32','2024-01-10 22:51:34','2024-01-10 22:51:34',NULL),(46,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Brooklyn, NY','Mannyy R.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=ZL0nQrAhqbujS1gTX86v5A&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660761247599,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"TQOfe5DFmC\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"They renovated my restroom and also redid my deck. All in all they did great for a reasonable price! Came on time and did what they were supposed to. Daniel is a very nice guy, he explained everything and gave me some advice about keeping my deck looking good and fresh. Thank you guys!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 18:36:02','2022-08-28 00:14:58','2022-08-28 00:14:58',NULL),(47,94,3,4.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Anna Jacinta M.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=QMHEm05lfcMpRqbotB4PaA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660761447051,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"gE533J8KWL\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel worked with me to install kitchen cabinets and baseboards. Our building is very strict on who we can hire as contractors and Daniel and his team had all the paperwork necessary for our building (we submitted four options that got rejected before finding MCG). His team was on time and they had to extend the days they worked but were always very courteous and let us know what was happening with the project. Daniel worked with us to find a good time that fit our schedule and needs. The baseboards were installed swiftly and very well. They did an excellent job at repairing a mediocre job my family member did on trying to install flooring. I would say that the only thing I found was some attention to detail, like peeling the sticker off the fume hood before installing it (which I had to do afterwards) or making sure the edge of the countertop was cut more smoothly (which is not too visible, but some of my detail oriented family members noticed). Other than that everything was really great, and I will definitely hire them again for our next contracting needs.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 18:40:33','2022-08-28 00:15:27','2022-08-28 00:15:27',NULL),(48,94,5,5.00,NULL,'Bronx','Mykola Hleha',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660762832363,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"gIlzUQV03U\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Residential Contractor Modern Citi Group knows how to take care of all your needs! I found them through positive Yelp reviews as well as from a neighbor in Bronx referral who’d done the same.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 19:03:21','2022-08-28 00:15:31','2022-08-28 00:15:31',NULL),(49,94,5,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Catherine Sarkis',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660763241652,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"H0RIZBZ11R\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I own a medical office in Brooklyn and we hired Modern Citi Group for a full office Remodel. Our office was very dated and we were in desperate need of renovation. We felt like updating the office would look better but also help office morale, inspire our team and cut down on turnover.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 19:07:50','2024-01-10 22:51:29','2024-01-10 22:51:29',NULL),(50,94,4,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Emily D',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1661647273571,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"gAaej_Na7U\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Experienced team, a lot of good insight throughout the project. Smart and sharp would be how I would describe them. The engineers were nice to work with and brought a lot of education to our whole team. Handled adversity well, finished everything on schedule and under budget which I thought was a miracle. I highly recommend them for any sort of major renovation or remodel.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 19:11:20','2024-01-10 22:56:40','2024-01-10 22:56:40',NULL),(51,94,4,5.00,NULL,'Miami, FL','Sam Calvano',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660763973878,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"2D3tMYQpN4\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"These guys are great. They are smart and great to work with for a big project. They are filled with talented people and they have a huge team. We used them for some major renovation projects around Miami and they were well equipped to handle every obstacle we came across. I feel like we are in good hands with them. They are our new vendor going forward!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 19:24:37','2022-08-28 01:41:13','2022-08-28 01:41:13',NULL),(52,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Michelle Young',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660764390871,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"F8plDAeq_H\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We hired them after searching Yelp for a general contractor for a few weeks. They had strong reviews and I got a really good vibe from the owner. It proved to be a good decision. The team did amazing work and finished everything on schedule. They were diligent with our time and deadlines. Very honest and professional, helped us save money in a few areas. Would definitely recommend.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 19:28:52','2023-03-10 03:33:33','2023-03-10 03:33:33',NULL),(53,94,3,5.00,8,'New York, NY','Julia G',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1661652306992,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"bHq0nFHKiO\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We’ve hired MCG for our home remodeling in Staten Island a few month ago. Daniil is full of integrity, he’s honest, punctual, and is creatively competent. Moreover, I felt like everyone on the team genuinely appreciated me. They are going out of their way to make sure your project is completed to your satisfaction, and that is why I recommended to work with them as your residential general contractor in NYC! \\n\\nOur home is 27 years old and this was our first major bathroom and kitchen remodel. All staff from renovation contractor Modern Citi Group were very knowledgeable and made the whole process go smoothly. Modern Cit Group design crew took our old looking bathrooms and made them look like a luxury hotel bathrooms complete with all the beautiful amenities: custom tile, jacuzzi, steam shower, new toilets all beautifully and perfectly installed by Modern Citi Group team. We had issue with our wood floor as it was squeaking in certain parts of the living room and kitchen area. We also had a leak under our sink and the floor and the cabinets where all damaged and moldy. We explained to project designers our wishes and issues. They helped us design the kitchen area and made a visual representation of it so we can see which was really great. Modern Citi Group have done with new tile floor in the kitchen and wood floor in living room area, finished wall painting and installed new modern custom kitchen cabinets with marble countertop. Further, they took our girls 10\' x 10\' room and completed update it by all finishing works. \\n\\nYou will be in really good hands hiring these guys. Got super lucky and found them on Yelp.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-17 19:36:35','2024-01-10 22:49:54','2024-01-10 22:49:54',NULL),(54,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Carmel, IN','Oleksandra S.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=nyMK8mTyQIm-10s4_nltqw&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=SxPNnPSK41gofD8vI_BZDg','{\"time\":1726223230294,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"BCPrhCn0r2\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We had a great experience, both the construction and communication were impeccable. The team was responsive and helpful.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726223239155,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"YOxwzgYe8-\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"My family just finished renovating our three story house with Modern Citi Group. We had a great experience, both the construction and communication were impeccable. The team was responsive and helpful. Anna kept in touch with us every step of the way and provided guidance on design and layout, answered all our questions and overall she was a pleasure to work with.The construction team was very professional and respectful, the guys were all very nice and knowledgeable, tons of experience in the field. The walls were done impeccably, the wood floors came out perfect, and bathroom is like a real spa now. We are very happy with the final result!For the amount of work and support the team provided, the overall cost of the project seems to be very fair.I would definitely recommend using Modern Citi Group.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-13 10:28:19','2024-09-13 10:28:19',NULL,'2023-10-25 00:00:00'),(55,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, New York','Ann B.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=J5KThjMWzZlRHP8gkOzwYQ&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)','https://www.yelp.com/user_details?userid=6snujC33Aez9S9yU4Gwzaw','{\"time\":1726596624670,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"VuK-Uv5x5L\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I selected Modern Citi Group based on the online reviews, and they did not disappoint. I liked Anna from the moment she came to view the job, and she was extremely knowledgeable and easy to work with. She was always available, via text, to answer any questions I had.They renovated my small galley kitchen and they did an outstanding job creating a sleek, stylish and functional new kitchen. It is just beautiful, it now looks like a real kitchen. Their work is impeccable - at the final walk through, I did not find even one item that had to be addressed.I highly recommend them.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726596626117,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"JvJWyPsLWg\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I selected Modern Citi Group based on the online reviews, and they did not disappoint. I liked Anna from the moment she came to view the job, and she was extremely knowledgeable and easy to work with. She was always available, via text, to answer any questions I had.They renovated my small galley kitchen and they did an outstanding job creating a sleek, stylish and functional new kitchen. It is just beautiful, it now looks like a real kitchen. Their work is impeccable - at the final walk through, I did not find even one item that had to be addressed.I highly recommend them.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 18:10:06','2024-09-17 18:10:28',NULL,'2023-03-19 00:00:00'),(56,94,5,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Jacob Lee',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1893229/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726596791636,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"0gNHMTPq_H\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group (MCG) recently completed our renovation for a one bedroom apartment, which included a full renovation of the bathroom and kitchen along with other cosmetic changes throughout the apartment. We contracted with MCG in July 2022 and were impressed with their organized system for selecting the scope of the renovation (material selection, projected outcomes, etc.)  We worked closely with Daniil and his team. Overall, the apartment looks great and adheres closely to the planned renovation.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726596795425,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"spZo2rqjUk\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group (MCG) recently completed our renovation for a one bedroom apartment, which included a full renovation of the bathroom and kitchen along with other cosmetic changes throughout the apartment. We contracted with MCG in July 2022 and were impressed with their organized system for selecting the scope of the renovation (material selection, projected outcomes, etc.)  We worked closely with Daniil and his team. Overall, the apartment looks great and adheres closely to the planned renovation.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 18:14:47','2024-09-17 18:14:47',NULL,'2023-03-05 00:00:00'),(57,94,5,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Mykola Hleha',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1564746/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726596997433,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"yYb5sOhTBY\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Residential Contractor Modern Citi Group knows how to take care of all your needs! I found them through positive Yelp reviews as well as from a neighbor in Bronx referral who’d done the same.It was a pleasure to work with these professionals. Our project manager Artem creative design ideas are outstanding and truly \\\"out of the box\\\". Besides, he picked and ordered all the material, even the kitchen appliances which are perfectly matched. When our kitchen remodeling project turned to demolition and painting, kitchen contractor MCG took care of covering all my furniture. Moreover, they did a great job installing new cabinets, the backsplash and countertops. Everything looks so good and brand new. I can\'t believe this is the same home!No less important thing during this difficult time, the company is following all precautions. All workers from licensed contractor Modern Citi Group followed the social distancing guidelines and they all wore masks at all times.Home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group did an amazing job on the kitchen and I couldn\'t be happier with how it turned out.Love the creativity of this company! Keep doing a great job!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726597000511,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"2kSX4dnKrk\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Residential Contractor Modern Citi Group knows how to take care of all your needs! I found them through positive Yelp reviews as well as from a neighbor in Bronx referral who’d done the same.It was a pleasure to work with these professionals. Our project manager Artem creative design ideas are outstanding and truly \\\"out of the box\\\". Besides, he picked and ordered all the material, even the kitchen appliances which are perfectly matched. When our kitchen remodeling project turned to demolition and painting, kitchen contractor MCG took care of covering all my furniture. Moreover, they did a great job installing new cabinets, the backsplash and countertops. Everything looks so good and brand new. I can\'t believe this is the same home!No less important thing during this difficult time, the company is following all precautions. All workers from licensed contractor Modern Citi Group followed the social distancing guidelines and they all wore masks at all times.Home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group did an amazing job on the kitchen and I couldn\'t be happier with how it turned out.Love the creativity of this company! Keep doing a great job!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 18:17:13','2024-09-17 18:17:13',NULL,'2021-02-25 00:00:00'),(58,94,5,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Catherine Sarkis',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1473567/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726597140946,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"SkOdUfZEci\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I own a medical office in Brooklyn and we hired Modern Citi Group for a full office Remodel. Our office was very dated and we were in desperate need of renovation. We felt like updating the office would look better but also help office morale, inspire our team and cut down on turnover.The team at Modern Citi Group was very detail oriented and easy to work with. Everyone seemed really smart and on the ball. I felt like we were in good hands from the beginning. Having said that, we didn\'t know what the final product would look like until the end. They had to take it down to build it up but when the office was finished we were so happy! It actually looks amazing and I couldn\'t be happier with the contractors we hired or with our decision to do a full Office Remodel.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726597143995,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"fT7C8T0lhY\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I own a medical office in Brooklyn and we hired Modern Citi Group for a full office Remodel. Our office was very dated and we were in desperate need of renovation. We felt like updating the office would look better but also help office morale, inspire our team and cut down on turnover.The team at Modern Citi Group was very detail oriented and easy to work with. Everyone seemed really smart and on the ball. I felt like we were in good hands from the beginning. Having said that, we didn\'t know what the final product would look like until the end. They had to take it down to build it up but when the office was finished we were so happy! It actually looks amazing and I couldn\'t be happier with the contractors we hired or with our decision to do a full Office Remodel.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 18:19:34','2024-09-17 18:19:34',NULL,'2020-08-20 00:00:00'),(59,94,5,5.00,NULL,'South Beach, Florida','Emily Degrom',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1468892/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726597282427,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"6JyVCXWXae\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Quality subcontractor in South Beach. Experienced team, a lot of good insight throughout the project. Smart and sharp would be how I would describe them. The engineers were nice to work with and brought a lot of education to our whole team. Handled adversity well, finished everything on schedule and under budget which I thought was a miracle. I highly recommend them for any sort of major renovation or remodel.\"}}],\"