professionals and as we expand into more of South Beach, they will be our contractors.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 18:24:28','2024-09-17 19:21:42',NULL,'2020-08-05 00:00:00'),(61,94,5,5.00,NULL,'Brooklyn, NY','Valentina Sula',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1378878/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726597549081,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"e-1QUkVgYU\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I decided to select Modern Citi Group to gut and renovate our kitchen in the Bensonhurst apartment two months ago. Having gone through the renovation of other areas of my home, we know what a process that can be. Having no kitchen would be upsetting; I love to cook and for me the kitchen is truly the heart of the home. Daniil and his crew made the whole process less stressful. Everything they did from start to finish was handled professionally which put me at ease. The whole team was excellent. I love my kitchen and I can’t wait to show it off. Thanks again to Daniil. You are the best! Five stars all around.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726597550710,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"dGcwl8u-BQ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I decided to select Modern Citi Group to gut and renovate our kitchen in the Bensonhurst apartment two months ago. Having gone through the renovation of other areas of my home, we know what a process that can be. Having no kitchen would be upsetting; I love to cook and for me the kitchen is truly the heart of the home. Daniil and his crew made the whole process less stressful. Everything they did from start to finish was handled professionally which put me at ease. The whole team was excellent. I love my kitchen and I can’t wait to show it off. Thanks again to Daniil. You are the best! Five stars all around.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 18:26:14','2024-09-17 18:26:14',NULL,'2020-01-17 00:00:00'),(62,94,5,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Michael',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1312527/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726597683034,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"jvJ0AoyFEn\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Hired this company for my kitchen renovation. Daniel was very easy to work with. What I liked the most is the communication that he and his team had with me. Literally every day I’d get a text from them, explaining what was completed today and what they will be doing tomorrow.I’ve had 4 renovations done before in my other apartments, but hands down, this was the smoothest one so far. Good luck to you guys!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726597685473,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"OyQIPYEZGx\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Hired this company for my kitchen renovation. Daniel was very easy to work with. What I liked the most is the communication that he and his team had with me. Literally every day I’d get a text from them, explaining what was completed today and what they will be doing tomorrow.I’ve had 4 renovations done before in my other apartments, but hands down, this was the smoothest one so far. Good luck to you guys!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 18:28:18','2024-09-17 18:28:18',NULL,'2019-09-03 00:00:00'),(63,94,5,5.00,NULL,'Miami, FL','Sam Calvano',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1465470/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726597771472,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"YOq49gGBM7\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"These guys are great. They are smart and great to work with for a big project. They are filled with talented people and they have a huge team. We used them for some major renovation projects around Miami and they were well equipped to handle every obstacle we came across. I feel like we are in good hands with them. They are our new vendor going forward!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726597773009,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"MgfefqzhiZ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"These guys are great. They are smart and great to work with for a big project. They are filled with talented people and they have a huge team. We used them for some major renovation projects around Miami and they were well equipped to handle every obstacle we came across. I feel like we are in good hands with them. They are our new vendor going forward!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 18:31:19','2024-09-17 18:31:19',NULL,'2020-07-31 00:00:00'),(64,94,5,5.00,NULL,'New York City','Michelle Young',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1460555/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726598284628,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"O0CxZxR1S0\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We hired them after searching Yelp for a general contractor for a few weeks. They had strong reviews and I got a really good vibe from the owner. It proved to be a good decision. The team did amazing work and finished everything on schedule. They were diligent with our time and deadlines. Very honest and professional, helped us save money in a few areas. Would definitely recommend.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726598297400,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"kO9btdFGEw\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We hired them after searching Yelp for a general contractor for a few weeks. They had strong reviews and I got a really good vibe from the owner. It proved to be a good decision. The team did amazing work and finished everything on schedule. They were diligent with our time and deadlines. Very honest and professional, helped us save money in a few areas. Would definitely recommend.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 18:39:11','2024-09-17 18:39:11',NULL,'2020-07-18 00:00:00'),(65,94,5,5.00,NULL,'New York, New York','Ruslan Kovalchuk',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1313518/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726598631000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"qMPJ62v1hz\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"If I could give Modern City Group 6 stars, I would. Daniel and his team assessed all of the needed repairs for my bathroom project and carried them accordingly. They work diligently and efficiently with the tile of care and courtesy that distinguishes true professionals. Daniel answered all of my questions along the way with expertise.Clearly this local business takes a great deal of pride their work. I am so glad I hired them to handle my project and would 100% recommend their services to family and friends!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726598632938,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"LVm_UorExV\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"If I could give Modern City Group 6 stars, I would. Daniel and his team assessed all of the needed repairs for my bathroom project and carried them accordingly. They work diligently and efficiently with the tile of care and courtesy that distinguishes true professionals. Daniel answered all of my questions along the way with expertise.Clearly this local business takes a great deal of pride their work. I am so glad I hired them to handle my project and would 100% recommend their services to family and friends!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 19:19:14','2024-09-17 19:19:14',NULL,'2019-09-15 00:00:00'),(66,94,5,5.00,NULL,'Queens, NY','Taron Arhakian',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1428833/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726601012319,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"6UCo_ePj52\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I am quite sure I hired a magician home remodeling contractor in New York because this man from Modern Citi Group and his team are 100% magic!My building in Queens was built in the 1990s and had a bathroom was never remodeled. I wanted it to be completely gutted and redone and I knew it would be a major undertaking. According to my plan I began to search for a right person to had a general contracting with.My close friend recommended to give a call to one of the local bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group. Next day I met with renovation contractor Daniil and he drew up preliminary plans for a brand new bathroom remodeling. I also understood that I would need a good designer to fulfill all my needs. After our first meeting, Daniil met me with his designer and project manager.The original design of the bathroom was kind of that pinky/beige marble that was really popular in the 90\'s and was kind of hip/classic at the time. I definitely prefer a bit more of a cleaner, white tile look, and decided at least make it look awesome! It\'s a tight space, and they made sure to help us utilize every inch.From demolition to completion Modern Citi Group team were patient, kind, dependable, and knowledgeable. What was the most important in their work, they always kept me informed as to what would be happening each day.Now we have a beautiful bathroom that I will enjoy for years to come! In just over a month, my old, rundown bathroom became a gorgeous new - classic with a glam twist - bathroom. We were right on time and on budget. I am so thrilled with the final product. Hands down, working with kitchen contractor Daniil and his Modern Citi Group team was a great decision\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726601014553,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"nJ0eLUhkrR\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I am quite sure I hired a magician home remodeling contractor in New York because this man from Modern Citi Group and his team are 100% magic!My building in Queens was built in the 1990s and had a bathroom was never remodeled. I wanted it to be completely gutted and redone and I knew it would be a major undertaking. According to my plan I began to search for a right person to had a general contracting with.My close friend recommended to give a call to one of the local bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group. Next day I met with renovation contractor Daniil and he drew up preliminary plans for a brand new bathroom remodeling. I also understood that I would need a good designer to fulfill all my needs. After our first meeting, Daniil met me with his designer and project manager.The original design of the bathroom was kind of that pinky/beige marble that was really popular in the 90\'s and was kind of hip/classic at the time. I definitely prefer a bit more of a cleaner, white tile look, and decided at least make it look awesome! It\'s a tight space, and they made sure to help us utilize every inch.From demolition to completion Modern Citi Group team were patient, kind, dependable, and knowledgeable. What was the most important in their work, they always kept me informed as to what would be happening each day.Now we have a beautiful bathroom that I will enjoy for years to come! In just over a month, my old, rundown bathroom became a gorgeous new - classic with a glam twist - bathroom. We were right on time and on budget. I am so thrilled with the final product. Hands down, working with kitchen contractor Daniil and his Modern Citi Group team was a great decision\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 19:24:53','2024-09-17 19:24:53',NULL,'2020-05-04 00:00:00'),(67,94,5,5.00,NULL,'Staten Island, NY','Julija',NULL,'https://www.houzz.com/viewReview/1442151/modern-citi-group-renovations-remodeling-review',NULL,'{\"time\":1726601232600,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"is_WCgGH9-\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Nowadays the amount of construction companies is probably as big as the amount of restaurants. When you are choosing a restaurant for dinner, you never know that you gonna like there. There is the same situation with construction companies. You never know how reliable they are, but general contractor Modern Citi Group is definitely “the best restaurant” in the construction business!We’ve hired licensed contractor Daniil for our home remodeling in Staten Island a few month ago. He is full of integrity, he’s honest, punctual, and is creatively competent. Moreover, residential contractor Modern Citi Group team genuinely appreciates their costumers. They are going out of their way to make sure your project is completed to your satisfaction, and that is why I recommended to work with them as your residential general contractor in NYC!Our home is 27 years old and this was our first major bathroom and kitchen remodel. All staff from renovation contractor Modern Citi Group were very knowledgeable and made the whole process go smoothly. Modern Cit Group design crew took our old looking bathrooms and made them look like a luxury hotel bathrooms complete with all the beautiful amenities: custom tile, jacuzzi, steam shower, new toilets all beautifully and perfectly installed by Modern Citi Group team. We had issue with our wood floor as it was squeaking in certain parts of the living room and kitchen area. We also had a leak under our sink and the floor and the cabinets where all damaged and moldy. We explained to project designers our wishes and issues. They helped us design the kitchen area and made a visual representation of it so we can see which was really great. Modern Citi Group have done with new tile floor in the kitchen and wood floor in living room area, finished wall painting and installed new modern custom kitchen cabinets with marble countertop. Further, they took our girls 10\' x 10\' x 16\'h room and completed update it by all finishing works.You will be in really good hands hiring these guys. Got super lucky and found them on Yelp.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726601235178,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Ji1j7apqvl\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Nowadays the amount of construction companies is probably as big as the amount of restaurants. When you are choosing a restaurant for dinner, you never know that you gonna like there. There is the same situation with construction companies. You never know how reliable they are, but general contractor Modern Citi Group is definitely “the best restaurant” in the construction business!We’ve hired licensed contractor Daniil for our home remodeling in Staten Island a few month ago. He is full of integrity, he’s honest, punctual, and is creatively competent. Moreover, residential contractor Modern Citi Group team genuinely appreciates their costumers. They are going out of their way to make sure your project is completed to your satisfaction, and that is why I recommended to work with them as your residential general contractor in NYC!Our home is 27 years old and this was our first major bathroom and kitchen remodel. All staff from renovation contractor Modern Citi Group were very knowledgeable and made the whole process go smoothly. Modern Cit Group design crew took our old looking bathrooms and made them look like a luxury hotel bathrooms complete with all the beautiful amenities: custom tile, jacuzzi, steam shower, new toilets all beautifully and perfectly installed by Modern Citi Group team. We had issue with our wood floor as it was squeaking in certain parts of the living room and kitchen area. We also had a leak under our sink and the floor and the cabinets where all damaged and moldy. We explained to project designers our wishes and issues. They helped us design the kitchen area and made a visual representation of it so we can see which was really great. Modern Citi Group have done with new tile floor in the kitchen and wood floor in living room area, finished wall painting and installed new modern custom kitchen cabinets with marble countertop. Further, they took our girls 10\' x 10\' x 16\'h room and completed update it by all finishing works.You will be in really good hands hiring these guys. Got super lucky and found them on Yelp.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 19:28:19','2024-09-17 19:28:19',NULL,'2020-06-03 00:00:00'),(68,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Steven P',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=SO_iWuxaY12g4hkPUBZ5MQ&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726601553708,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"KDliwMd2Rx\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Hired Modern Citi Group for my bathroom remodel. These guys were incredibly knowledgeable and creative when it came to the design. We picked the materials, colors and appliances so quickly, like they just sent it to me item by item and every thing was just exactly what I wanted. This gave me confidence that they actually listened to my idea and vision.There was obviously some minor difficulties, but the project manager was always there to solve it before me even knowing or stressing.Thank you guys, great experience.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726601490894,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"nF-MxHu5qW\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Hired Modern Citi Group for my bathroom remodel. These guys were incredibly knowledgeable and creative when it came to the design. We picked the materials, colors and appliances so quickly, like they just sent it to me item by item and every thing was just exactly what I wanted. This gave me confidence that they actually listened to my idea and vision.There was obviously some minor difficulties, but the project manager was always there to solve it before me even knowing or stressing.Thank you guys, great experience.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 19:32:43','2024-09-17 19:32:43',NULL,'2019-09-06 00:00:00'),(69,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Brooklyn, NY','Laura F',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=VIb9pHIXEchjmJLEF5tyhw&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726601620909,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"EfxQCkmA9D\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We were fortunate to find General Contractor Daniil and his guys from Modern Citi Group for our home remodeling in Staten Island. Daniil was always on site supervising (unlike other general contractors we worked with previous) and would always be available to answer any questions or discuss any ongoing concerns with the construction.Daniil is a wonderful person to work with. He is thoughtful, efficient and organized, but also honest, trust-worthy and committed to quality. Throughout the project Daniil and his crew added small details and finishes that were out of the scope of the project but dramatically improved the final product. He also created a wonderful interior design for us which we extremely love. Moreover, Daniil helped to find and order all new furniture for living and dining room and new cabinets for our kitchen.Our remodel consisted of kitchen remodeling, dinning room and living room complete renovations. In addition to the extension we updated electrical, plumbing to remodeled and created the newly designed interior layout to finish demolition part and paint. Modern Citi Group team finished demolition process very quickly and installed new flooring. They also change countertop to granite and install new sink, faucet and range hood. After all, project turned to assembly furniture and installed all appliances.What was most impressive of how he and his group sucessfully troubleshooted through what proved to be an extremely complex job. They were about to cut time without sacrificing the quality.We are absolutely satisfied with the service and results! Thank YOU Daniil and Modern Citi Group for all your assistance and hardwork!Highly recommended this residential contractor in NYC!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726601624148,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ubN7S-Xizf\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We were fortunate to find General Contractor Daniil and his guys from Modern Citi Group for our home remodeling in Staten Island. Daniil was always on site supervising (unlike other general contractors we worked with previous) and would always be available to answer any questions or discuss any ongoing concerns with the construction.Daniil is a wonderful person to work with. He is thoughtful, efficient and organized, but also honest, trust-worthy and committed to quality. Throughout the project Daniil and his crew added small details and finishes that were out of the scope of the project but dramatically improved the final product. He also created a wonderful interior design for us which we extremely love. Moreover, Daniil helped to find and order all new furniture for living and dining room and new cabinets for our kitchen.Our remodel consisted of kitchen remodeling, dinning room and living room complete renovations. In addition to the extension we updated electrical, plumbing to remodeled and created the newly designed interior layout to finish demolition part and paint. Modern Citi Group team finished demolition process very quickly and installed new flooring. They also change countertop to granite and install new sink, faucet and range hood. After all, project turned to assembly furniture and installed all appliances.What was most impressive of how he and his group sucessfully troubleshooted through what proved to be an extremely complex job. They were about to cut time without sacrificing the quality.We are absolutely satisfied with the service and results! Thank YOU Daniil and Modern Citi Group for all your assistance and hardwork!Highly recommended this residential contractor in NYC!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 19:35:23','2024-09-17 19:35:23',NULL,'2020-04-07 00:00:00'),(70,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Betty C.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=UUSp_FY8c7qPAcqbZBqyug&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726602117098,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"JhXKlB6-QL\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I found Modern Citi Group through Yelp as a licensed general contractor in my local area with a good reputation based on their reviews. So, it seems fair to add another 5 star review for them - they deserve it.After double checking on google and Houzz, I noticed that Modern Citi Group is the type of construction company I would like to work with to renovate my bathroom in the really old building from the 70\'s in Queens. On my first call we schedule a walk-through meeting with a project estimator Matvei. He organized all my wants based on the budget we agreed and presented to me in a very detailed estimate the same week. We continued to communicate and discuss the final changes for a few more days and I ended up signing a home improvement contract with the home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group for a full bathroom remodel. I especially liked the communication with Matvei, as he always was quick to respond throughout the project. He and MCG design team also helped with material selection and explained the process thoroughly throughout the entire time. Moreover, what I like best is that project manager Artem really keeps me informed as the job progresses and is really hands on with the entire process. From start to finish these guys from bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group were professional, courteous and knowledgeable.I am more than pleased with the outcome and anyone looking to remodel their bathroom the right way should give this renovation contractor company a call. Well deserved.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726602120243,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"x_p7nCjpB-\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I found Modern Citi Group through Yelp as a licensed general contractor in my local area with a good reputation based on their reviews. So, it seems fair to add another 5 star review for them - they deserve it.After double checking on google and Houzz, I noticed that Modern Citi Group is the type of construction company I would like to work with to renovate my bathroom in the really old building from the 70\'s in Queens. On my first call we schedule a walk-through meeting with a project estimator Matvei. He organized all my wants based on the budget we agreed and presented to me in a very detailed estimate the same week. We continued to communicate and discuss the final changes for a few more days and I ended up signing a home improvement contract with the home remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group for a full bathroom remodel. I especially liked the communication with Matvei, as he always was quick to respond throughout the project. He and MCG design team also helped with material selection and explained the process thoroughly throughout the entire time. Moreover, what I like best is that project manager Artem really keeps me informed as the job progresses and is really hands on with the entire process. From start to finish these guys from bathroom remodeling contractor Modern Citi Group were professional, courteous and knowledgeable.I am more than pleased with the outcome and anyone looking to remodel their bathroom the right way should give this renovation contractor company a call. Well deserved.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 19:43:24','2024-09-17 19:43:24',NULL,'2021-02-23 00:00:00'),(71,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Flushing, NY','Lesley K.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=_KOM0NdIlvJMWRZ0YJOWGA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726602265667,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Gx4QRCix-O\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Found this company thru Craigslist. Daniel got back to me really quickly and the next day he came to give me the estimate. I had a few contractors give me quotes and he worked with me to give me the best price for my kitchen renovation. He was professional and addressed any concerns I had throughout the project.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726602267610,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"C3drcoukIk\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Found this company thru Craigslist. Daniel got back to me really quickly and the next day he came to give me the estimate. I had a few contractors give me quotes and he worked with me to give me the best price for my kitchen renovation. He was professional and addressed any concerns I had throughout the project.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 19:45:48','2024-09-17 19:45:48',NULL,'2019-01-25 00:00:00'),(72,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Southhampton, NY','Silvia M.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=yUwAOn9NKX2EwaJuaTuXOQ&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726602481234,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"UHnLqRR_Yu\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I can\'t speak highly enough of building contractor MCG - they literally saved our bathrooms. We were looking for a local licensed contractor in Brooklyn to remodel our bathroom and master bathroom. We needed to correct some issues from previous construction and update the look of the space. We talked to several different residential contractors, looking for someone who took the time to listen to our needs, had good communication style, strong attention to detail, and a reasonable price. So, we found general contractor MCG on Yelp. After contacting Daniil (the owner) over the weekend, we met our project manager Artem right on Monday to provide an estimate. Later on that day we received a very detailed proposal and approximate list of materials.PM Artem has been absolutely phenomenal. He is extremely organized and proactive. He takes care of problems before they arise. He was on site daily for the duration of the project, and he was easy to reach after hours. Artem was really able to understand our design reference points and he had a lot of great suggestions throughout the process which we were very grateful for.Whole team from the MCG contractor who worked on our bathroom\'s renovation project was clearly experienced and did quality work at a fast pace.Overall, I had peace of mind as I received regular updates and pictures. We had a plan in place that they stuck to and a price that we had agreed upon. I am very content with the outcome and I would highly recommend home renovation contractor Modern Citi Group for anyone in Brooklyn.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726602483732,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"GGn9ikrD9r\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I can\'t speak highly enough of building contractor MCG - they literally saved our bathrooms. We were looking for a local licensed contractor in Brooklyn to remodel our bathroom and master bathroom. We needed to correct some issues from previous construction and update the look of the space. We talked to several different residential contractors, looking for someone who took the time to listen to our needs, had good communication style, strong attention to detail, and a reasonable price. So, we found general contractor MCG on Yelp. After contacting Daniil (the owner) over the weekend, we met our project manager Artem right on Monday to provide an estimate. Later on that day we received a very detailed proposal and approximate list of materials.PM Artem has been absolutely phenomenal. He is extremely organized and proactive. He takes care of problems before they arise. He was on site daily for the duration of the project, and he was easy to reach after hours. Artem was really able to understand our design reference points and he had a lot of great suggestions throughout the process which we were very grateful for.Whole team from the MCG contractor who worked on our bathroom\'s renovation project was clearly experienced and did quality work at a fast pace.Overall, I had peace of mind as I received regular updates and pictures. We had a plan in place that they stuck to and a price that we had agreed upon. I am very content with the outcome and I would highly recommend home renovation contractor Modern Citi Group for anyone in Brooklyn.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 19:49:31','2024-09-17 19:49:31',NULL,'2021-03-21 00:00:00'),(73,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Wilmette, IL','Pavel M.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=Zdp63jjrpxC6GFHLMuNd4Q&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726602668590,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"7nhZT5mWfl\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We were looking for a company to renovate and remodel our office last month. Our day to day activities requires us to be constantly on the phone, so finishing renovation in a short period of time was critical, as we couldn\'t activate with if there is a lot of background noise. We had a general concept of what we wanted so we began speaking to several contractors. Immediately, from our first meeting, we knew Modern Citi Group was the design and renovation firm for us. Me and my partner had an incredibly positive experience to work with Daniil and Modern Citi Group team. They made sure to accommodate our needs. Daniel could not have been more helpful in discussing our vision with us and guiding us through the entire process from our first consultation to the end result. He also designed, created, and installed a custom office furniture based on our needs and fully automated lighting system for us. Everything was done perfectly and timely manner. We were so impressed with work they did.We want to say thank to general contractor Daniel and Modern Citi Group team! Would definitely recommend them!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726602670881,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"V39fLiN8QB\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We were looking for a company to renovate and remodel our office last month. Our day to day activities requires us to be constantly on the phone, so finishing renovation in a short period of time was critical, as we couldn\'t activate with if there is a lot of background noise. We had a general concept of what we wanted so we began speaking to several contractors. Immediately, from our first meeting, we knew Modern Citi Group was the design and renovation firm for us. Me and my partner had an incredibly positive experience to work with Daniil and Modern Citi Group team. They made sure to accommodate our needs. Daniel could not have been more helpful in discussing our vision with us and guiding us through the entire process from our first consultation to the end result. He also designed, created, and installed a custom office furniture based on our needs and fully automated lighting system for us. Everything was done perfectly and timely manner. We were so impressed with work they did.We want to say thank to general contractor Daniel and Modern Citi Group team! Would definitely recommend them!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 19:52:50','2024-09-17 19:52:50',NULL,'2020-01-27 00:00:00'),(74,94,3,5.00,NULL,'New York, NY','Steve L',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=5nFvjDvh1hwHRs1aqj6UpA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726610369368,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"YBnXz2LU1e\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel and his team were very professional and responded quickly to our needs when remodeling our bathroom. They worked us throughout the process and ran all decisions during work by us before moving forward. They were able to complete the job on time and with quality. We had a few follow-ups that needed attention, and they were able to come back the next day and fix. Would highly recommend if you are looking at doing a renovation.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726610371445,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"q6Ke-JR9m1\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel and his team were very professional and responded quickly to our needs when remodeling our bathroom. They worked us throughout the process and ran all decisions during work by us before moving forward. They were able to complete the job on time and with quality. We had a few follow-ups that needed attention, and they were able to come back the next day and fix. Would highly recommend if you are looking at doing a renovation.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-17 22:00:36','2024-09-17 22:00:36',NULL,'2019-08-03 00:00:00'),(75,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Oakdale, NY','Justin S',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=AK3nmPNvKBvv5oJtmr6U0Q&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726672501422,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"CrD2pE48zc\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I hired this company to renovate a bathroom in my New York City apartment. This company did everything that they promised to do. They were professional , courteous and more importantly honest. I have dealt with many contractors, but Come N Done really exceeded my expectations. They were on the job site every day. Always punctual. And always maintained a very transparent and clear communication channel. There were never any surprises. It speaks a lot about them and their character. I would highly recommend using this company.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726672503459,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"3MXkoffcxJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I hired this company to renovate a bathroom in my New York City apartment. This company did everything that they promised to do. They were professional , courteous and more importantly honest. I have dealt with many contractors, but Come N Done really exceeded my expectations. They were on the job site every day. Always punctual. And always maintained a very transparent and clear communication channel. There were never any surprises. It speaks a lot about them and their character. I would highly recommend using this company.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-18 15:30:42','2024-09-18 15:30:42',NULL,'2019-12-14 00:00:00'),(76,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Manhattan, NY','James S.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=OzbROs8SmJ-Eo_GavEEfAA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726674086370,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"PQ0l1b-z49\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel from come n done is so helpful and is there for anything you need right away. Literally from gut renovations to needing an architect he has so much knowledge and know how down to ever little detail. Really I\'m blown away by how nice and helpful he is. I would definitely suggest working with him for anything you need. It is so rare to meet a contractor as great as him!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726674088105,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"kjYrG7DHRa\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel from come n done is so helpful and is there for anything you need right away. Literally from gut renovations to needing an architect he has so much knowledge and know how down to ever little detail. Really I\'m blown away by how nice and helpful he is. I would definitely suggest working with him for anything you need. It is so rare to meet a contractor as great as him!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-18 15:42:33','2024-09-18 15:42:33',NULL,'2018-11-27 00:00:00'),(77,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Brooklyn, NY','Raman S.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=FdhE_SulBK0cQryY2pwGyw&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726674228572,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"82Q9gvGoAJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I was purchasing my first apartment in Midtown East knowing that kitchen and bathroom will have to be remodeled.Daniil and his team at Modern Citi Group came highly recommended from my wife\'s brother and I can\'t say enough of how easy and professional the entire process was. My main concern that I told Daniil about from the beginning was not to go over the budget - and luckily I didn\'t, in fact, they provided different options that fit in my budget and explained all possible unforeseen surprises.Now, the kitchen looks amazing, we have brand new kitchen cabinets, new stainless steel appliances (range, hood, double sink, added a dishwasher), quartz countertop (was thinking about natural stone / marble first) with matching backsplash and they also picked and installed a very beautiful floor tile which Im in love with. I didn\'t like is the old radiator by the window, which my building didn\'t allow to replace, and they fabricated and installed a beautiful custom radiator cover.Bathroom used to have an old bathtub that I disliked. So we converted it into a walk in shower, with the bench and spacious shower niche. It was a gut renovation, so we obviously replaced water lines, shut off valves, toilet, vanity (wall mounted now), and everything else that the bathroom had. Everything is now completely new.I should\'ve posted this review earlier. I recommend Modern Citi Group to everyone looking for kitchen, bathroom remodel or any other interior renovation. Either you\'re looking on Yelp or elsewhere - this is a go to company.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726674230558,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"lnTP29yCvV\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I was purchasing my first apartment in Midtown East knowing that kitchen and bathroom will have to be remodeled.Daniil and his team at Modern Citi Group came highly recommended from my wife\'s brother and I can\'t say enough of how easy and professional the entire process was. My main concern that I told Daniil about from the beginning was not to go over the budget - and luckily I didn\'t, in fact, they provided different options that fit in my budget and explained all possible unforeseen surprises.Now, the kitchen looks amazing, we have brand new kitchen cabinets, new stainless steel appliances (range, hood, double sink, added a dishwasher), quartz countertop (was thinking about natural stone / marble first) with matching backsplash and they also picked and installed a very beautiful floor tile which Im in love with. I didn\'t like is the old radiator by the window, which my building didn\'t allow to replace, and they fabricated and installed a beautiful custom radiator cover.Bathroom used to have an old bathtub that I disliked. So we converted it into a walk in shower, with the bench and spacious shower niche. It was a gut renovation, so we obviously replaced water lines, shut off valves, toilet, vanity (wall mounted now), and everything else that the bathroom had. Everything is now completely new.I should\'ve posted this review earlier. I recommend Modern Citi Group to everyone looking for kitchen, bathroom remodel or any other interior renovation. Either you\'re looking on Yelp or elsewhere - this is a go to company.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-18 15:45:15','2024-09-18 15:45:15',NULL,'2019-10-14 00:00:00'),(78,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Flushing, NY','Eddie C.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=rkA2nc1oUfkRPhCn2xkRFw&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726674663099,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"GqLzY7HbXg\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel shows how a business should be run, he is very professional through the whole process from the beginning, responsive to our calls and emails and great quotation details by breaking down per items for things that we wanted to do for our project. Very polite and accommodating which is very different from other contractors that we\'ve found. I\'d definitely recommend come n done to friends and family in the future!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726674665884,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"-rk9ozXgs1\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Daniel shows how a business should be run, he is very professional through the whole process from the beginning, responsive to our calls and emails and great quotation details by breaking down per items for things that we wanted to do for our project. Very polite and accommodating which is very different from other contractors that we\'ve found. I\'d definitely recommend come n done to friends and family in the future!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-18 15:52:14','2024-09-18 15:52:14',NULL,'2019-01-05 00:00:00'),(79,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Manhattan, NY','Jacquelyn P.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=N8b-4zBkE5RWmoPD6TCUAw&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726675087002,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ySsFGVOx2b\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I have to echo the sentiments of the other reviewers here. Daniil and his team have been very attentive to our needs from Day1. Daniil was available anytime we had a question or concern and worked with his team to remedy. His customer service was impeccable and he even gave design suggestions and came up with creative solutions. His team was respectful and attentive as well. Tibor went above and beyond to make us happy and we are some picky folks! In the end, we have a beautiful modern bathroom renovation that we are extremely happy with! Would highly recommend them!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726675088893,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"8tbVk4YMut\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"I have to echo the sentiments of the other reviewers here. Daniil and his team have been very attentive to our needs from Day1. Daniil was available anytime we had a question or concern and worked with his team to remedy. His customer service was impeccable and he even gave design suggestions and came up with creative solutions. His team was respectful and attentive as well. Tibor went above and beyond to make us happy and we are some picky folks! In the end, we have a beautiful modern bathroom renovation that we are extremely happy with! Would highly recommend them!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-18 16:00:43','2024-09-18 16:00:43',NULL,'2019-03-08 00:00:00'),(80,94,3,5.00,NULL,'Sheepshead Bay, NY','Boris P.',NULL,'https://www.yelp.com/biz/modern-citi-group-new-york-4?hrid=93BqP4Qa_k-KzL4GWilQmA&utm_campaign=www_review_share_popup&utm_medium=copy_link&utm_source=(direct)',NULL,'{\"time\":1726675357297,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"aqo28knJNN\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We finished remodeling our Restaurant in the Bronx this summer and we used Modern Citi after hearing a lot about them from a few friends of mine. It has always been hard for us to find a solid Remodeling Contractor in the Bronx. This was a big Renovation so I wanted the personal referral from someone I trust. They ended up being a great fit with us. I know a renovation is always stressful and this one was stressful in particular because of COVID and specific deadlines that we had in place. Their team was very good at navigating every obstacle that came up and they kept a clear head which is not something I can say for myself. You could tell that they have done a lot of jobs like this because they were there every day putting in the hard work and they were not rattled by any of the adversity or deadlines. They helped me to not pull my hair out and their ability to renovate this place so nicely and completely change the look and feel of it under those tight deadlines was very impressive to me. If we continue to expand, this will be the subcontractor that I use.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1726675359577,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"pcgMmUnlXE\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We finished remodeling our Restaurant in the Bronx this summer and we used Modern Citi after hearing a lot about them from a few friends of mine. It has always been hard for us to find a solid Remodeling Contractor in the Bronx. This was a big Renovation so I wanted the personal referral from someone I trust. They ended up being a great fit with us. I know a renovation is always stressful and this one was stressful in particular because of COVID and specific deadlines that we had in place. Their team was very good at navigating every obstacle that came up and they kept a clear head which is not something I can say for myself. You could tell that they have done a lot of jobs like this because they were there every day putting in the hard work and they were not rattled by any of the adversity or deadlines. They helped me to not pull my hair out and their ability to renovate this place so nicely and completely change the look and feel of it under those tight deadlines was very impressive to me. If we continue to expand, this will be the subcontractor that I use.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-18 16:08:03','2024-09-18 16:08:03',NULL,'2020-12-29 00:00:00');
