rida\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-14 15:27:36','2022-08-27 20:23:36',NULL,0),(26,NULL,4,4,NULL,'Interior Design',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660413663197,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"3DkB_FBGWs\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Browse our design catalog to explore residential and commercial projects\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-14 15:29:24','2022-08-27 20:23:25',NULL,0),(27,NULL,10,1,NULL,'Request an Estimate','Step 1',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1658064624837,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"r6x2uVw4dq\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Submit the project form and tell us about your remodeling plans. You’ll hear from our team in 1 to 2 days and receive your all-inclusive initial estimate along with design visualizations.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-17 13:31:07','2022-07-17 13:32:53','2022-07-17 13:32:53',0),(28,NULL,10,1,NULL,'Request an Estimate','Step 1',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1658064624837,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"r6x2uVw4dq\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Submit the project form and tell us about your remodeling plans. You’ll hear from our team in 1 to 2 days and receive your all-inclusive initial estimate along with design visualizations.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-17 13:31:54','2022-07-17 13:32:50','2022-07-17 13:32:50',0),(29,NULL,10,1,NULL,'Request an Estimate','Step 1',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1716992143340,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"r6x2uVw4dq\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Submit the project form and tell us about your remodeling plans. You’ll hear from our team in 1 to 2 days and receive your all-inclusive initial estimate along with design visualizations\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-17 13:32:44','2024-05-29 14:15:48',NULL,0),(30,NULL,10,2,NULL,'Meet Your Renovation Team','Step 2',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1658931493104,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"XeDSLpbNXQ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Schedule your at-home visit and meet your renovation team. With cutting-edge technology, your project planner will create a 360 model of your home to fast-track your project. In a few days, you’ll get a proposal including the renovation timeline and costs.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-17 13:55:55','2022-07-27 14:18:14',NULL,0),(31,NULL,10,3,NULL,'Design and Select Your Materials','Step 3',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660414796927,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"CxRMGtXItc\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"At this stage, you will sign the contract and begin the design process. Choose <a href=\\\"https://moderncitigroup.com/ready-solutions\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">a ready solution</a> or hand-pick materials with the help of an interior designer.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-17 14:25:17','2022-08-13 18:19:58',NULL,0),(32,NULL,10,4,NULL,'Check the Project Dashboard','Step 4',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1658931551490,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"JDa44Zq4B9\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"While we handle the tedious tasks–from securing permits and preparing construction plans to submitting board documents–you can check <b>your project dashboard</b> for daily progress updates. It will be your one-stop-shop for communicating with your dedicated renovation team and asking questions.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-17 14:27:25','2022-07-27 14:19:12',NULL,0),(33,NULL,10,5,NULL,'Let the Building Begin','Step 5',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1658931571533,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"jPTGNLQtAI\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Sit back as the remodeling work begins and your renovation team manages everything. We inspect every installation and coordinate the team of architects, trade specialists and licensed subcontractors so you don’t have to. At the end, you will be invited to do a final walkthrough and celebrate your renovation with the team! 🎉\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-17 14:27:52','2022-07-27 14:19:33',NULL,0),(34,NULL,11,1,NULL,'18  month',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1661199707868,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"-9mXkDTLB5\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Workmanship Warranty\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-18 10:34:02','2022-08-22 20:21:48',NULL,0),(35,NULL,11,2,NULL,'$10 million',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1661199701264,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"XZemTHukMf\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Insurance Protection\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-18 10:34:27','2022-08-28 00:32:04',NULL,0),(36,NULL,11,3,NULL,'5-star',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1661199692631,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"PUfy_F0v-J\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Customer Service\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-07-18 10:34:59','2022-08-22 20:21:32',NULL,0),(37,NULL,13,1,NULL,'Request a Free Estimate','Scope',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1724950743298,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"yAf9BhujoL\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Kick off your renovation project with a top-notch commercial contractor in New York City. Fill out our free estimate request and tell us about your business and remodeling plans. We’ll respond within <b><font color=\\\"#616162\\\">1-2 days</font></b> with a personalized initial estimate and design visualizations.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:23:00','2024-08-29 16:06:35',NULL,0),(38,NULL,13,2,NULL,'Meet Your Commercial  Renovation Team','plane',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1716992192024,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"uBwLg9vdbQ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Schedule your office visit and meet your renovation team. During the conversation, a dedicated project planner will create a 360 model of your workspace to fast-track your project. Within a few days we will draw up a proposal taking into account your preferences concerning the cost and scope of the work.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:23:35','2024-08-29 15:51:19',NULL,0),(39,NULL,13,3,NULL,'Choose the Design  and Materials','design',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1724951741093,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"x_U36aCsHW\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"From flooring to lighting, our expert team will help you select the best design options. Guided by Modern Citi Group architects and interior designers, you’ll plan your office layout, including the placement of all furniture and facilities. Whether you opt for ready solutions or custom designs, we’re here to assist.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:27:14','2024-08-29 16:05:36',NULL,0),(40,NULL,13,4,NULL,'Control the Renovation Process with a Project Dashboard','prepare',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1724951900069,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"OrTkJEhJHP\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"While we handle the complexities of obtaining permits, drafting construction plans, and submitting necessary paperwork, you can monitor daily progress updates on your project dashboard. This hub allows you to interact with your dedicated renovation team and get any questions answered promptly.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:28:09','2024-08-29 16:08:32',NULL,0),(41,NULL,13,5,NULL,'Let the Building Begin!','Build',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1724952382611,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"2tIvxWkBsW\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Sit back and relax as the renovation commences. Your dedicated team will oversee every aspect, from coordinating a skilled team of architects, trade specialists, and licensed subcontractors to meticulous inspections of decor fixtures installations. Upon completion, you’ll be invited for a final walkthrough to celebrate your newly renovated office or workspace!\"}},{\"id\":\"WLNu_71UHD\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Transform Your Workspace with Modern Citi Group. Contact us today for a free estimate and start your office remodeling project with New York City’s trusted commercial renovation experts.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:28:58','2024-08-29 16:16:31',NULL,0),(42,NULL,12,1,NULL,'Request a Proposal',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1713976305822,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"gN9pTtgYjd\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Submit <a href=\\\"https://moderncitigroup.com/initial-form/works\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">the project form</a> and you’ll hear from our team in 1 to 2 days. We’ll talk in-depth about the project details including the required permits and how the project can get approved by the Department of Buildings\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 23:01:07','2024-04-24 16:31:47',NULL,0),(43,NULL,12,2,NULL,'Meet Your Architect',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1659394918167,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"kZ2BrwjyQ8\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Once you sign the contract and complete payment, you’ll schedule an in-person walkthrough and meet with one of our architects. You’ll discuss your project needs while the architect gets accurate measurements of your place\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 23:02:09','2022-08-01 23:02:09',NULL,0),(44,NULL,12,3,NULL,'Paperwork, Permits and Fees',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1659395149527,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"zI_zZ9v_j2\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We will guide you through the complex paperwork and permit filing to ensure a smooth process. Our team tackles everything from performing property history research to clearing violations and preparing new layout options and site plans\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 23:06:00','2022-08-01 23:06:00',NULL,0),(45,NULL,12,4,NULL,'Approve the Architectural Plans',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1659395187514,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Y7cfQB0dJs\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"You will review and approve the architectural plans before we submit the drawings to the Department of Buildings. Our team will work tirelessly during the review process until your project plans are officially approved and your contractor can pull permits to begin construction\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 23:06:37','2022-08-01 23:06:37',NULL,0),(46,NULL,12,5,NULL,'Let the Building Begin',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1659395247084,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ejYw5E5Fb2\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Sit back as the construction 