ch ups.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-11 15:35:24','2022-08-11 15:35:24',NULL,0),(58,NULL,8,6,NULL,'Get your estimate','Let\'s start',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1695242832799,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"zhJB0p_3Gv\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Start the project form and get your no-commitment estimate in fewer than 2 days\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2023-09-20 17:44:03','2023-09-20 20:47:20',NULL,0),(59,NULL,17,1,NULL,'Request an Estimate','Scope',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1728695137994,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"yAf9BhujoL\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Let\'s get to know you and your project. Submit the project form and tell in your own words about the scope of work needed to renovate your restaurant. Add the references and mention the details you are inspired by. In 1-2 days our team will provide you with a free all-inclusive estimate along with design visualizations.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:23:00','2024-10-12 01:05:44',NULL,0),(60,NULL,17,2,NULL,'Meet Your Renovation Team','plane',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1728695181987,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"-6kZgx_VZi\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After the estimate is ready, book a visit with Modern Citi Group experts to discuss your goals. We know that the restaurant business is one of the toughest in NYC, so we are here to help you improve your place to make it more competitive and recognizable.\"}},{\"id\":\"q2Lpm0hCnJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Using state-of-the-art technology, your project planner will create a comprehensive 360-degree model of your restaurant to expedite your project. In a few days, you will get a proposal outlining the renovation schedule and costs.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:23:35','2024-10-12 01:06:25',NULL,0),(61,NULL,17,3,NULL,'Design and Select Your Materials','design',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1728695205419,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"x_U36aCsHW\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Now it is time to start the design process. You will get support with planning your restaurant layout including seating areas, cleaning areas, bar zone and other premises. Choose one of the ready solutions or hand-pick materials and decor with the help of an interior designer.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:27:14','2024-10-12 01:06:47',NULL,0),(62,NULL,17,4,NULL,'Check the Project Dashboard','prepare',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1728695227826,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"j1KZ9F7dsa\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Sure, you have to get securing permits and submit board documents to renovate a restaurant in NYC. But don\'t worry: our contracting team will do all the work for you.\"}},{\"id\":\"jMtFrhx1Uc\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"You will have access to a personalized project dashboard, where you will be able to receive daily updates and track progress. It will serve as your central hub for communicating with your dedicated expert team and for asking questions.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:28:09','2024-10-12 01:07:12',NULL,0),(63,NULL,17,5,NULL,'Let the Building Begin','Build',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1728695251907,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"mQ_mwoWvlZ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Relax as the remodel begins and a team of dedicated specialists takes care of everything. We oversee each setup, organize the architects, trade specialists, and certified subcontractors on your behalf. Upon completion, you\'ll be asked to join us for a final inspection and celebrate the successful renovation with the team!\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2022-08-01 22:28:58','2024-10-12 01:07:35',NULL,0),(64,NULL,4,5,NULL,'Restaurant Remodeling',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1717669047108,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"6mG8GNoYky\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Exceptional design from concept to realization for your New York restaurant\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-06-06 10:17:32','2024-06-06 10:17:32',NULL,0),(65,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Request an Estimate','Scope',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1724953630542,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"CGvW5npkuS\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Submit the project form and tell us about your remodeling plans. You’ll hear from our team in <b>1 to 2</b> days and receive your all-inclusive initial estimate along with design visualizations.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 16:38:55','2024-08-29 16:38:55',NULL,0),(66,NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Meet your  Renovation Team','plane',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1724953838046,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"8WnxKCtkh2\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Schedule your at-home visit and meet your renovation team. With cutting-edge technology, your project planner will create a 360 model of your home to fast-track your project. In a few days, you’ll get a proposal including the renovation timeline and costs.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 16:40:48','2024-08-29 16:40:48',NULL,0),(67,NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Design and select  your materials','design',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1724955053424,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"h1uA7piGsJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"At this stage, you will sign the contract and begin the design process. Choose&nbsp;a <a href=\\\"https://new.moderncitigroup.com/ready-solutions\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">ready solution</a>&nbsp;or hand-pick materials with the help of an interior designer.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 17:02:21','2024-08-29 17:02:21',NULL,0),(68,NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'Check your  Project Dashboard','prepare',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1724955482431,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"hahEKqgl_M\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"While we handle the tedious tasks–from securing permits and preparing construction plans to submitting board documents–you can check&nbsp;your project dashboard&nbsp;for daily progress updates. It will be your one-stop-shop for communicating with your dedicated renovation team and asking questions.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 17:08:16','2024-09-13 22:39:42',NULL,0),(69,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'Let the Building Begin!','Build',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1724955599900,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"6evg5Ju-tQ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Sit back as the remodeling work begins and your renovation team manages everything. We inspect every installation and coordinate the team of architects, trade specialists and licensed subcontractors so you don’t have to.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 17:10:33','2024-09-13 22:39:32',NULL,1),(70,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Request an Estimate','Scope',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1726594862937,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ufMQzgMSsf\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Fill out the project form and let us know about your bathroom remodeling plans. Our team will get back to you in 1 to 2 days with a comprehensive initial estimate and design visualizations.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 17:13:48','2024-09-17 16:29:50',NULL,0),(71,NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Meet your  Renovation Team','plane',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1726594943968,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"MWEYhkYOnX\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Book your in-home visit and meet your renovation team. Using the latest technology, your project planner will create a 360-degree model of your home to speed up the process. In just a few days, you\'ll receive a proposal with the renovation timeline and costs.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 17:14:58','2024-09-17 16:31:11',NULL,0),(72,NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Design and Choose Your Materials','design',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1729111405554,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"5RXX9jsA_0\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"At this point, you\'ll sign the contract and start the design process. You can either select a pre-made solution or work with an interior designer to hand-pick your materials.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 17:16:20','2024-10-16 20:43:26',NULL,0),(73,NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'Check your Project Dashboard','prepare',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1726595254065,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"gZBAWSz9LS\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"While we take care of the time-consuming tasks—like getting permits, preparing construction plans, and submitting board documents—you can monitor daily progress on your project dashboard. It’s your go-to spot for staying in touch with your renovation team and asking any questions.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 17:17:10','2024-09-17 16:47:39',NULL,0),(74,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'Let the Building Begin!','Build',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1726595752671,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"qNiK9vWfom\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Relax as the remodeling gets underway and your renovation team takes care of everything. We oversee every installation and coordinate the architects, trade specialists, and licensed subcontractors, so you don’t have to worry about a thing.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-08-29 17:18:00','2024-09-17 16:44:40',NULL,1),(75,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Request an Estimate','Scope',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1728694462853,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"KwV63RjfNM\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<span style=\\\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"></span>Complete the project form and share your apartment remodeling plans with us. Our team will reach out within 1 to 2 days with a detailed initial estimate and design visualizations.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-13 16:53:18','2024-10-12 00:54:23',NULL,0),(76,NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Meet your Renovation Team','plane',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1728694469720,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"fxxhEZ5G_F\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Schedule your in-home visit and meet your renovation team. Using cutting-edge technology, your project planner will create a 360-degree model of your home to accelerate the process. Within a few days, you’ll receive a proposal with the renovation timeline and costs.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-13 21:40:25','2024-10-12 00:54:30',NULL,0),(77,NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Design and Choose Your Materials','design',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1728694475422,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"T1PSfL3OMP\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"At this stage, you\'ll sign the contract and begin the design process. You can choose a pre-designed solution or collaborate with an interior designer to personally select your materials for apartment renovation.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-13 21:41:20','2024-10-12 00:54:36',NULL,0),(78,NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'Check your Personal Project Dashboard','prepare',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1726267976144,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"6Uy12bZ3S_\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"While we handle the time-consuming tasks—such as obtaining permits, preparing construction plans, and submitting board documents—you can track daily progress on your project dashboard. It\'s your central hub for staying connected with your renovation team and asking any questions\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-13 21:42:13','2024-09-13 21:42:13',NULL,0),(79,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'Let the Building Begin!','build',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1728694486194,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"vhA0gNQ01M\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Sit back and relax as the remodeling begins, while your renovation team handles everything. We manage every installation and coordinate the architects, trade specialists, and licensed subcontractors, so you won’t have to worry about a thing.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','2024-09-13 21:42:56','2024-10-12 00:54:47',NULL,0),(80,'about_right_photo',NULL,NULL,NULL,'About right photo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-27 19:48:02','2024-10-27 19:48:02',NULL,0),(81,'about_left_photo',NULL,NULL,NULL,'About left photo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-27 19:50:08','2024-10-27 19:50:08',NULL,0),(82,'reward',NULL,1,NULL,'Best of Houzz 2020',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-27 19:53:42','2024-10-27 19:53:42',NULL,0),(83,'