n family renovate their 3,500 square foot apartment on Park Avenue. The family wanted to increase the home value by completing a full renovation of their eat-in kitchen. Anna, the project planner, met with the family to capture the vision, timeline and budget. She understood the goal was to modernize the kitchen while improving functionality.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1659497805137,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"pFUNwKWq2a\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the building phase, the renovation team installed additional cooling units and carefully put up the custom, handcrafted wood cabinets. They meticulously placed the artisan marble countertop to give the kitchen a luxurious look. In order to maximize the space, the kitchen was combined with the dining room for an open concept feel sure to impress.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1659497792295,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"xtXME8YBTR\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to upgrade the kitchen to a modern style while matching the aesthetic of the apartment. The designers worked on several layouts and design visualizations so the Chen family had options. Finally, the choice was made and the family felt confident in their decision.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1659497778452,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ony0QKDcXV\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Anna captured a 360 shot of the kitchen to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Lada N',NULL,NULL,1,'2022-08-03 04:11:51','2022-08-03 04:46:36','2022-08-03 04:46:36','2021-10-01 00:00:00','2021-12-31 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(30,'Test',NULL,100,NULL,'test','{\"time\":1659500768476,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"c1_vdhkWRB\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"test\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1659500776361,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"05G9OsrG49\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"test\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1659500773589,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"rgk490LR7D\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"test\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1659500771445,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"zfQgvdxvvw\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"test\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Test',NULL,NULL,1,'2022-08-03 04:26:25','2022-08-03 04:27:16','2022-08-03 04:27:16',NULL,NULL,20,23,NULL,NULL),(31,'Test',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-08-03 04:30:35','2022-08-03 04:46:18','2022-08-03 04:46:18',NULL,NULL,20,NULL,NULL,NULL),(32,'Kew Gardens Apartment Renovation',NULL,650,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1659501198911,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"TyGJcZus7L\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We helped Jason complete a full renovation of his first NYC apartment: bedroom, living room, hallway, closets, kitchen and bathroom. He wanted the apartment to feel like his own with a modern style and fresh look. As a first time home buyer, Jason had a modest budget but we made it work through financing options. Anna, the project planner, met with Jason to learn about his vision, ideal timeline and budget. She understood the goal was to modernize the entire apartment while improving functionality\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1660335295643,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"oyaakyrb4K\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Once the permits were filed and approved, the full apartment renovation began. In a matter of eleven weeks, Jason had a new junior one bedroom that fit his style and increased his home value for future resale.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1659501226157,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"s7ZmSAJ1q0\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to deliver an upscale aesthetic for the entire apartment at a feasible price. Jason wanted to personalize his space but also focus on driving the resale value up. The designers worked on several layouts and design visualizations so he had options. Finally, Jason picked his favorite layouts and felt confident about the design.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1660335264322,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"MgU2Yj6I2K\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Anna captured a 360 tour of the junior 1 bedroom apartment to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project. She advised Jason to complete the renovation all at once since it would mean cost savings on permits and the construction process overall.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,6,'2022-08-03 04:39:34','2023-06-07 17:21:04','2023-06-07 17:21:04','2022-01-03 00:00:00','2022-03-19 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(33,'Upper East Side Apartment Renovation',NULL,1300,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660335016405,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"dWwb13hQnj\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We helped Chris &amp; Cinzia complete a full renovation of their three bedroom Upper East Side apartment: master bedroom, guest bedroom, office, living room, hallway, closets, kitchen and two bathrooms. Clients wanted the apartment to feel like their own with a modern style and fresh look.&nbsp; Matt, the project planner, met with Chris &amp; Cinzia to learn about their vision, ideal timeline and budget. He understood the goal was to modernize the entire apartment while improving functionality and making the apartment more bright &amp; spacious.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1660335082081,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"nLjlr0TFfU\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Once the permits were filed and approved, the full apartment renovation began.&nbsp; During the building phase, the construction team renovated two bathrooms, completely reconfigured closets in all rooms, and made layout changes. They meticulously placed the exquisite and unique, Calacatta Classique quartz to serve as a floating countertop with waterfall on both sides, and backsplash slab, to give the kitchen a luxurious look. In order to maximize the space, the kitchen was opened up towards the dining area for an open concept that is sure to impress.&nbsp;In a matter of twelve weeks, Chris &amp; Cinzia had a new three bedroom home that fit their style, vision and increased their home value for future resale.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1659503072982,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"YHG9z0TsNN\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to deliver an upscale aesthetic for the entire apartment at a feasible price. Chris &amp; Cinzia wanted to open up their space, make it brighter, and also focus on making sure they have a lot of closet space. The designers worked on several layouts and design visualizations so they had options. Finally, the choice was made and the family felt confident in their decision.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1660335021708,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"F-oSl8WU-x\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Matt captured a 360 tour of the three bedroom apartment to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,6,'2022-08-03 05:23:11','2024-02-09 21:03:50',NULL,'2022-02-01 00:00:00','2022-05-03 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(34,'Upper West Side Bathroom Renovation',NULL,60,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1661292434426,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"vBD8ZD8KC2\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We helped Nancy remodel the bathroom in her new New York City apartment. The challenge was to make the space feel warm and welcoming while keeping it spacious and functional with lots of storage space.\"}},{\"id\":\"Z4xmRgf5Nb\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Matt, the project planner, met with Nancy to capture the vision, timeline and budget. He understood the goal was to modernize the bathroom, improving the look and functionally while creating a design that stood out.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1661292930050,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"-47bqZuBC5\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the building phase, the construction team worked on a gut renovation for the bathroom,  including plumbing, electrical work, replacing the cast iron bathtub with a walk-in-shower, and installing the wall and floor tiles. The final result featured a gorgeous marble accent shower wall and sophisticated décor fixtures conveying a luxurious yet serene feel.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1661292486366,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"4tuiNoL1ca\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to upgrade the bathroom and create a luxury spa feel, closer to nature and further from the hectic cityscape. The client went for a unique design that is uncommon in other apartments. The designers worked on several layouts and design visualizations so Nancy had plenty of options. Finally, Nancy made her design decision and felt confident going into the construction phase.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1660978887885,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Gqy702Wv6J\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Matt captured a 360 degree tour of the bathroom to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,8,'2022-08-12 21:43:55','2024-01-15 17:57:18','2024-01-15 17:57:18','2020-11-01 00:00:00','2020-12-07 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(35,'West Village Kitchen and Bathroom Renovation',NULL,650,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1660978814419,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"_QUA7vQjHm\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We helped Rachel and Kenny complete a bathroom and kitchen remodel for their first New York City Co-op. The challenge was getting through the tedious paperwork involved when renovating under Co-op board rules. The goal was to make the apartment feel modern and functional, while staying under budget.\"}},{\"id\":\"-pcHzQf62C\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Matt, the project planner, met with Rachel and Kenny to capture the vision, timeline and budget. He understood the goal was to modernize the kitchen and bathroom, improving the look and functionally while creating a timeless design that drives up the resale value.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1660978746271,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"uH0yJpFVwu\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the building phase, the construction team worked on a complete renovation of the kitchen and bathroom. The team created an open-concept kitchen with an island, beautiful pendant lights and brand new stainless steel appliances. For the bathroom, they converted the bathtub into a walk-in shower with a black-framed, glass door.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1660978748032,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"kcjXBhbjPC\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to upgrade the outdated kitchen and bathroom to create a modern aesthetic without breaking the bank. The client went for a modern design with neutral beige colors, natural stone and wood materials. The designers worked on several layouts and design visualizations so Kenny and Rachel had options. Finally, Rachel and Kenny made their design decisions and felt confident going into the construction phase.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1660978753395,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"tZ-StRrETJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Matt captured a 360 tour of the bathroom to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,3,'2022-08-12 22:00:11','2023-06-07 17:20:55','2023-06-07 17:20:55','2019-06-01 00:00:00','2019-08-13 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(36,'Upper East Side Kitchen and Bathroom Remodel',NULL,1200,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,1,'2022-08-29 16:19:51','2023-06-07 17:20:48','2023-06-07 17:20:48','2022-03-01 00:00:00','2022-04-27 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(37,'Jackson Heights Apartment Renovation',NULL,1075,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1666316268880,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"VI28Bh4hsv\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We helped Olessya and her family complete a full renovation of their two-bedroom/ home office apartment in Jackson Heights: master bedroom, guest bedroom, home office, living room, hallway, closets, kitchen and bathroom. Clients wanted the apartment to feel new and modern. Matt, the project planner, met with Olessya to learn about their vision, ideal timeline, and budget. He understood the goal was to modernize the entire apartment while improving its functionality and making the apartment more bright &amp; spacious.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1666316775301,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"aX18yCBfjM\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Once the permits were filed and approved, the full apartment renovation began.&nbsp; During the building phase, the construction team renovated the kitchen, bathroom, and home office, and made layout changes. The combination of timeless colors, white and grey, was selected to make the kitchen feel brighter, and in order to maximize the space, the kitchen was opened up towards the dining area for an open concept that is sure to impress.&nbsp; In a matter of twelve weeks, Olessya and her family had a new two bedroom/home office&nbsp; residence that fit their style, vision and increased their home value for future resale.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1666316429556,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"o1THgTpdIW\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to deliver a modern aesthetic for the entire apartment at a feasible price. The designers worked on several layouts and design visualizations so they had options. Finally, the choice was made and the family felt confident in their decision.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1666316307145,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"fM9ZfonEgV\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Matt captured a 360 tour of the residence to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,10,'2022-10-21 01:46:26','2024-11-03 22:43:42',NULL,'2022-07-01 00:00:00','2022-09-23 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(38,'Upper West Side Apartment Remodel',NULL,1200,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-12-15 15:17:38','2022-12-16 18:09:03','2022-12-16 18:09:03','2022-03-01 00:00:00','2022-09-01 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(39,'Upper West Side Apartment Remodel',NULL,1200,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1671476488919,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"RuDRu92tSs\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We helped the Sacara family renovate their 1,200-square-foot home in the prime Upper West Side location. The original layout included two bedrooms with a shared bathroom, a combined living/dining room area, and a separate kitchen. The family wanted to complete a full apartment renovation and make the layout more functional by adding a second bathroom, laundry room, and additional closets as well as creating an open kitchen concept. Matt, the project planner, met with the family to capture the vision, timeline, and budget. He understood the goal was to modernize the apartment while improving functionality.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1671476507118,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"wx6fjK1olL\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the building phase, the renovation team faced unforeseen challenges with the layout, and the plans were adjusted. The architect and project management teams worked together to amend the drawings with the building board and the Department of Buildings. After the new layout was approved, a full apartment renovation included the removal and installation of all walls, bathroom and laundry room addition, and complete closet reconfiguration. Kitchen remodeling featured custom cabinetry, decorative wood island paneling, and a white marble countertop for a luxurious look. The bathroom renovation highlighted herringbone and onyx tiling for color accents. Additionally, the team replaced all hardwood floors throughout the apartment, installed new baseboards, painted all walls and ceilings, and built the new LED channel lighting with dimmer switches. In a matter of a few months, the Sacara family had a fully-remodeled home that expressed their style, vision, and improved functionality.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1671476499785,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"h8zTd1Y3dt\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to deliver a modern yet classic aesthetic for the entire apartment that captured the family’s vision for a perfect home. The goal was to combine the kitchen and living room areas creating a harmonious flow of natural light and air; add a kitchen island with an additional seating area, and utilize every inch of usable space in the kitchen. The design solution offered a cozy seating area by the window for a morning cup of coffee which simultaneously served as a cover for all the plumbing communications and radiator. A built-in fireplace wall separated the living and dining room zones visually yet allowed them to stay bright and functional. The design and architectural teams collaborated to create multiple layouts and design solutions so the Sacara family had options. Finally, the choice was made and the clients felt confident in their decision.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1671476493822,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"LQCDXep_6Y\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Matt captured a 360 tour of the apartment to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project.<br>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,8,'2022-12-15 21:15:29','2024-11-03 22:27:11',NULL,'2022-03-01 00:00:00','2022-07-14 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(40,'East Village Restaurant Remodel',NULL,1500,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1675630656835,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"T-8xAJJGB_\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group helped Robert complete a complete commercial remodel. With an eye for detail, our team brought to life Robert\'s vision for a complete renovation of the restaurant. We transformed every aspect of the establishment from the stylish bar area to the two elegantly redesigned dining rooms, a luxurious cigar room, and revamped guest restrooms. The end result? A complete, jaw-dropping remodel that has everyone talking.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1675630747365,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"1ud_BPXNkz\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the renovation stage, the skilled construction crew extended and rebuilt the bar area from the ground up, and expertly restored and refinished architectural elements like exposed brick and columns. The floors were refinished and retiled, ceilings were reframed, tiled, and lit with a combination of ceiling and wall lighting. The walls were finished with decorative microcement, adding texture and depth to the space and creating a luxurious touch that elevated the restaurant\'s overall aesthetic.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1675630712204,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"St0POUT79c\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to strike a perfect balance between cohesiveness and individuality. The design team meticulously crafted multiple layouts and design visualizations, each imbued with unique and distinctive touches to distinguish the dining zones providing the client with multiple options to choose from. Robert was the ultimate arbiter of style, carefully reviewing the options and selecting his favorite with confidence. Through collaboration and creativity, the design team brought to life a space that seamlessly blends form and function, and promises to leave a lasting impression on every guest.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1675630698997,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"MrZdk9jvIK\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. During the on-site visit, Anna meticulously captured every nook and cranny with a 360-degree tour of the restaurant. This allowed her to gather precise measurements and fast-track the project. She expertly guided Robert every step of the way, providing advice on how to complete the renovation in record time and maximize the return on investment.&nbsp;\"}},{\"id\":\"40T8-dYrDQ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Anna, the project planner, met with Robert to uncover his grand vision for the restaurant, ideal timeline, and budget. Armed with this knowledge, Anna set out to accomplish the impossible: to completely overhaul a commercial space in a short period of time, infusing it with Robert\'s unique vision while keeping a firm grip on the budget, ensuring the end result was both stunning and financially sound.&nbsp;&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,5,'2023-02-06 19:21:44','2024-06-25 00:15:04',NULL,'2022-10-01 00:00:00','2022-12-20 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(41,'Upper West Side Apartment Alteration and Remodel',NULL,1300,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1680028291911,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"9QxqjaiQay\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We helped Vishal and Ishita renovate their 1,300-square-foot home in the prime Upper West Side location. The original layout included separate living room and dining rooms, and a long narrow hallway throughout the apartment. The clients wanted to complete a full apartment renovation and make the layout more functional by combining the living room with a dining room and part of the hallway to create a large open living space. Anna, the project planner, met with the family to capture the vision, timeline, and budget. She understood the goal was to modernize the apartment while improving the flow of the unit.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1680029013614,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"vMkLT0bzO1\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Before the building stage began, the architect and project planning teams worked together to create and approve the architectural drawings with the building board and the Department of Buildings. After the new layout was approved, the construction team completed a full apartment renovation including the removal of walls, refinishing of the entire apartment, including walls, ceilings, doors, and windows, replacement of the floors, and installation of the light fixtures and recessed lighting. In a matter of several weeks, Ishita and Vishal had a newly-remodeled home that expressed their style, vision and improved functionality.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1680028692795,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"b1l4sySbms\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to deliver a modern yet classic aesthetic for the entire apartment that combined the existing design elements with the proposed upgrades. The goal was to combine the dining and living room areas creating a harmonious flow of natural light and air and increase the living space for entertainment. The design solution offered a modernized living room with recessed lighting, custom built-in shelving and an open layout, new flooring, lighting and painting for the entire apartment. The design and architectural teams collaborated to create the best layout to cater to the clients’ preferences. Finally, the choice was made and the clients felt confident in their decision.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1680028355644,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"BxtZtBjFEA\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Anna captured a 360 tour of the apartment to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-03-28 18:52:42','2024-11-03 22:34:05',NULL,'2023-02-01 00:00:00','2023-03-25 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(42,'Upper West Side One-Bedroom Remodel',NULL,1200,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1685576646125,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"bh9VG7Xtky\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We helped the Lee family to renovate their one-bedroom apartment in the prime Upper West Side location. The clients wanted to complete a gut renovation of all rooms, including the kitchen and bathroom remodel. Anna, the project planner, met with the family to capture the vision, timeline, and budget. She understood the goal was to modernize the apartment while improving functionality.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1685576687789,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"a9yS6foPfz\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The construction team spared no detail as they completed the apartment renovation. Every inch, from walls to ceilings, floors to closets, doors to windows, was skillfully revitalized. Thoughtfully organized closets brought harmony and efficiency, while new light fixtures cast a warm and inviting glow. \"}},{\"id\":\"g6XaALmaae\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The kitchen became the family’s favorite with its pristine, all-white cabinets and brand-new stainless steel appliances that gleamed under the gentle caress of sunlight. Accentuating the space were natural wood shelves and hexagon tile backsplash which added a geometric flair, transforming the room into a visual masterpiece.  \"}},{\"id\":\"NfzsJoB037\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the bathroom remodel every fixture, from the bathtub to the toilet, from the vanity to the medicine cabinet, has been gracefully replaced, ushering in an era of modernity and comfort. A light blue accent wall tile harmoniously merged with a sleek glass shower door, resulting in an ambiance that was both contemporary and inviting. \"}},{\"id\":\"4BBlHL2LOk\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In the span of just a few short weeks, the Lee family\'s vision has been brought to life, unveiling a home that is not only a testament to their style but also a space that seamlessly enhances functionality and comfort.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1685576669040,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"cRL8BgUDdf\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design concept was a delightful blend of contemporary functionality and timeless charm, breathing new life into the apartment. With meticulous attention to detail, the kitchen and bathroom were renovated to meet the highest standards of comfort and style. To create a captivating ambiance, the kitchen boasted pristine all-white cabinetry, illuminating the space and enhancing its sense of openness. Complementing the natural herringbone hardwood floors, elegant wooden accent shelves added a touch of warmth and sophistication. In the bathroom, a masterful remodel awaited, featuring sleek modern fixtures and elegant glass shower doors. Adding a stroke of serenity, soft hues of blue adorned the accent wall tiles, inviting a tranquil oasis into everyday life.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1685573894850,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"NxJSFHh0Po\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Anna captured a 360 tour of the apartment to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,7,'2023-05-31 23:56:10','2024-06-25 00:15:48',NULL,'2023-01-01 00:00:00','2023-02-21 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43,'Kips Bay Kitchen and Bathroom Remodel',NULL,200,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1686279135852,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"SUsYDuGHU8\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We helped Miki and David successfully execute a bathroom and kitchen remodel for their Co-op in New York City. The primary objective was to enhance the sense of space, functionality, and style while keeping the project on track and on budget. \"}},{\"id\":\"fQ3lgKmvio\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"To kickstart the project, Anna, the highly skilled project planner, conducted a thorough walkthrough with Miki and David. During the meeting, she captured their vision, outlined a realistic timeline, and carefully considered their budgetary restrictions. \"}},{\"id\":\"EChMlWiZCG\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Anna made sure to grasp their aspirations of modernizing the kitchen and bathroom, aiming to elevate both the aesthetics and practicality while incorporating a bespoke design tailored to their desires.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1686333801275,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"y22weiyTLF\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the building phase, the construction team completed a gut renovation of the kitchen and bathroom, replacing ceilings, walls, floors, and all fixtures. The result was a stunning custom kitchen designed in the Scandinavian style featuring matte grey-green cabinetry, natural wood open shelving, a built-in pantry and appliances, and Vivid White Quartz countertops. The combination of sage base cabinets with grey undertones and modern, natural wood structures created a neutral and earthy impression, while the smooth white wall cabinets and countertops added a sleek and airy touch to the space.\"}},{\"id\":\"pH6xezTj8s\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The bathroom renovation encompassed a full remodel, with all fixtures being replaced. A custom-ordered vanity in a matching grey-green shade was installed, along with the Maiolica White Polished Ceramic Wall Tile and Kohler and Delta fixtures. Within a few short weeks, Miki and David\'s new kitchen and bathroom were transformed to align perfectly with their style and vision, while significantly enhancing functionality.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1686279165201,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"UmhVg89L0X\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to modernize the outdated kitchen and bathroom while maintaining a budget-friendly approach. The clients opted for a Scandinavian style, featuring neutral olive green colors, stone, and natural wood materials. The designers explored various layouts to maximize functionality and accommodate the clients\' preferences, providing Miki and David with multiple options. Eventually, the family made their design choices and felt assured as they entered the construction phase.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1686279141776,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Ltg0G9XF-a\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The planning phase of every renovation project is crucial, and it begins with the guidance of experienced project planners. During the initial at-home visit, Anna diligently captured a comprehensive 360 tour of the apartment, allowing for precise measurements and an expedited project timeline.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,9,'2023-06-09 13:46:05','2024-02-09 21:03:50',NULL,'2023-04-15 00:00:00','2023-05-23 00:00:00',33,53,NULL,NULL),(44,'Jersey City Two Bedroom Remodel',NULL,1023,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1703125268832,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"vtL3uNVbFe\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group recently completed this remarkable condo renovation project in Jersey City, tailored to meet the distinct tastes of a homeowner seeking a space that exudes feminine charm and personalized elegance. This full renovation included a complete overhaul of the look of this home, incorporating the client\'s very specific desires. Our design team worked closely with the client to ensure the alignment of vision and brought to life the dreams of the client.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1704318477028,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"UlWkRl3hH6\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"This comprehensive endeavor focused on transforming the residence, encompassing a full-scale renovation of the kitchen, living room, bedrooms, and two bathrooms. The team meticulously refinished the floors, ceilings and walls - integrating elements that resonated with the homeowner\'s vision for a space that harmoniously blends femininity, class, and timeless elegance.&nbsp;\"}},{\"id\":\"OKeGTwtEdJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The end result is a meticulously crafted home that not only reflects the homeowner\'s individual style but also stands as a testament to Modern Citi Group\'s commitment to delivering sophisticated and personalized living spaces\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1703125463261,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"LnzdqD2_YM\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"To achieve this feminine look, bespoke light fixtures and carefully selected wallpaper were installed to create a refined ambiance. Going above and beyond, the project also incorporated cutting-edge technology, including a smart toilet and bidet.&nbsp; Every inch of space in the home reflects the client\'s exact desires and taste.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1703125785081,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ywvv3iXdoB\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Anna captured a 360 tour of the apartment to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project. As the project progressed, the client was able to keep track of costs and enjoy simulations on her client dashboard. The planning process went smoothly, and the client was very happy with the results.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,3,'2023-12-21 02:31:33','2024-02-09 21:03:50',NULL,'2023-09-01 00:00:00','2023-11-25 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(45,'Roosevelt Island Two Bedroom/Two Bathroom Remodel',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1706824540113,\"blocks\":[],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706826737241,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"g91in5FUjH\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In the construction phase of this 2-bedroom and 2-bathroom remodel, the renovation team executed a comprehensive transformation. The master bathroom underwent a full remodel, while the guest bathroom was revamped. Meticulous attention was given to the kitchen, where a white marble countertop was precisely placed to impart a luxurious aesthetic. The entire apartment saw the revitalization of its hardwood floors through refinishing, complemented by the installation of new baseboards. Furthermore, the team undertook the task of skim coating and painting all walls and ceilings, achieving a fresh and cohesive interior. The collaborative efforts of the renovation team resulted in a fully rejuvenated and aesthetically pleasing living environment.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706825849163,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"9vxMR7eWSI\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"For Modern Citi Group, designing this apartment project centered on delivering an upscale aesthetic for the entire space while adhering to a feasible budget. Our design team worked diligently to strike a balance between elegance and cost-effectiveness, ensuring that the final result exuded a sophisticated ambiance without exceeding financial constraints. Through strategic material selections, creative solutions, and collaborative decision-making with the homeowners, we successfully met the challenge, achieving a high-end look for the apartment within the specified budget parameters.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706825642300,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"mgrnYVcYmg\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the planning stage of the apartment remodeling project in Roosevelt Island, Modern Citi Group collaborated closely with the new homeowners to ensure a tailored and perfect living space. The two-bedroom/two-bathroom apartment underwent a transformation guided by our expert design team. Together, we navigated the selection of materials and aesthetics that resonated with the homeowners\' preferences. The planning process was smooth, resulting in a seamless execution that led to the timely completion of the project, without encountering any issues.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-02-01 22:34:18','2024-02-01 22:55:24','2024-02-01 22:55:24',NULL,NULL,33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46,'Roosevelt Island Two Bedroom/Two Bathroom Remodel',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1706824540113,\"blocks\":[],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706826737241,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"g91in5FUjH\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In the construction phase of this 2-bedroom and 2-bathroom remodel, the renovation team executed a comprehensive transformation. The master bathroom underwent a full remodel, while the guest bathroom was revamped. Meticulous attention was given to the kitchen, where a white marble countertop was precisely placed to impart a luxurious aesthetic. The entire apartment saw the revitalization of its hardwood floors through refinishing, complemented by the installation of new baseboards. Furthermore, the team undertook the task of skim coating and painting all walls and ceilings, achieving a fresh and cohesive interior. The collaborative efforts of the renovation team resulted in a fully rejuvenated and aesthetically pleasing living environment.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706825849163,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"9vxMR7eWSI\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"For Modern Citi Group, designing this apartment project centered on delivering an upscale aesthetic for the entire space while adhering to a feasib