s of the renovation team resulted in a fully rejuvenated and aesthetically pleasing living environment.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706825849163,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"9vxMR7eWSI\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"For Modern Citi Group, designing this apartment project centered on delivering an upscale aesthetic for the entire space while adhering to a feasible budget. Our design team worked diligently to strike a balance between elegance and cost-effectiveness, ensuring that the final result exuded a sophisticated ambiance without exceeding financial constraints. Through strategic material selections, creative solutions, and collaborative decision-making with the homeowners, we successfully met the challenge, achieving a high-end look for the apartment within the specified budget parameters.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706825642300,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"mgrnYVcYmg\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the planning stage of the apartment remodeling project in Roosevelt Island, Modern Citi Group collaborated closely with the new homeowners to ensure a tailored and perfect living space. The two-bedroom/two-bathroom apartment underwent a transformation guided by our expert design team. Together, we navigated the selection of materials and aesthetics that resonated with the homeowners\' preferences. The planning process was smooth, resulting in a seamless execution that led to the timely completion of the project, without encountering any issues.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-02-01 22:40:22','2024-02-01 22:54:46','2024-02-01 22:54:46',NULL,NULL,33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51,'Roosevelt Island Two Bedroom/Two Bathroom Remodel',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Two Bedroom/Two Bathroom Remodel','{\"time\":1706824540113,\"blocks\":[],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706826737241,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"g91in5FUjH\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In the construction phase of this 2-bedroom and 2-bathroom remodel, the renovation team executed a comprehensive transformation. The master bathroom underwent a full remodel, while the guest bathroom was revamped. Meticulous attention was given to the kitchen, where a white marble countertop was precisely placed to impart a luxurious aesthetic. The entire apartment saw the revitalization of its hardwood floors through refinishing, complemented by the installation of new baseboards. Furthermore, the team undertook the task of skim coating and painting all walls and ceilings, achieving a fresh and cohesive interior. The collaborative efforts of the renovation team resulted in a fully rejuvenated and aesthetically pleasing living environment.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706825849163,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"9vxMR7eWSI\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"For Modern Citi Group, designing this apartment project centered on delivering an upscale aesthetic for the entire space while adhering to a feasible budget. Our design team worked diligently to strike a balance between elegance and cost-effectiveness, ensuring that the final result exuded a sophisticated ambiance without exceeding financial constraints. Through strategic material selections, creative solutions, and collaborative decision-making with the homeowners, we successfully met the challenge, achieving a high-end look for the apartment within the specified budget parameters.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706825642300,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"mgrnYVcYmg\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the planning stage of the apartment remodeling project in Roosevelt Island, Modern Citi Group collaborated closely with the new homeowners to ensure a tailored and perfect living space. The two-bedroom/two-bathroom apartment underwent a transformation guided by our expert design team. Together, we navigated the selection of materials and aesthetics that resonated with the homeowners\' preferences. The planning process was smooth, resulting in a seamless execution that led to the timely completion of the project, without encountering any issues.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-02-01 22:41:12','2024-02-01 22:54:56','2024-02-01 22:54:56',NULL,NULL,33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(52,'Roosevelt Island Two Bedroom Remodel',NULL,1119,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1706828006943,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"CL4Kns2yYT\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group remodeled a two-bedroom / two-bathroom apartment in Roosevelt Island. \"}},{\"id\":\"QOUmK9S7Ie\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The new homeowners enjoyed working closely with our design team to create the perfect space. Our designers guided them through the process of choosing materials and the aesthetic that suited them.  The project was completed on time, with no issues.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706828025762,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"0JtIQKoBjM\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In the construction phase of this 2-bedroom and 2-bathroom remodel, the renovation team executed a comprehensive transformation. The master bathroom underwent a full remodel, while the guest bathroom was revamped. Meticulous attention was given to the kitchen, where a white marble countertop was precisely placed to impart a luxurious aesthetic. The entire apartment saw the revitalization of its hardwood floors through refinishing, complemented by the installation of new baseboards. The collaborative efforts of the renovation team resulted in a fully rejuvenated and aesthetically pleasing living environment.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706828017215,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"59sM4WAA1J\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The clients worked closely with the design team to choose materials and the aesthetic they desired. The collaboration between clients and designers was a fun and easy process for all.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1706827446857,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"fwNR6-Uv0q\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"During the planning stage of the apartment remodeling project in Roosevelt Island, Modern Citi Group collaborated closely with the new homeowners to ensure a tailored and perfect living space. The two-bedroom/two-bathroom apartment underwent a transformation guided by our expert design team. Together, we navigated the selection of materials and aesthetics that resonated with the homeowners\' preferences. The planning process was smooth, resulting in a seamless execution that led to the timely completion of the project, without encountering any issues.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,1,'2024-02-01 22:51:45','2024-02-03 17:58:16',NULL,NULL,'2023-12-29 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(53,'Sutton Place Apartment Remodel',NULL,2400,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1708640660142,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"uX3jLDQfHJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group helped Andrew and Malabika in their renovation journey, as they sought to transform their 2,400 sq ft apartment in Sutton Place.\"}},{\"id\":\"2eHWIRc7AD\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"This comprehensive renovation project encompassed both architectural and construction components. On the architectural front, it involved a legal combination of the two units and layout adjustments to enhance the overall functionality, create an open floor plan  and improve the flow of the residence. The construction aspect of the remodel included all areas of the home: the kitchen and dining room, the living room, three bedrooms, the master bathroom, a powder room, and an office/den.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1708703445618,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"FkAn4B99Ke\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"From the moment the permits were approved, our construction team set out to transform every corner of this space. During the building phase, we meticulously refinished floors, walls, and ceilings, replaced doors, and updated electrical and plumbing systems.\"}},{\"id\":\"GOF9UeMlmY\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The main focus of the renovation was to create a seamless flow between the living room, formal dining room, and open kitchen. A stunning waterfall peninsula with pendant lighting, along with Statuario Nuvo Quartz countertop and backsplash, elevated the aesthetics. Matte white cabinetry was added to enhance functionality and storage in the newly remodeled kitchen.\"}},{\"id\":\"8uq7b7eehy\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The three bedrooms were elevated with refinished built-in wardrobes and custom closet solutions, adding both usability and elegance. The fully reconfigured master suite bathroom, included a linen closet, elegant Beckett double vanity, MSI Crystal Bianco wall and floor tile, and high-end Delta and Kohler fixtures.\"}},{\"id\":\"RJKX0GfaPP\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In addition to the comprehensive renovation of the living spaces, we\'ve also transformed the office/entertainment room with the same great attention to detail. Complete with a sleek wet bar featuring a wine fridge, Empira White countertop and backsplash, and a convenient adjacent laundry area with a renovated powder room.\"}},{\"id\":\"DnBbcQnfKp\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In a matter of several months, Modern Citi Group has redefined luxury living through this meticulous remodel, ensuring every inch of the space reflects unparalleled sophistication, modern functionality, and the unique taste of its owners. \"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1708641445812,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"fN3CFq7x57\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Throughout the renovation process, the primary objective remained to modernize the apartment while ensuring it aligned with the family’s lifestyle and needs.&nbsp;The design challenge was to deliver the modern aesthetics and functionality while preserving some of the existing design features.&nbsp;The designers worked on several layouts and design visualizations so they had options. Finally, the choice was made and the family felt confident in their decision.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1708138999012,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"duDGTV5cMo\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Anna captured a 360 tour of the apartment to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-02-22 21:57:37','2024-02-23 15:50:49',NULL,NULL,'2024-01-31 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(54,'Midtown East Alcove Studio Remodel',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1716315014631,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Cphp4sH_yO\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group helped Jane in remodeling her alcove studio in Midtown East. This comprehensive renovation project included a full remodel of the bathroom and kitchen, as well as updates to all rooms and closets. The primary objective was to modernize the apartment while aligning it with the family\'s lifestyle and needs.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1719510712933,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"23855O9bNJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The construction team completely revamped the kitchen, which featured new two-tone cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, elegant Vivid White quartz countertops, and Aria tile backsplash and flooring. Kitchen design finishes echoed the ones in the bathroom creating a cohesive modern look. \"}},{\"id\":\"78EFJPzowq\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Bathroom remodel included converting the tub to a shower, installing a modern wall-mounted vanity, and replacing all fixtures. The shower area showcased an accent black &amp; white Astoria wall tile, perfectly complemented by the subtle stone-looking Aria Ice porcelain tile on the floors and walls in the rest of the bathroom.\"}},{\"id\":\"2kJaghDwkX\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In just eight weeks, Jane and her family received a beautifully renovated, modern apartment with a cohesive style and finishes that fit their lifestyle and expectations.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1716315042053,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"RM3KUfM3ZW\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to deliver modern aesthetics and functionality while keeping the project within budget. The designers worked on several layouts and design visualizations so they had options. Finally, the choice was made and the family felt confident in their decision.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1716309762783,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"X_e_GwIwwE\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. At the at-home visit, Anna captured a 360 tour of the apartment to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project. As the project progressed, the client was able to keep track of costs and enjoy simulations on her client dashboard. The planning process went smoothly, and the client was very happy with the results.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-21 18:11:04','2024-06-27 17:51:54',NULL,'2024-02-20 00:00:00','2024-03-29 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(55,'Murray Hill Office Remodel',NULL,960,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1719269720783,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"nC8UeJ_WS_\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group worked with Robyn on remodeling her newly purchased professional space in Murray Hill. This exciting renovation project included a full remodel of two bathrooms, kitchen, and three offices as well as the main waiting area. The primary objective was to modernize the space for professional aesthetics and functionality while adhering to the strict timeline and budget.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1719323331749,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"J0Jqnjx1bT\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The construction team transformed every corner of the space, breathing new life into it. They replaced the floors, refinished the walls and ceilings, installed new doors and windows, upgraded plumbing and electrical systems, and redesigned the office layout for optimal functionality and flow. Updated closet configuration with custom shelving, light fixtures and sliding barn doors enhanced the ergonomics of the work space. \"}},{\"id\":\"U-SiENlT2f\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The newly remodeled kitchen featured sleek matte white cabinetry and stunning quartz countertops, enhancing both functionality and storage. The bathrooms were masterfully renovated with exquisite new tiling, stylish fixtures, and upgraded plumbing and lighting. \"}},{\"id\":\"loJLlO0Scx\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In just a few weeks, Modern Citi Group has redefined the old apartment, transforming it into a sophisticated and professional space through this meticulous remodel. The result is a stunning blend of style, comfort, and efficiency. This remodel enhanced both employee satisfaction and new business for Robyn. \"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1719265542527,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"km806vxqJi\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The design challenge was to deliver modern aesthetics and functionality for a professional office while keeping the project within budget. The designers worked on several layouts and design visualizations so the client had options. Finally, the choice was made and Robyn felt confident in her decision.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1719265472855,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"4EhVS5ys0S\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every renovation project starts with the planning phase led by the project planners. During the in-person visit, Anna captured a 360 tour of the space to get accurate measurements and fast-track the project as well as align with the client on their design vision, remodeling priorities and budget.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,1,'2024-06-24 20:42:34','2024-06-25 13:48:53',NULL,'2023-06-05 00:00:00','2023-08-16 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL),(56,'Midtown East Two Bedroom Renovation',NULL,1092,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1730311589317,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"OQvJQfnXY1\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Modern Citi Group recently collaborated with Amelia and Jeremy to reimagine their newly purchased Junior-4 apartment with a complete remodel. This exciting renovation transformed the layout to add a second bedroom, a full second bathroom, and an updated kitchen layout. The goal was to create a functional, family-friendly floor plan and a modern, visually appealing space tailored to their lifestyle.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1730311636844,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"_JiN5LDoop\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The construction team brought the design to life, converting the dining room into a second bedroom with a large closet. The kitchen layout was reconfigured to feature an island, additional storage, and ergonomic functionality. We transformed a powder room into a full second bathroom with a walk-in shower and re-purposed the walk-in closet off the primary bedroom into a home office with a built-in desk.\"}},{\"id\":\"IQuVXEb_ZF\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Our professionals refinished floors, walls, and ceilings, upgraded plumbing and electrical systems, and installed additional lighting throughout to optimize flow and functionality.\"}},{\"id\":\"RwjNNtK6XQ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The kitchen featured solid wood cabinetry, quartz countertops, and a porcelain tile floor. Neutral gray-blue cabinets complement the Empira White stone and matte black hardware, creating a sleek, fashion-forward space.\"}},{\"id\":\"y78jbNrGct\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Both bathrooms were reimagined with luxurious new tiling, stylish fixtures, and upgraded plumbing and lighting. The powder room was converted into a full bathroom with a walk-in shower, featuring Arabescato Marble porcelain tiles and Benjamin Moore Palladian Blue walls to unify the kitchen and bath designs. High-quality fixtures from Delta and Kohler added a refined touch.\"}},{\"id\":\"kZXPtytcfh\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In just a few short months, Modern Citi Group transformed an outdated apartment into a sleek, modern home. The remodel beautifully combines style, comfort, and functionality, creating a space that\'s both elevated and efficient.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1730311613263,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Im4kyG_W03\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Our design team faced the challenge of balancing modern aesthetics with a strict budget. After exploring multiple layout options and visualizations, Amelia and Jeremy chose a design they felt best suited their vision.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','{\"time\":1730311602877,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"lZ7MDhWTvn\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Every project kicks off with a thorough planning phase led by our project planners. During an in-person visit, Anna captured a 360° tour of the space, getting precise measurements and aligning with the client’s design vision, priorities, and budget for an efficient start.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.23.2\"}','Modern Citi Group',NULL,NULL,1,'2024-10-30 18:07:55','2024-11-06 19:08:47',NULL,'2024-07-15 00:00:00','2024-09-23 00:00:00',33,NULL,NULL,NULL);
